window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2501,"title":"Chapter 2501: A Great Battle Against a Ninth Half-Emperor","paragraphs":["Chapter 2501: A Great Battle Against a Ninth Half-Emperor","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan knew that there was no benefit in saying more!","The other party definitely had to capture him and obtain the Brahma Tree. Otherwise, they would not let this matter rest.","After all, the Brahma Tree’s mystical power was needless to say. Chu Yunfan, who was only at the eight half-Emperor Stage, was able to fight against Divine Lord Flame with this move.","Such a combat strength jump was enough to shock even Divine Lord Flame.","Even Divine Lord Flame did not inform the others to hunt Chu Yunfan down, wanting to keep all the benefits for himself.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","It was a terrifying scene when a half-Emperor attacked. Every attack could pierce through the sky.","Every time, Chu Yunfan managed to dodge the attacks. Sometimes, the attacks even landed on Chu Yunfan’s body. However, under the protection of his protective barrier, they did not pose any threat to him.","All kinds of attacks landed on Chu Yunfan’s body, but they were all dissolved by the Brahma Tree on his body.","After Chu Yunfan left the Evil Realm, he went straight into the starry sky. Behind him, Divine Lord Flame followed.","After three days, Chu Yunfan entered the depths of the starry sky and could no longer see the Ancient Realm.","There was no doubt about the speed of the two experts who had the combat strength of ninth half-Emperors. They could travel hundreds of thousands of miles or even millions of miles in a second.","Three days was enough for him to completely leave this starry sky.","Moreover, looking at Divine Lord Flame behind him, he did not intend to let Chu Yunfan go at all. Even if he had to chase him to the end of the world, he would definitely not let Chu Yunfan escape.","He believed that Chu Yunfan’s speed was no match for his own. He had barely managed to hold on until now.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan stopped and turned to face Divine Lord Flame.","Divine Lord Flame looked at Chu Yunfan, his entire body emitting an endless cold killing intent!","The killing intent spread throughout the universe. Many comets and broken stars in the nearby asteroid belt were completely shattered by the boiling killing intent.","“Aren’t you going to dodge?” Divine Lord Flame looked at Chu Yunfan. In his opinion, Chu Yunfan must have reached his limit and had no choice but to stop.","After fusing with the Brahma Tree, one’s combat strength would skyrocket. However, no one could maintain such an improvement for a long time.","“I won’t dodge. Since I can’t shake you off, I’ll kill you!” Chu Yunfan stared at Divine Lord Flame. “I haven’t had a battle like this for a long time. Now, before I break through to the ninth half-Emperor Stage, I’ll use you to sharpen my sword!”","“Using me to sharpen a knife? Hahahaha, what a joke!” Divine Lord Flame burst into laughter as if he had heard the funniest joke. He looked at Chu Yunfan as if he was looking at a joke.","“Cut the crap. I’ll kill you today. The Brahma Tree is destined to belong to me!” Divine Lord Flame said coldly.","Boom!","A terrifying energy and blood surged from his body, piercing through the terrifying universe within a radius of a hundred miles.","Around him, the power of the five elements transformed into five powerful ferocious beasts: the azure dragon, the white tiger, the black tortoise, the vermilion bird, and the golden qilin.","These five powerful beasts had suppressed the entire universe and Chu Yunfan’s escape route.","The surrounding space was frozen, and no one was allowed to jump through space. This was Divine Lord Flame’s way of preventing Chu Yunfan from escaping.","Chu Yunfan didn’t care, because this time, he didn’t want to continue running away.","His combat strength was not inferior to Divine Lord Flame’s. The reason why he did not make a move in the Ancient Realm was to prevent Elements Sect’s experts from coming out to stop him.","With Chu Yunfan’s current strength, he had no chance of winning against multiple ninth half-Emperors.","Therefore, he had no choice but to lure Divine Lord Flame out. As expected, Divine Lord Flame did not intend to let him go at all and directly chased after him into the universe.","Divine Lord Flame was also fearless. At his level of cultivation, there were only a handful of people in the universe who could hurt him.","“Let’s see where you can escape to this time!” Divine Lord Flame grinned, his expression extremely cold.","“I don’t need to escape. This time around, I’ll completely end you!”","Chu Yunfan looked at Divine Lord Flame in front of him. In the starry sky of the universe, his domain spread out and became one with the entire universe. The martial will of the Flying Celestial Seal appeared at this time and transformed into a huge galaxy.","The two of them stood in the middle of the huge planets, looking extremely terrifying.","“Hahahaha, end me? You?” Divine Lord Flame laughed wildly and coldly. There was a kind of spirit in the world that said, “Who else but me?”","In fact, it was indeed so. With his cultivation, he was basically only second to the Emperors.","Although he had yet to become an Emperor, he might not necessarily lose to other Emperors of the same level. He was truly a peerless figure in the world.","Boom!","At this moment, Divine Lord Flame took the lead in launching an attack. The power of the five elements transformed into 100,000 swords, which flew toward Chu Yunfan like a rain of swords.","Clang, clang, clang!","Sounds of metal clashing rang out as all the attacks landed on Chu Yunfan’s body, but they were blocked by his emerald green battle suit.","This emerald green armor was none other than the Brahma Tree.","These countless attacks landed on the battle armor formed by the Brahma Tree, but they were unable to break through.","However, the void around Chu Yunfan was torn apart and turned into chaos.","One could imagine how terrifying the 100,000-elemental swords were. It was only because the armor formed by the Brahma Tree was too powerful that it could not be broken.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s body also erupted with a powerful energy and blood that shook the heavens.","The starry sky where he was standing exploded and collapsed.","Chu Yunfan immediately launched an attack. His five fingers clenched into fists and transformed into eight gods.","It was the Eight Astonishing Punches.","Such an attack suppressed the void and directly suppressed Divine Lord Flame.","Boom!","The two sides collided!","The universe was burning fiercely. A ball of flame in Divine Lord Flame’s hand transformed into a peerless saber.","He was using the laws to form a long saber to attack Chu Yunfan.","He was proficient in the power of the five elements. However, he had now transformed into the origin of fire in order to deal with the Brahma Tree.","Even though the Brahma Tree had all sorts of mystical properties, it was only an ordinary wood attribute divine item. It had yet to transcend the power of the five elements.","The impact of the collision of the ninth half-Emperor Stage turned into a light that swept out and shattered the nearby stars.","The two of them could even tear apart a planet with one hand and one foot.","Both sides were like living gods. The full power of ninth half-Emperors was terrifying!"]},{"number":2502,"title":"Chapter 2502: Those Who Block Me Will Die!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2502: Those Who Block Me Will Die!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","A terrifying collision occurred, and blood splattered everywhere. In the starry sky of the universe, it was particularly eye-catching.","Because the blood in the body of a half-Emperor was like a dazzling sun, shining brightly.","Every cell in the body of a top-notch expert was filled with astonishing divinity.","A shocking wound appeared on Chu Yunfan’s body. His chest had been slashed open by the flaming saber, and blood spurted out.","However, Chu Yunfan’s expression did not change at all. He just grinned. Opposite him, Divine Lord Flame also had a fist mark on his chest where Chu Yunfan had almost punched through.","Both sides suffered great losses!","Chu Yunfan was prepared, but Divine Lord Flame was not completely prepared to suffer such a huge loss.","To be precise, he never thought that Chu Yunfan’s attack could hurt him.","After all, in his opinion, Chu Yunfan might be able to compete with him in terms of defense with the protection of the Brahma Tree, but in terms of attack power, Chu Yunfan would not be able to hurt him.","However, at this moment, Chu Yunfan’s actions had given him a hard slap. Chu Yunfan did indeed have the ability to threaten him.","A moment later, the two of them had mostly recovered.","“I didn’t expect you to be able to fight to this extent. You’re indeed amazing!” Divine Lord Flame stared at Chu Yunfan. “But no matter what methods you have, you will definitely die today!”","Divine Lord Flame’s long saber struck the void, causing the universe to tremble. His killing intent was endless.","The entire starry sky was shaking!","This kind of battle strength had already far surpassed that of an ordinary half-Emperor.","A casual slash of his blade could shatter a star, even though he was like an ant compared to a star in terms of size.","However, he could disintegrate a star at the atomic level.","This was the most terrifying part of a half-Emperor. Laws were no longer unfathomable to them, but tools that could crush their opponents.","Divine Lord Flame’s body was covered in flames, turning into a suit of armor. He sneered and rushed toward Chu Yunfan.","However, Chu Yunfan was still fearless. A cauldron appeared in his hand. It was none other than the Mountain River Cauldron.","Chu Yunfan held the Mountain River Cauldron in his hand and smashed it out like a sledgehammer. It could be said to be a violent fighting style.","Boom!","The two sides collided, and a dazzling light burst out. The long saber formed by the flames in Divine Lord Flame’s hand was his half-Emperor artifact. It had been refined for many years and was considered very strong among half-Emperors.","However, the Mountain River Cauldron in Chu Yunfan’s hand was even more extraordinary. Although it was not personally refined by him, it was personally refined by the Alchemy Emperor.","However, after attaining Dao, he had also undergone many times of sacrificial refinement. Even if there was some difference between it and the Mountain River Diagram, it was still above ordinary half-Emperor artifacts.","Of course, the main function of the Mountain River Cauldron was not to fight. Otherwise, he could easily smash the saber in Divine Lord Flame’s hand.","Even so, with the sturdiness of the Mountain River Cauldron and Chu Yunfan’s advantage in physical strength, he still managed to numb Divine Lord Flame’s arm.","“How is this possible? This kind of physical strength!” Divine Lord Flame seemed to be unable to accept that Chu Yunfan could be so powerful.","This wave of exchange had instantly crossed hundreds and thousands of times.","Chu Yunfan immediately understood where his advantage lay.","Compared to Divine Lord Flame’s control of laws, Chu Yunfan, who was only at the eighth half-Emperor Stage, was undoubtedly weaker.","However, in terms of physical strength, Chu Yunfan was not inferior to Divine Lord Flame. Divine Lord Flame had an Emperor physique.","In fact, those who were able to reach the half-Emperor Stage were all Emperor physique possessors.","Unless there were special circumstances, there was no way to break through the limits of one’s talent and become a half-Emperor.","This was the limitation of bloodline. Although it was cruel, it was a fact.","This was no longer something that could be solved with hard work!","This was because those who could cultivate to this level were almost not cunning. On the contrary, each of them worked harder than the other.","Whether it was talent, resources, fortuitous encounters, or other aspects, they were impeccable.","In places like Earth or the Kunlun Realm, any half-Emperor could be considered a chosen one.","In the eyes of ordinary people, he could probably be considered the kind of chosen one who would trip over a top-grade magic artifact whenever he walked out.","However, compared to Chu Yunfan, who had three Emperor physiques, there was no comparison.","Within the same level, Chu Yunfan was almost invincible. Even against Divine Lord Flame, whose level was higher than his, Chu Yunfan still had an advantage.","Therefore, Chu Yunfan immediately chose a battle plan.","In an instant, Chu Yunfan was already in front of Divine Lord Flame.","Divine Lord Flame naturally understood this. When he was fighting Chu Yunfan, he had clearly discovered that his physical body was inferior to Chu Yunfan’s. In addition, Chu Yunfan had the battle armor formed by the Brahma Tree, which was even more impressive than his battle armor.","If they were to fight in close combat, he would be the one at a disadvantage, not Chu Yunfan!","He immediately tried to pull away, but the elemental divine beasts pounced on Chu Yunfan.","The divine beasts were formed from the five elements laws. They ran in the universe with an imposing manner.","“Those who block me will die!” Chu Yunfan shouted and smashed the Mountain River Cauldron down.","Boom!","The white tiger that was like a divine mountain in front of him was smashed into essence on the spot by this cauldron, scattering in all directions along with the laws.","It was formed by the metal laws, so the sky was suffused with golden light.","However, there were still the vermilion bird, the black tortoise, the azure dragon, and the golden qilin in front of him.","At the same time, Divine Lord Flame also took advantage of this thousandth of a second to ignite the flames that filled the sky and swept toward Chu Yunfan like a landslide and tsunami.","Boom!","The terrifying attack instantly drowned Chu Yunfan.","However, these attacks were not able to hurt Chu Yunfan.","In the boundless flames, a huge medicinal cauldron descended from the sky and smashed the vermilion bird to death.","Chu Yunfan revealed his true form. He was tall, slender, and strong like a chaos demon god.","“Impossible!” Divine Lord Flame could not believe that Chu Yunfan was unscathed.","Suddenly, he saw the Mountain River Diagram spinning above Chu Yunfan’s head.","“An Emperor artifact!”","Divine Lord Flame almost spat out a mouthful of blood. Chu Yunfan’s physical body was already very strong. Coupled with the battle armor transformed from the Brahma Tree, it was very difficult to defeat Chu Yunfan.","Now, with the addition of an Emperor artifact protecting him, Chu Yunfan had completely turned into an iron fortress."]},{"number":2503,"title":"Chapter 2503: The Road to Becoming an Emperor Is Broken","paragraphs":["Chapter 2503: The Road to Becoming an Emperor Is Broken","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Up until now, both sides had shown their true abilities!","Divine Lord Flame had never expected Chu Yunfan to be so powerful.","Chu Yunfan was only at the eight half-Emperor Stage, yet he was able to fight against him who was at the ninth level!","Not only was he not at a disadvantage, but he was also extremely wary of Chu Yunfan.","At the same time, what he didn’t expect was that Chu Yunfan had a complete Emperor artifact.","Even with Elements Sect’s foundation, they had seen Emperor artifacts before, but they were basically broken.","This was because behind every Emperor artifact was an extremely powerful top-notch Emperor.","If the Emperor still existed, then the Emperor artifact would not have drifted outside.","And if even the Emperor fell, it would definitely be a fierce battle. There were even many unyielding Emperors who even self-destructed their Emperor artifacts in the end.","It was very difficult to obtain a broken Emperor artifact. Even with his status, he had not been able to obtain a single Emperor artifact in the Ancient Realm.","Not to mention a complete Emperor artifact.","Chu Yunfan had the Emperor artifact Mountain River Diagram, the top half-Emperor artifact Mountain River Cauldron, and the Brahma Tree. Every one of them made his eyes turn red.","“I’ll kill you!” A strong killing intent burst out from Divine Lord Flame’s body.","Only by killing Chu Yunfan could he take everything from him.","The remaining three divine beasts, the azure dragon, the black tortoise, and the golden qilin, flew directly at Chu Yunfan, bringing with them a surge of origin energy in the entire universe.","At the same time, the white tiger and vermilion bird that Chu Yunfan had smashed to death were also recovering.","This was because there were bodies of flesh and blood, but divine objects evolved from legendary laws. This was one of the secret divine powers and techniques of Elements Sect.","The five elements of heaven and earth were one of the most basic laws between heaven and earth, second only to Yin and Yang energy.","Emperor Elements relied on the power of the five elements to achieve Dao. The profound principles contained in it were naturally unimaginable.","Although it could be said that each of the 3,000 Great Dao could reach the height of heaven and earth, these 3,000 Great Daos were divided into superior and inferior ones. Different paths of Dao attainment would ultimately result in completely different strength.","Otherwise, the Emperor Supreme wouldn’t have been able to defeat several Emperors by himself.","The great elements path was one of the most ancient and powerful Great Daos.","“If I kill you, I will have the capital to vindicate dao!” Divine Lord Flame roared as the power of the five elements boiled in his body, transforming into all kinds of attacks that swept out.","“You still don’t understand. Even if you kill me, you will never have the possibility of attaining Dao!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","“What did you say?” Divine Lord Flame widened his eyes.","The Mountain River Diagram above Chu Yunfan’s head kept spinning, resolving all kinds of attacks that swept over, but they did not pose any threat to him.","“I said you’re too naive!” Chu Yunfan smashed down with the Mountain River Cauldron in his hand. The golden qilin was hit and instantly flew away. Its body collapsed and disintegrated in the air.","“You cultivated the Great Dao of Emperor Elements all the way up here. Have you ever had a little of your own Great Dao?” Chu Yunfan shouted. “Since ancient times, there has never been an Emperor with the same Dao. Since Emperor Elements has already achieved Dao, you have already confirmed that it is absolutely impossible to rely on the great elements path to achieve Dao. You don’t even understand this most basic truth, and you still want to achieve Dao? Even if I give you another 10,000 years, you still won’t be able to achieve Dao!”","Chu Yunfan’s words were like a huge bell, instantly shocking Divine Lord Flame.","He instantly thought of many things!","He thought about how many talented geniuses had emerged over the years. In terms of talent, they were not inferior to the Emperors of the past. Emperor physique possessors appeared one after another.","There were even quite a few who were even more outstanding than Emperors of the same age.","However, after so many years, there was actually not a single person who could achieve Dao.","The Ten Great Emperors. After so many years, they were still the Ten Great Emperors. Didn’t this mean something?","He had long been identified to possess the Elements Physique that could vindicate the Dao and become an Emperor. It was the same physique as Emperor Elements.","He had been accepted by Elements Sect since he was young and nurtured as a seed. He had experienced countless battles and had carved out a path for himself from countless geniuses.","He had killed countless Kings of the same generation, even Emperors.","He had broken through to the ninth half-Emperor Stage in the shortest amount of time.","However, after so many years, it had been thousands of years since he had become a half-Emperor. It had been thousands of years since he had reached the ninth half-Emperor Stage, but he had not made any progress.","It wasn’t that he didn’t suspect why he was stuck at the ninth half-Emperor Stage.","However, the others were the same. This also made him relax his expectations of himself. He felt that what he lacked was an opportunity.","However, Chu Yunfan’s words reminded him of the legendary Emperors. It seemed that there were many who had directly advanced from the King Stage to the Emperor Stage within a few decades.","They didn’t hear about the difference!","In terms of cultivation environment, the Ancient Realm was no worse than the antiquity era, but it had never given birth to an Emperor.","In an instant, Divine Lord Flame understood everything. It wasn’t because the environment wasn’t good enough, it wasn’t because they didn’t have enough talent, it wasn’t because they didn’t have enough fortuitous encounters, and it wasn’t because they didn’t have enough resources. There was only one reason: they couldn’t walk their own path.","Every Emperor was a genius who could suppress an era!","It was impossible for him to pick up on others’ wisdom!","Emperor Elements’ elemental arts had allowed him to cultivate until now, but at the same time, it had also limited his progress!","But why had no one ever told him about this? Even Emperor Elements had never mentioned it.","At this moment, he only felt a chill run down his spine. The ten Emperors were like gods high up in the sky, watching those people below the throne struggle bitterly. They just couldn’t reach the same level as them.","They watched as they went the wrong way, but no one ever mentioned anything.","The ten Emperors had formed a tacit understanding in this aspect!","Just thinking about it was terrifying. Why didn’t these Emperors mention it?","Since ancient times, it had been said in the Ancient Realm that as long as one had the same physique as the Emperors, they would have the possibility of achieving Dao.","However, rumors were always rumors and had never been verified.","After the ten Emperors, no one else had attained Dao!","It was a trap that had been planned for a long time!","They only realized this now, but it was too late!","Their Great Dao was already fixed. It was easier said than done to change it!","How many people would have the courage to cultivate anew and cripple their cultivation?","He seemed to have seen a black curtain that had cut off all paths to becoming a Emperor since ancient times!","It had cut off the Emperor path!","However, before he could continue thinking, a huge fist crossed the universe and pierced through his chest."]},{"number":2504,"title":"Chapter 2504: You’re a Scourge! An Unprecedented Scourge!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2504: You’re a Scourge! An Unprecedented Scourge!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Stab!","Blood spurted out from his chest.","Divine Lord Flame suffered a great loss and hastily retreated. He was sent flying for 100,000 miles before he finally regained his footing.","There was a huge hole in his chest, from which blood kept spurting out. The blood flickered with golden divinity.","The newly condensed divine beasts protected him and allowed him to recuperate.","In front of him, Chu Yunfan crossed his arms like a peerless god. The Mountain River Cauldron kept rotating around him, and powerful law power erupted from it.","“Why did you tell me? Why did you tell me?! I’m going to kill you!” Divine Lord Flame roared like an injured beast.","At this moment, his heart was filled with hatred for Chu Yunfan. If Chu Yunfan didn’t point this out, then even when he was about to die, he would still feel that he lacked the most critical opportunity.","But at this moment, he truly understood that it was not that he lacked an opportunity, but that his path was wrong from the beginning.","Although the great elements law was very broad, and even the Great Dao comprehended by each half-Emperor in Elements Sect was different, in essence, it was all included in the great elements path of Elements Master.","Therefore, no matter how they walked, they could not break free from the shackles.","After waking up, it was ten times more painful than when he didn’t know.","Therefore, he hated Chu Yunfan even more and wished he could tear him into pieces!","“Foolish!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Divine Lord Flame lacked the qualifications to attain Dao.","He knew from the memory of the Alchemy Emperor that in ancient times, it was not that there were no Emperors who took the wrong path. However, in the end, they were able to forcefully cut off their own cultivation and start anew.","This was great perseverance!","It was the talent that allowed a Dao Cultivator to truly stand out!","No matter what kind of difficulties they encountered, they would definitely be able to walk on.","At the same time, he opened his eyes and countless information flashed in his mind. He activated his godhead and saw through the great elements path that Divine Lord Flame cultivated.","He was not in a hurry to launch an attack and allowed Divine Lord Flame to recover from his injuries.","However, no one knew that the countless Origin Yang Pills in the Mountain River Diagram had surged into Chu Yunfan’s body. Chu Yunfan’s cultivation was increasing every minute and second.","Every minute and every second, Chu Yunfan was improving his strength, gradually closing the gap between him and Divine Lord Flame, and even surpassing him.","Divine Lord Flame had recovered from his injuries. Although he did not know why Chu Yunfan did not choose to chase after him, he was completely drowned in anger.","The divine beasts attacked Chu Yunfan crazily.","The battlefield between the two sides swept across a radius of millions of miles!","Meanwhile, Chu Yunfan was unflustered. He used the eight heavenly dragons formed by the fist intent of the Eight Astonishing Punches to protect himself.","This was a collision between two completely different Great Daos.","At the same time, the domains of the two sides kept colliding, as if two worlds were constantly colliding and melting.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","All kinds of terrifying attacks erupted in an instant. Two people with the combat strength of ninth half-Emperors were engaged in a shocking battle in the depths of the universe.","In this deathly silent starry sky, no one knew at all.","Chu Yunfan had lured him far away from the Ancient Realm so that he would not have a chance to inform the other people of Elements Sect.","In order to keep all the benefits from Chu Yunfan for himself, Divine Lord Flame naturally would not inform his fellow disciples. Both sides had reached a tacit agreement.","After an unknown period of time, Divine Lord Flame suddenly realized that something was wrong. In the face of his attack, Chu Yunfan changed his aggressive attitude and focused on defense.","At first, he did not notice anything wrong, but now, he finally realized that something was wrong.","Chu Yunfan only defended and didn’t attack, but it didn’t seem like he didn’t have the ability to counterattack at all. Instead, he chose to defend.","After such a long time of attacks, not only did he fail to shake the defense line formed by Chu Yunfan’s eight Heavenly Dragons, but he also found that he had the upper hand in the competition of domains. He suppressed Chu Yunfan with his higher cultivation level.","But now, unknowingly, they were already evenly matched!","Chu Yunfan and his domain each controlled half of the battlefield that spanned millions of kilometers.","This was already very wrong. Chu Yunfan had the advantage in terms of physical strength, but in terms of understanding of laws, he should have the advantage.","When Chu Yunfan saw that Divine Lord Flame had suddenly stopped attacking, he couldn’t help but smile. But it was too late!","Chu Yunfan stomped his feet. In an instant, the power of the five elements actually boiled under his feet. Then, around his body, the divine beasts appeared.","The azure dragon, white tiger, vermilion bird, black tortoise, and the golden qilin!","Not a single one was missing!","“The great elements law?” Divine Lord Flame’s eyes widened in disbelief, thinking that he had seen wrongly.","The fluctuation of the great elements law appeared on Chu Yunfan’s body.","This was the aura of the great elements law!","There were many sects that cultivated the power of the five elements in the world. There were many in the Ancient Realm alone. Elements Sect could not possibly capture all the sects that cultivated the power of the five elements in one go.","However, each sect was different, especially Elements Sect.","He could not sense wrongly. This was the great elements law, the fundamental great law of Elements Sect!","How could Chu Yunfan know the great elements law?","Moreover, to be able to materialize the five divine beasts at the same time, it meant that one had to have at least the comprehension of the half-Emperor Stage.","It would be unrealistic to say that Elements Sect had not spread the great elements law for so many years.","However, it was simply impossible for anyone to cultivate the great elements law to this extent!","Elements Sect would definitely not allow anyone to cultivate to this level.","Divine Lord Flame suddenly thought of a terrifying possibility. That was, Chu Yunfan had actually comprehended the great elements law to such a level in such a short period of time just by watching him attack.","This deduction was shocking and terrifying.","However, no matter how he looked at it, it was the most likely possibility.","After eliminating all the impossibilities, whatever remained was the truth, even if it was impossible.","“You can’t have comprehended it to this extent just by looking, right?” Divine Lord Flame glared at Chu Yunfan and shouted.","“You’re not stupid, after all!” Chu Yunfan grinned and said.","Divine Lord Flame widened his eyes and shouted in horror, “You’re a scourge! An unprecedented scourge! We can’t let you live! You’re a scourge to the world!”"]},{"number":2505,"title":"Chapter 2505: Battlefield Breakthrough, Ninth Half-Emperor Stage","paragraphs":["Chapter 2505: Battlefield Breakthrough, Ninth Half-Emperor Stage","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Now, he finally understood that Chu Yunfan was a great scourge!","He had cultivated the great elements law for so many years to reach this height, but Chu Yunfan had actually reached it in a short exchange. If this was not a monster, what was it?","This was no longer a matter of talent!","Not long ago, with his talent, he had also managed to easily see through the other party’s divine arts and martial arts with a glance and learn them.","However, that was under the condition that his cultivation was still weak.","As his cultivation became more profound, even with the talent of an Emperor, it was impossible for him to easily see through the cultivation technique that the other party cultivated.","Not to mention that it was completely impossible to achieve after cultivating to the half-Emperor Stage.","A half-Emperor was only one step away from Emperors. The laws they cultivated were extremely profound. It was ridiculous to see through the opponent’s trump card through a fight.","However, Chu Yunfan had done such an incredible thing.","That was why he would say that Chu Yunfan was simply a great scourge of the world.","All the cultivation techniques of the various sects would be learned by him. This was undoubtedly a huge problem for the various sects.","That was why he felt that Chu Yunfan was the greatest scourge in the world!","“So what?” Chu Yunfan sneered at Divine Lord Flame. “Today, you will definitely die!”","The divine beasts under Chu Yunfan’s feet grew stronger and stronger. After a moment, it was even bigger than the divine beasts materialized by Divine Lord Flame.","Boom!","After a loud bang, the divine beasts of both sides collided fiercely.","This was a competition of understanding of the Great Dao.","It was hard to tell who was better.","Divine Lord Flame was shocked. He was furious. Chu Yunfan had actually cultivated to such a level just by watching. He was even comparable to him.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan seemed to have a playful heart and actually started a protracted battle with him.","Chu Yunfan’s terrifying physique was fully displayed at this moment. It was difficult to determine who was stronger in the battle with Divine Lord Flame.","The two sides exchanged countless blows in the universe. With their speed, they could exchange thousands of blows every second.","All the stars within ten million miles were shattered by the aftershocks. The chaotic mist was blown out and scattered everywhere on the battlefield.","Divine Lord Flame became more and more frightened as he fought. He felt that it was extremely terrifying because Chu Yunfan’s strength was still increasing.","It was as if Chu Yunfan was breaking through some kind of boundary. That aura was growing inch by inch, and it was extremely terrifying.","After a long time, he finally confirmed a terrifying thing. Chu Yunfan was actually breaking through.","“Breaking through on the battlefield? What do you take me for?!” Divine Lord Flame roared.","The roar shook the entire universe, turning into a terrifying sound wave that shattered everything.","He finally realized why Chu Yunfan’s strength was increasing. It was because he was breaking through to a higher level.","This sounded like a fantasy story. It was simply unbelievable.","In a battle, it could be said to be extremely dangerous. If one was not careful, they could be severely injured.","In such a battle, this was not strange, because their current strength could be said to be similar. If Chu Yunfan was not careful, he might be killed.","However, under such circumstances, Chu Yunfan still dared to break through. He simply did not take him seriously at all.","Boom!","A ball of flames in Divine Lord Flame’s hand transformed into a longbow.","Whoosh!","A loud explosion was heard, followed by an arrow flying across the sky. In an instant, it was heading straight for Chu Yunfan’s head.","Bam!","Chu Yunfan turned his hand and punched the arrow.","In his mind, the godhead was circulated to the extreme. The Origin Yang Pills burned crazily and surged into Chu Yunfan’s body.","It had been a long time since he had tried to break through on the battlefield like this. Under normal circumstances, it was very dangerous, let alone breaking through to the ninth half-Emperor Stage.","Because at that time, the resources on his hands were simply not enough to break through. It was simply impossible to break through in one go.","However, it was different now. He had just harvested countless resources from Evil Gods Creed and could be said to have become rich overnight. He could use Origin Yang Pills at will to help him break through.","Even for the Emperors, Origin Yang Pills were a very important cultivation resource, let alone the half-Emperor Stage.","With so many Origin Yang Pills, it was enough for him to break through to the ninth half-Emperor Stage in one go.","“That’s right, I am breaking through. When I break through, it will be your death!” Chu Yunfan grinned.","The divine beasts under his feet erupted once again and pounced at Divine Lord Flame, suppressing all of his movements.","Divine Lord Flame felt that he could not stop Chu Yunfan even after using all his methods. His domain could not extend to Chu Yunfan at all.","His elemental divine power was also suppressed by Chu Yunfan. He had no way to do anything to Chu Yunfan.","He could only try his best to interfere with Chu Yunfan and let him suffer the backlash of breaking through without permission.","This was his only chance of winning.","At this moment, he was beginning to regret why he had chosen to chase after Chu Yunfan. Now, he was facing a life-threatening situation. This was something he had never thought of before.","At the thought of this, Divine Lord Flame was even more furious!","However, he still felt that he still had a very high chance of winning. It was not that he had not made a breakthrough on the battlefield before. It was just too dangerous. If he was even a little distracted, he might lose his life.","Unfortunately, he didn’t know that Chu Yunfan had a godhead in his body that suppressed his mind. It was impossible for him to be distracted. He could completely multitask.","“Damn it, damn it!” Divine Lord Flame kept roaring. He could clearly feel that Chu Yunfan was getting stronger and stronger. This was the most terrifying thing.","Boom!","After an unknown period of time, a dazzling light rose from Chu Yunfan’s body. Immediately after, a surge of energy and blood rushed into the sky. In an instant, it had already rushed into the starry sky.","Chu Yunfan’s aura increased tenfold in an instant.","In that instant, Chu Yunfan achieved a true breakthrough.","Divine Lord Flame felt an aura that made him feel despair. He could not help but feel extremely desperate.","Before Chu Yunfan broke through, he was already able to contend with him and even gradually gained the upper hand.","Now that he had broken through, it was even more so. His strength far exceeded his imagination.","“How can a ninth half-Emperor be this strong?!” Divine Lord Flame muttered to himself."]},{"number":2506,"title":"Chapter 2506: Killing Divine Lord Flame","paragraphs":["Chapter 2506: Killing Divine Lord Flame","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Divine Lord Flame could not believe it. How could Chu Yunfan be so strong?","He was also at the ninth half-Emperor Stage, so he knew what it felt like to break through to the ninth half-Emperor Stage. It felt like there was a ceiling on top of him.","He could not break through!","He also knew that if he broke through this ceiling, he would be able to break through to the Emperor Stage.","However, he just could not break through this ceiling.","He even felt that with every step he took, the ceiling was getting thicker.","It was as if there was something huge suppressing the ceiling.","He didn’t know what that behemoth was at first, but now he knew that it was none other than Emperor Elements.","Emperor Elements stood in front of everyone. As long as they chose to walk the path of Emperor Elements, they would be suppressed by Emperor Elements.","There was no way for them to break through to the Emperor Stage. This was the so-called one dao suppressing ten thousand dao. If one person achieved dao, then the others could not.","It had the aura of a hundred flowers blooming.","He was unwilling, he was extremely unwilling!","However, Chu Yunfan looked different. He was also at the ninth half-Emperor Stage, but after his breakthrough, he had already surpassed the result of his cultivation for thousands of years.","Chu Yunfan’s ceiling looked much higher.","From the very beginning, Chu Yunfan had avoided this question. From the moment he learned this from the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, Chu Yunfan deliberately walked a completely different path and did not completely follow the Alchemy Emperor’s path.","Otherwise, his cultivation path would be ten times smoother than it was now, or even a hundred times smoother.","However, that was not what Chu Yunfan wanted to pursue. What he wanted was to become an Emperor and eventually a God.","This was also why he hadn’t been completely suppressed by the ceiling after breaking through to the ninth half-Emperor.","“I can’t accept this. This is impossible!” Divine Lord Flame said with reddened eyes.","“Naive!” Chu Yunfan sneered and slapped down.","The hand turned into a huge hand that covered the sky and slammed down on Divine Lord Flame.","The divine beasts around Divine Lord Flame flew into the sky, trying to fight against Chu Yunfan.","But how could they be Chu Yunfan’s match? They were directly shattered into light spots that filled the sky with a slap and turned into laws again.","What an astonishing scene this was.","“Ah!” Divine Lord Flame screamed. He was hit by the palm and his body flew out. The armor on his body was smashed into pieces, saving his life. However, his half-Emperor armor was also shattered on the spot.","Chu Yunfan’s attack was terrifying to Divine Lord Flame.","Spurt!","Divine Lord Flame kept vomiting blood. He stabilized himself in the air and looked at Chu Yunfan in disbelief.","“How is this possible? I don’t believe it. How can you be so powerful? There must be a secret!”","Divine Lord Flame seemed to want to know the secret of Chu Yunfan’s power. Chu Yunfan was too powerful at the moment. It didn’t seem like he had just broken through to the ninth half-Emperor Stage.","He was like a veteran ninth half-Emperor, even beyond the imagination of Divine Lord Flame.","“You’re just trying to stall for time.” Chu Yunfan grinned. “When you secretly sent the message for help just now, did you think I didn’t see it?”","Chu Yunfan had already seen the distress message sent by Divine Lord Flame. When he was sure that he could do nothing to Chu Yunfan, he secretly sent out the distress message.","However, Chu Yunfan was on guard against this move. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have spent so much effort to lure Divine Lord Flame into the depths of the starry sky. It was because even if he sent a distress message to Elements Sect, he wouldn’t be able to get support from Elements Sect so quickly.","Divine Lord Flame seemed to have realized this as well, so he wanted to stall for time. However, this strategy had obviously been discovered by Chu Yunfan.","Divine Lord Flame’s expression changed. He did not expect Chu Yunfan to discover his secret so easily.","“You will die today!” Chu Yunfan snorted coldly.","If it was the original him, Chu Yunfan might have been afraid of Elements Sect reinforcements. However, with his current cultivation, no matter how many people Elements Sect sent, they would just be food for him. He had nothing to fear.","What he was most afraid of was drawing out Emperor Elements in the end. That would not be worth it.","He had gained a lot during this period of time and needed time to digest it. He could not waste too much time on Divine Lord Flame.","This battle had to end quickly!","“Originally, I didn’t have such a fast breakthrough. According to my own estimation, it would take at least ten to twenty years. However, you forced me to use all my potential on the battlefield. I have to thank you for this!” Chu Yunfan grinned.","Divine Lord Flame’s expression froze. He thought that if it were not for his greed, he would not have forced Chu Yunfan to this stage.","He had forced Chu Yunfan to jump from the eighth half-Emperor Stage to the ninth half-Emperor Stage, which indirectly boosted his cultivation.","He hadn’t expected Chu Yunfan to be so abnormal.","First of all, he was only at the eighth half-Emperor Stage, but he was still able to fight against him, who was only at the ninth stage.","Later on, Chu Yunfan broke through his limit on the battlefield and reached the ninth half-Emperor Stage. He was simply a monster among monsters. Divine Lord Flame had never seen such a monster in his long life.","Even in the long history of Elements Sect, such a thing had never been heard of.","At the thought of this, Divine Lord Flame did not dare to stay any longer. He immediately turned around and fled frantically in the direction of the Ancient Realm.","“You want to leave? It’s too late!” Chu Yunfan struck out with a hand seal, and this huge hand seal turned into a huge star in the air.","The huge star slammed down on Divine Lord Flame like a meteor crashing into the Earth.","It was the Flying Celestial Seal!","Spurt!","Divine Lord Flame grunted and spat out a mouthful of blood. Being hit by this slap was no different from being hit by a huge star. His internal organs were bleeding from the shock.","All the power in his body was scattered. In the next moment, it surged into his body.","Bam!","Divine Lord Flame’s body was smashed into pieces in midair, turning into a sea of flesh and blood.","It was extremely tragic. It was estimated that Divine Lord Flame had never been so tragic in so many years.","In the next second, Divine Lord Flame’s body was reassembled. The recovery ability of a ninth half-Emperor was very amazing.","However, his face was extremely pale. Although he didn’t die just now, he was severely injured. His strength had fallen to the eighth half-Emperor Stage.","However, before he could escape, a huge foot appeared out of thin air, carrying endless netherworld water and stomping down ruthlessly.","Bam!","Divine Lord Flame’s body was crushed again, but this time, he did not recover. Instead, he screamed as his soul was crushed to death."]},{"number":2507,"title":"Chapter 2507: The Curtain Falls","paragraphs":["Chapter 2507: The Curtain Falls","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This time, Divine Lord Flame was unable to recover. His vitality had already been exhausted when he recovered just now.","This was the absolute difference in strength.","Even though Chu Yunfan had just broken through, he was still stronger than Divine Lord Flame.","Chu Yunfan was much stronger!","Even without the blessing of the Brahma Tree, Chu Yunfan’s strength was several times stronger than that of Divine Lord Flame.","He had three Emperor physiques, and his every breakthrough was several times more difficult than ordinary people. The Emperor physiques made it even more difficult.","But now, it was time to reap the rewards.","He had just broken through, but he had already broken through to an extremely high level among the ninth half-Emperors.","Now, Chu Yunfan was almost at the peak of the ninth half-Emperor Stage. However, he still felt that he had not reached his limit. He could still make a further breakthrough and not be trapped under the ceiling.","Divine Lord Flame’s future path was being suppressed by Emperor Elements. As long as Emperor Elements was alive, his Great Dao would pose a huge obstacle to the future generations.","Not only when Emperor Elements was alive, but even if Emperor Elements died one day or passed away, his Great Dao would still be there, but it would not be as active as when Emperor Elements was alive.","However, for the latter, it was still an insurmountable ceiling.","Chu Yunfan avoided this question. Even though it was still difficult for him to attain Dao, it was still much better than ordinary people.","“But this is not enough,” Chu Yunfan mused.","Chu Yunfan felt that he had to become stronger. The ninth half-Emperor Stage was his last chance to build his foundation. The stronger he was now, the more powerful he would be when he broke through to the Emperor Stage in the future.","Under such circumstances, Chu Yunfan was not in a hurry to break through to the Emperor Stage. In fact, it was impossible to do so. He needed to work hard.","However, now that he had caused such a huge incident, he was afraid that he would become the common enemy of Elements Sect and Magi Circle.","He didn’t know if those Emperors could figure out that it had something to do with him, especially with the divination art of Emperor Magus of Magi Circle. Even Chu Yunfan had heard of it before. It had been a famous divination art since ancient times.","Therefore, Chu Yunfan had to be more careful.","“I need to become stronger. Fortunately, I still have enough Origin Yang Pills. It’s enough for me to cultivate in seclusion. I don’t need to take the risk to obtain resources for cultivation!”","Chu Yunfan thought that this was the shortcoming of itinerant cultivators. To obtain enough cultivation resources, one had to constantly take risks to obtain them. They could not be like the famous sects that could continuously obtain cultivation resources.","However, once a strong individual appeared among the itinerant cultivators, it would definitely be a powerful individual.","Because the environment that itinerant cultivators faced was far worse than that of disciples from famous sects, those who could make their way out of it were definitely outstanding people.","“Someone’s here?” Chu Yunfan muttered to himself.","He could feel more than a dozen powerful auras coming toward him at an astonishing speed from afar. They were all the auras of Elements Sect’s great elements path. The weakest one was at the eighth half-Emperor Stage, and there were even a few ninth half-Emperors.","It was obvious that they had come personally after receiving Divine Lord Flame’s distress message.","Chu Yunfan paused for a moment and immediately put the corpse of Divine Lord Flame into the Mountain River Diagram. Then, he immediately turned into a beam of light and left.","Although he was not afraid of these people, he was afraid of being entangled by them. Most importantly, the death of Divine Lord Flame might not alert Emperor Elements.","After all, Emperor Elements needed time to absorb Emperor Evil’s Emperor essence. If so many peak half-Emperors died in one go, Emperor Elements would have to come out of seclusion to deal with him no matter how anxious he was.","With Chu Yunfan’s current strength, he was not strong enough to face those powerful Emperors.","When these half-Emperors of Elements Sect arrived, they saw a battlefield full of devastation and chaos.","The stars within a radius of tens of millions of miles were shattered, reduced to the atomic level.","What was even more terrifying was that the entire cosmic space was filled with cracks, and chaotic mist leaked out.","One could imagine how shocking the battle this place had experienced was.","It was completely at the level of ninth half-Emperors!","Only at this level could one cause such great damage to the world.","What shocked them even more was that Divine Lord Flame was not weak even among ninth half-Emperors. How could he be killed in such a short time?","In the starry sky, one could still see the bones and blood of Divine Lord Flame that had been beaten up. One could completely imagine how badly Divine Lord Flame had been beaten.","Through the traces of the battle, these Emperors could even simulate some of the battle situations in their minds.","There was no trace of the opponent’s blood or existence at all. Only the bones and blood of Divine Lord Flame were everywhere. This was the most shocking thing.","“Why do I feel the aura of two types of great elements path?!” a half-Emperor of Elements Sect said in confusion.","He felt like he had sensed something wrong. How could he have sensed the aura of two great elements path?","One was definitely Divine Lord Flame’s, but who was the other?","At this moment, a terrifying guess flashed through their minds. Could it be that the one who ambushed Divine Lord Flame was another half-Emperor of Elements Sect?","If they weren’t a half-Emperor of Elements Sect, how could they have cultivated the great elements path to this extent?","Could it be that members of Elements Sect had been sealed by other half-Emperors of the older generation outside, so they didn’t know about it?","For a moment, countless thoughts flashed through everyone’s minds. However, when they thought that it might be Elements Sect’s own experts who had done it, everyone felt bad.","However, they recalled the information that Divine Lord Flame had sent them. He had said that the enemy had the Brahma Tree, a complete Emperor artifact, and a top-notch half-Emperor artifact, not to mention a series of other treasures.","There were so many good things that even they were envious of. This was the most important reason why they had given up on chasing after Evil Gods Creed’s experts and rushed over.","Otherwise, even if someone came to save Divine Lord Flame, there would not be so many people.","If that was really the case, then it was not impossible for the other party to silence him.","“After them! We must find this person! They dared to kill our Elements Sect’s Grand Elder! No matter who they are, they must die today!” one of the half-Emperors of Elements Sect roared.","The other half-Emperors of Elements Sect also nodded their heads. Whether it was for the good stuff mentioned by Divine Lord Flame or for the safety of Elements Sect’s Grand Elders, they would never let this audacious person go."]},{"number":2508,"title":"Chapter 2508: Evil Gods Creed’s Destruction, the Central Plains’ Crisis","paragraphs":["Chapter 2508: Evil Gods Creed’s Destruction, the Central Plains’ Crisis","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the Ancient Realm, the earth-shattering news of Evil Gods Creed’s destruction lasted for a full ten years before it gradually came to an end.","The truly decisive battle had come to an end ten years ago, when the Emperors had besieged Emperor Evil.","Evil Gods Creed was destined to fall!","However, everyone thought this was just the beginning of Evil Gods Creed’s fight.","In the beginning, no one believed this!","How powerful was Evil Gods Creed? It had stood in the Ancient Realm for many years, but there had never been any news of Evil Gods Creed being destroyed. There had never even been such a storm.","Because no matter what kind of storm it was, as long as Emperor Evil behind Evil Gods Creed made a move, it would be pacified.","There wasn’t any storm that a Emperor Evil-level expert couldn’t calm down!","The Ten Great Forces had been standing above the Ancient Realm since ancient times, and none of them had ever been destroyed.","The ten great forces were unshakable. This were permanent fictures. This was the thought in everyone’s mind.","However, Evil Gods Creed’s destruction had happened so suddenly.","And all of this was due to the four Emperors attacking Emperor Evil.","All kinds of rumors were spreading, saying that four Emperors had tried to kill Emperor Evil. However, no matter what version of the legend it was, Emperor Evil had always escaped after being severely injured.","The Emperors could not be defeated. Only another Emperor could defeat an Emperor, let alone the siege of the four Emperors.","The news of four Emperors attacking Emperor Evil and the latter escaping into the depths of the starry sky caused an uproar in the entire Ancient Realm.","It shocked the other five Emperor legacies who had yet to participate in this matter.","For a time, the entire Ancient Realm was plunged into a bloody storm. Countless forces surrounded Evil Gods Creed like sharks that had smelled blood.","After the four Emperors had taken a portion of Emperor Evil’s Emperor essence, they went back into seclusion to digest what they had gained.","What was left was the encirclement of Evil Gods Creed by many half-Emperors. With Evil Gods Creed’s accumulated foundation, even if they were surrounded for many years and chased by many half-Emperors, they still possessed extremely powerful strength. There were not just one or two half-Emperors.","In the area ruled by Evil Gods Creed, it could be said that it was difficult to part with each other, setting off a bloody storm.","The slaughter continued for a full ten years. Faced with the crazed encirclement of the various factions in the Ancient Realm, even with Evil Gods Creed’s foundation and strength, they could not hold on any longer and gradually declined.","After the last half-Emperor of Evil Gods Creed was killed in a valley, Evil Gods Creed’s power on the surface was completely destroyed.","Even though the remaining members of Evil Gods Creed had gone underground and were still resisting, to the various major factions, the battle to destroy Evil Gods Creed was basically over.","The remaining members of Evil Gods Creed didn’t even have a single half-Emperor on the surface. Even if there were some top experts at the half-Emperor level in the dark, it was meaningless to all the experts in the world.","Evil Gods Creed could no longer turn things around. Even if it was reestablished, it could no longer become an Emperor legacy. If it did not become an Emperor legacy, it would be meaningless to many factions.","The only way for Evil Gods Creed to rise again was that Emperor Evil was reborn and return in a powerful manner.","However, everyone knew this was impossible.","After all, Emperor Evil was very old, and everyone knew that he had only been able to survive since ancient times by sealing himself.","The Emperors behind the ten forces were all similar.","Moreover, Emperor Evil had been severely injured by the four Emperors and his Emperor essence had been stolen from him. It was not easy for him to survive. It was impossible for him to return to his peak state.","Birth, aging, illness, and death were the normal states of life. No life could escape this law. It was just a matter of time.","Everyone knew that Evil Gods Creed was finished!","For a full ten years, everyone had been frantically exterminating Evil Gods Creed while plundering all kinds of resources from Evil Gods Creed.","After ten years of chaotic warfare, when the dust finally settled, everyone was satisfied.","After all, everyone had benefited greatly from the collapsed corpses of Evil Gods Creed, and they had eaten their fill.","At the same time, expeditionary forces were constantly on expeditions to the starry sky to eliminate Evil Gods Creed’s last stronghold.","In the starry sky of the universe, there were different planes. Many forces knew this. Many forces would even send experts to station there and extract resources from those dimensions, half-dimensions, and planets to continuously supply the forces in the Ancient Realm.","There were even many forces that had passed down their orthodoxies in those dimensions, half-dimensions, and planets. They could continuously collect geniuses from these worlds to enrich their forces.","This was a very common thing in the Ancient Realm!","This was what Evil Gods Creed did. In the outer realms, there were still many worlds and interdimensional spaces occupied by Evil Gods Creed. Through the information obtained from Evil Gods Creed, each force began to step onto a star path, removing Evil Gods Creed’s last stronghold and thoroughly understanding Evil Gods Creed’s influence.","Above the Central Plains, an endless army seemed to blot out the sun as it descended from the void, surrounding the Imperial Capital.","The pressure that seeped out from the endless army almost forced the residents of the Imperial Capital, who were protected by the barrier, to kneel down. It was even impossible for them to move.","Even the Kings who were guarding the Imperial Capital felt their bodies stiffen and could not move at all. They did not even dare to look at the endless army in the sky.","It was as if there were endless ferocious beasts hidden within, and one would lose their souls just by looking at them.","At this moment, only three half-Emperors were still standing.","They were also the three experts who currently dominated the Central Plains.","The human king of the people, the Elder Princess, and Gushe Princess, Tang Siyu.","After Chu Yunfan left, these three masters had become the top masters of the Central Plains. They were all at the half-Emperor Stage. The human king was at the third half-Emperor Stage. The Elder Princess and Princess Gushe, Tang Siyu, were at the peak of the second half-Emperor Stage. They were only half a step away from the third level.","However, at this moment, their expressions were incomparably grave. There were countless experts in the skies above the King Stage. Ordinary people could not see clearly, but they could see just how many Kings were hidden within this endless army. There were far more Kings than all the Kings of the Central Plains combined.","Even though the Central Plains had sent out many Kings over the years, they were still far from being able to compare to the Kings of this army."]},{"number":2509,"title":"Chapter 2509: The Emperor Skyquake Monster Army, the Luck Dragon’s Defeat","paragraphs":["Chapter 2509: The Emperor Skyquake Monster Army, the Luck Dragon’s Defeat","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Not to mention the half-Emperors. The Central Plains’ three experts had sensed many of them who were on par with them, and many of them were far stronger than them.","Even though they were experienced and knowledgeable, they still felt a little suffocated!","They had never thought that there would be so many half-Emperors!","“The outer realm is truly a terrifying place!” The human king’s expression was solemn as he looked up at the sky.","He knew that Chu Yunfan had left the Central Plains to investigate the power behind the Evil Gods.","From that moment on, he knew that there were other worlds besides the Central Plains.","In addition, that world was probably far more powerful than the Central Plains, but he wasn’t sure what kind of power that world possessed.","If Chu Yunfan hadn’t returned in time, he would have been killed by that Evil God.","He once thought that his cultivation was already very strong and not inferior to the Evil Gods.","However, when he saw the endless army, he realized that he had thought too simply about that world.","Originally, he had thought that that world was at most twice as powerful as the Central Plains.","But in truth, it was countless times stronger than the Central Plains!","The strength they possessed was not something the Central Plains could compare to!","Any one of these powerful half-Emperors could easily destroy the entire Central Plains.","Among them, he also saw a few familiar faces. They were the King monsters that had recently appeared among the monsters.","The few newly risen King monsters of the monster race had joined the crusade!","It could not be said that it was weak!","This was because these new enemies were all monsters!","Judging from their conversation, it was a force under the command of Emperor Skyquake Monster!","A true Emperor!","Thinking of this, even the human king could not help but change his expression.","Because he was already a half-Emperor, he knew the difference between a half-Emperor and an Emperor. It was like the difference between heaven and earth.","If he were to face a true Emperor, he would have no chance of winning!","The other party could easily crush him with just a little finger!","Let alone the legendary Emperor Skyquake Monster, even this army could destroy the Central Plains a hundred times over!","Clearly, just like the Evil Gods behind the Hus of the northern grasslands, the demi-humans of the Central Plains also had their own backers.","During this period of time, the monsters had been bullied badly. They were trembling under the might of the humans. Now that they finally saw their own people, they were extremely excited. They were just short of snot and tears.","There was absolutely no possibility of reconciliation between the humans and the monsters.","The Evil Gods had needed to capture humans and transform them into Hus. They needed to slowly drain the blood of Grand Xia to satisfy their long-term interests.","However, these monsters were different. They clearly did not have any scruples.","“Princess Gushe, the Elder Princess and I will hold them back for you. Hurry up and find King Chu. Let him avenge us one day!” the human king said with a solemn expression.","The Elder Princess looked at Tang Siyu kindly. “Go. We will hold them back. If you stay any longer, even the Luck Dragon won’t be able to hold out!”","For the Elder Princess who had never married, Tang Siyu, her last disciple, was undoubtedly no different from being her daughter.","At this moment, they were still able to talk because the Luck Dragon of the human race was firmly resisting the pressure above the Imperial Capital, buying them time.","The originally very lively Luck Dragon was now firmly suppressed above the Imperial Capital. Even its originally arrogant head had no choice but to lower. It was slowly suppressed by the aura of an even stronger expert.","During this period of time, the humans had unified the world, and the Luck Dragon had grown a lot on this foundation. It was at least several times stronger than before.","However, it could not withstand the pressure of so many top-notch experts.","When Tang Siyu heard this, she bit her lower lip slightly. Her eyes were red as she stared at the endless figures of the experts in the monster energy that blotted out the sky.","Although these experts maintained their human forms, the phantoms behind them revealed powerful and ferocious monsters. Each of them was like a prehistoric beast, baring their fangs and brandishing their claws. They looked extremely terrifying.","An ordinary person would be scared out of their wits just by looking at them.","She knew that there was no point for her to stay. If she didn’t leave, it would only lead to death.","“Master!” Tang Siyu was extremely reluctant.","The Elder Princess smiled and said, “I have lived enough in this life. I have explored the limits of the Great Dao, and you have inherited my mantle. However, you have not found a disciple to inherit my mantle, so you cannot die. You have to live well!”","“Yes, Master!” Tang Siyu finally nodded and did not dwell on this issue.","“You want to leave?” Suddenly, an extremely cold voice came from the void. Immediately after, a sharp claw clawed out from the void and grabbed the Luck Dragon above the Imperial Capital.","The Luck Dragon roared and struggled, but it was useless. It was caught in the claw on the spot.","In the face of that huge claw, it was like a struggling loach, unable to retaliate at all.","Everyone instantly felt as if their necks were being grabbed. It was extremely uncomfortable and they were almost suffocating.","The Luck Dragon was closely related to everyone. It was the Luck Dragon of the entire human race. The Luck Dragon was condensed from the luck of countless humans.","Now that the Luck Dragon had been captured, it was as if their luck had been stuck.","In the void, a pair of cold and merciless eyes could be vaguely seen. They looked at everyone below coldly as if they were looking at a group of dead people.","“D*mn it!” the human king roared.","Suddenly, the huge claw exerted force, and the Luck Dragon screamed. It was crushed in the air and turned into golden light that scattered in all directions.","Spurt!","Instantly, all the humans in the world spat out a mouthful of blood at the same time. From the human king to the newborn children, all of them spat out a mouthful of blood and were seriously injured.","The Luck Dragon was the foundation of the human race. Now that the Luck Dragon had been destroyed, one could imagine what would happen to the human race.","Their luck would be reduced to the minimum in the shortest time possible. In that case, even if they were not killed by the army under Emperor Skyquake Monster, they would enter a period of unprecedented catastrophe.","All kinds of earthquakes, volcanic eruptions, and comet collisions would happen in a short period of time. It would be the end of the world."]},{"number":2510,"title":"Chapter 2510: Chu Yunfan Appears, Slaying the Demons’ Half-Emperors","paragraphs":["Chapter 2510: Chu Yunfan Appears, Slaying the Demons’ Half-Emperors","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","If the human race was compared to a person, if the Luck Dragon was crushed, it was equivalent to that person’s luck being exhausted. What followed was a period of bad luck.","Drinking cold water would cause one’s teeth to be stuck, walking out of the door would cause one to be hit by a car, and staying at home would cause one to be shocked to death by an earthquake.","The human king’s expression changed at the thought of this terrifying consequence!","This was something unprecedented for the human race. No matter how intense the battle was before, there had never been such a situation!","He turned his head to look. At this moment, the entire Imperial Capital was filled with bad luck!","The residents who were originally in the Imperial Capital were directly protected by the Luck Dragon. It could be said that they were all elites and talents. Only those with good luck could be born in the Imperial Capital.","Everyone had a lot of luck above their heads!","However, this luck seemed to have been flattened by a sword and disappeared without a trace.","Everyone was frowning deeply. This was a sign that a great disaster was coming!","Even the human king, the Elder Princess, Tang Siyu, and other cultivators could feel the influence of luck.","Only by becoming an Emperor would one be able to completely transcend the influence of a race’s fate. Even if the race was destroyed, it would not affect an Emperor in any way.","This was because an Emperor was the root cause of the race’s strong luck, not the other way around.","This was fundamentally different!","However, these half-Emperors didn’t have the cultivation to break free from this influence!","It was impossible for them to escape at this moment. Even if they did, it would be useless. With how unlucky they were, they would not be able to fly far. They would definitely crash into the monster army.","They could imagine all kinds of strange ways to die!","After the sharp claw crushed the Luck Dragon to death, it did not stop. Instead, it slapped down on the Imperial Capital.","Boom!","With a loud bang, the barrier above the Imperial Capital, which was reinforced by the human king and could even resist the attacks of ordinary half-Emperors, was easily shattered like a piece of paper.","After shattering the barrier, this sharp claw directly grabbed at the human king and the others on the spot.","In the vast Imperial Capital, the only ones who could pose a slight threat to the army of Emperor Skyquake Monster were probably the human king and the other experts of the half-Emperor Stage.","For a moment, everyone screamed!","The human king, the Elder Princess, and Tang Siyu automatically formed the Three Talents Formation and erupted with terrifying attacks, wanting to block this huge claw, but it was useless.","Their resistance only lasted for a moment before it was shattered on the spot.","The three of them were heavily injured and coughed up blood as they were sent flying. They fell to the ground and smashed the buildings into pieces. Everything within a radius of several miles was turned into dust.","The giant claw did not slow down and grabbed toward the three of them.","‘My life is over!’ The human king closed his eyes.","Facing such a terrifying existence, even with his will, the human king felt despair. The difference in cultivation between the two was too great. He could not even hold out for a moment.","This was even more terrifying than the Evil Gods.","Although he had vomited blood when he fought with the half-Emperor Evil God, he could still exchange blows with it.","The other party’s strength was still within his understanding.","However, the strength of the monster expert behind the scenes had far exceeded his understanding. They were experts of a different level.","Suddenly, he heard a burst of exclamations from the crowd. The sharp claw that was about to grab him was shattered by a sword light in the air.","Boom!","The giant hand collapsed in the air, turning into spirit energy that filled the sky and dissipated in the air.","“Who is it?” The expert behind the scenes in Emperor Skyquake Monster’s army was very angry and looked directly at the void.","Above the endless Emperor Skyquake Monster army that covered the sky, a proud figure stood between heaven and earth with his arms crossed. His tall and straight figure was like a legendary god.","“It’s King Chu!” someone in the Imperial Capital shouted, and the entire Imperial Capital was in an uproar.","They saw the person through the huge hole that the sword light had created in the Emperor Skyquake Monster army.","Who else could it be but Chu Yunfan?","Everyone in the Imperial Capital cried tears of joy!","They didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to arrive at the critical moment when they were feeling hopeless.","When the King monsters of the Central Plains saw Chu Yunfan, they felt their hearts shatter.","Compared to the experts under Emperor Skyquake Monster, they could be said to be living under Chu Yunfan’s shadow.","Even when Chu Yunfan swept across the world, they hadn’t become Kings yet!","They had all witnessed how Chu Yunfan swept across the world, wiping out the Hus and the barbarians, then crippling the marine folks and monsters, forcing them to serve the humans.","It could be said that in their hearts, Chu Yunfan was the number one person in the world!","Just thinking about it made their heart break!","But now, they remembered that they were under the protection of the Emperor Skyquake Monster army, so they had nothing to be afraid of.","“It’s him. He killed countless members of our monster race and forced us to become slaves of the humans!”","These King monsters pointed at Chu Yunfan and roared.","“How dare you make us monsters slaves to you lowly humans. Today, I’ll skin you alive!”","At this moment, a half-Emperor under the command of Emperor Skyquake Monster roared and transformed into his original form. It was a wild boar covered in long hair. It was thousands of feet tall. However, this wild boar had six legs and a pair of wings. It was obviously not an ordinary creature.","It was similar to the Ten Ferocities that ran amok in the immemorial era.","Those archaic vicious beasts were like this. They were born with strange appearances and were extremely powerful.","This monster race’s half-Emperor obviously had the bloodline of one of the Ten Ferocities. It was extraordinary.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t have been able to cultivate to this level!","In monsters, birth and bloodline were important. It was even more exaggerated than the human race. Different bloodlines and different origins determined the future achievements of a monster.","To be able to cultivate to the level of a half-Emperor, one must be a beast with the bloodline of a Ferocity. It couldn’t even be a branch. It must be a direct descendant of a Ferocity.","Many of them were even the legitimate children of a Ferocity, but they were sealed in the distant era before they were excavated and revived in this era.","Swoosh!","Everyone saw Chu Yunfan raise his palm high up and a sword light of over ten thousand feet slashed down. The head of the powerful demon pig was cut off, and its huge body fell into the Imperial Capital, creating a huge pit. The blood of a half-Emperor splashed out."]},{"number":2511,"title":"Chapter 2511: Unrivalled, Killing Half-Emperors Like Killing Ants","paragraphs":["Chapter 2511: Unrivalled, Killing Half-Emperors Like Killing Ants","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was just a simple sword light!","A powerful half-Emperor monster was killed on the spot!","Everything was so simple!","The monsters of the Central Plains were dumbfounded. They had not expected that the backer they had just found would be so weak.","That was a powerful half-Emperor, even surpassing the number one expert in the Central Plains, the human king.","However, it was useless against Chu Yunfan’s sword.","He was killed by a single strike!","Chu Yunfan killed a half-Emperor like he was killing an ant!","If they hadn’t seen it with their own eyes, they wouldn’t have believed it!","Especially in the Central Plains, there were only three known half-Emperors. Other than Chu Yunfan, who had left, there were only the human king, the Elder Princess, and Tang Siyu.","It could be said to be extremely rare!","Even though there were many geniuses who had entered the King Stage, there were still only three who had entered the half-Emperor Stage.","In their eyes, half-Emperors were top-notch experts.","But now, when they saw a half-Emperor being killed by a single sword strike, they felt like their worldview had collapsed.","It was as if a half-Emperor was just an ordinary creature.","That was the most terrifying thing!","It seemed that Chu Yunfan’s strength had not weakened after leaving for so many years. Instead, it had become even more terrifying.","After leaving the Central Plains, Chu Yunfan was like a dragon returning to the sea, growing at an astonishing speed.","In the end, the Central Plains became a shackle that restricted Chu Yunfan’s growth!","“Roar!”","“Roar!”","“Roar!”","At this moment, furious roars erupted from the Emperor Skyquake Monster army. The roars turned into a terrifying impact barrier that spread in all directions.","The monster army could not be controlled at all and flew toward Chu Yunfan.","At the same time, the Mountain River Diagram was spinning above Chu Yunfan’s head, and the Mountain River Cauldron was in his hand.","In an instant, the Mountain River Cauldron was in his hand, and he smashed it down.","Boom!","The Mountain River Cauldron smashed into the void.","In the Imperial Capital, everyone only saw the sky and earth crack. It was a true collapse of the sky and earth. The chaos of the entire world was beaten out.","The Mountain River Cauldron smashed down, turning into golden light that filled the sky. Wherever the light passed, all the demon armies that pounced on it were instantly reduced to nothingness.","They evaporated into particles.","When everyone saw this scene, it was as if they had seen a ghost.","Even a few half-Emperor monsters were killed, let alone ordinary Kings. They didn’t even have time to scream.","Those countless golden lights were the laws of the Great Dao that Chu Yunfan had comprehended himself.","Chu Yunfan didn’t stop after the attack. He tore through space and arrived in front of a half-Emperor.","The half-Emperor didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to be able to tear open space and appear in front of him in an instant. He wasn’t prepared at all.","Chu Yunfan’s hands emitted a golden light. He tore the half-Emperor monster that was as huge as a huge city apart. Then, the monster’s body turned into a rain of blood that filled the sky.","In the next moment, countless thunderbolts erupted from Chu Yunfan’s body. Even the dense and endless Emperor Skyquake Monster army lost a large portion of its troops.","Those who were engulfed by the lightning instantly evaporated.","This army, which was enough to wipe out the entire Central Plains, was completely useless in front of Chu Yunfan’s lightning.","It could even be said that it was useless. Those thunderbolts were the laws transformed by Chu Yunfan.","This time, Chu Yunfan didn’t dodge. The Mountain River Diagram above his head spun and absorbed all the attacks. It even absorbed all the energy in these attacks and turned them into his own.","The void under his feet transformed into a large array. The endless lightning in the array transformed into lifelike lightning dragons. These lightning dragons danced in the sky. Every second, hundreds of thousands of demon troops were annihilated by Chu Yunfan.","This efficiency was very shocking. Even if there were a large number of them, the monster army that covered the sky could not withstand such a shocking consumption.","Not to mention that this army was one of the elite armies under the command of Emperor Skyquake Monster. Under normal circumstances, they would not appear here and would only guard Emperor Skyquake Monster’s Emperor Monster Realm.","It was only this time that they had made a special move to divide the worlds left behind by Evil Gods Creed. In a short period of time, they had already pacified several worlds and turned them into a monster paradise.","The destruction of such an army of monsters would have dealt a heavy blow even to the forces under Emperor Skyquake Monster’s command.","At this time, the experts in the army could no longer hold it in. They screamed and lunged at Chu Yunfan.","Ordinary Kings did not dare to approach. They could not even withstand the lightning emitted by the countless lightning dragons around Chu Yunfan. They would be vaporized in an instant.","A terrifying half-Emperor that had transformed into a giant wolf suddenly flew over and streaked across the sky. Every second, the world shook violently.","Bam!","However, before he could reach Chu Yunfan, he was sent flying by a lightning dragon’s huge tail. He coughed up blood and retreated.","Before he could recover, another lightning dragon wrapped itself around the giant wolf at lightning speed.","The giant wolf screamed and roared, but it was useless. It was directly strangled to death and turned into a bloody mist that filled the sky.","In front of Chu Yunfan, even this terrifying giant wolf that shook countless worlds did not have any sense of existence.","Suddenly, at this moment, many more half-Emperors flew toward Chu Yunfan.","However, Chu Yunfan did not waver at all and allowed them to attack.","When their domains came into contact with Chu Yunfan’s lightning domain, they were instantly defeated. Their bodies were also entangled by the countless lightning dragons produced by Chu Yunfan’s lightning domain, and they died one after another. Their huge bodies fell and smashed into the barrier above the Imperial Capital.","Fortunately, the human king and the others all made their moves, preventing these huge bodies from smashing the citizens to death.","The strength of the human king was not useful in such a battle, but it was enough to act as a scavenger.","“King Chu is even stronger than before!” the human king said emotionally. “It’s as if he’s already stepped into the legendary Emperor Stage!”","Of course, the human king only said that it seemed like it, because if it was really an Emperor, with a single slap, this countless army would have died. There was no need to go through so much trouble.","But even so, in his eyes, Chu Yunfan was only one step away."]},{"number":2512,"title":"Chapter 2512: King Hatred Monster","paragraphs":["Chapter 2512: King Hatred Monster","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Such strength was simply something they needed to look up to!","This was especially true for the human king. There was once a time when the strength of the human king was not much different from Chu Yunfan’s strength. Although there was a gap, it was also a gap that could be seen at a glance.","But now, it was completely different!","Chu Yunfan rode away, and he couldn’t even see the taillights!","He could not help but sigh in his heart.","How long had Chu Yunfan been gone?","His progress was already considered extremely fast. His level was comparable to Chu Yunfan’s before Chu Yunfan left the Central Plains.","He was waiting for Chu Yunfan to come back and give him a scare.","Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan would be this strong!","Seeing Chu Yunfan’s current prestige, even someone with a strong state of mind like the human king couldn’t help but have the thought of exploring the myriad worlds.","After cultivating to the third half-Emperor Stage, he could clearly feel the existence of a ceiling. There was no way to break through this ceiling.","Because this was the limit of the Central Plains. If he wanted to break through here, he would have to destroy the entire world.","Even if he could do it, he didn’t want to do it. After all, the Central Plains was his home, his foundation, and he would never destroy it.","Moreover, Chu Yunfan had pointed out another path for him, which was to leave the Central Plains and walk into other worlds.","With the human king’s talent, he was able to cultivate to this level in the Central Plains, let alone in the Ancient Realm. He naturally had his own confidence.","At this moment, in the sky, Chu Yunfan walked step by step toward the top expert who was guarding the Emperor Skyquake Monster army.","Only a pair of crimson eyes floated outside, and his entire body was hidden in a ball of black fog.","This was the final and most terrifying existence.","Even if the entire Emperor Skyquake Monster army was wiped out, as long as he was still around, he could easily massacre the humans of the Central Plains.","Just now, the Luck Dragon of Grand Xia was easily crushed by him.","“Human, you are courting death!”","At this moment, a cold voice came from the black fog, but there was a hint of doubt in the voice.","Chu Yunfan’s goal was obvious. It was him.","If it was any other situation, he would not have put the other party in his eyes at all.","With his cultivation, he could only meet his opponent in the Ancient Realm. There was no other world, planet, or interdimensional space that could nurture a ninth half-Emperor.","This was determined by the world’s restrictions.","These half-Emperors would either die of old age in their own world or enter the Ancient Realm according to various hints. Only then would they be able to further improve their cultivation.","However, he seemed to have encountered an exception here. This Chu Yunfan could actually cultivate to such a level, but he seemed to have never heard of this person’s existence in the Ancient Realm.","Even in the Ancient Realm, ninth half-Emperors were the most powerful existences. Any one of them had shocking strength. Even if ordinary people didn’t know about it, the experts of Emperor Skyquake Monster’s forces knew about it because they were collecting information about it all the time.","“I think you guys are the ones who are courting death!” Chu Yunfan sneered and said, “Today, none of you can leave. All of you will die here!”","As soon as Chu Yunfan finished speaking, he waved his hand and a lightning sword light flashed out. A monster expert at the eighth half-Emperor Stage was pierced through the head and his body fell down like a small mountain.","“Roar!” Finally, a figure in the black fog could not hold it in anymore.","In an instant, a demonic claw reached out from the black fog and grabbed toward Chu Yunfan.","The flickering light on the demonic claw pierced through eternity and directly illuminated the world.","The terrifying pressure instantly suppressed the experts in the Imperial Capital, causing their expressions to change.","What a terrifying scene!","The strength of this expert far surpassed that of the other half-Emperors. It was obvious that they were not the same person.","“Lord Chu will definitely be able to deal with him!”","In the Imperial Capital, many people prostrated themselves on the ground and prayed, hoping that Chu Yunfan could kill this terrifying monster.","This monster expert had already reached a terrifying level. Even if they used countless methods, they were still not his match. It was meaningless to have more people.","Chu Yunfan held the Mountain River Cauldron and smashed it down.","Clang!","With a loud boom, the demonic claw and the Mountain River Cauldron collided, creating a soul-stirring collision.","Boom!","The demonic claw was smashed into pieces by Chu Yunfan, and blood splattered everywhere.","“Ah!” The owner of the demonic claw could not help but scream. Their demonic claw was blasted apart in the air.","“Show yourself! What are you hiding for?!” Chu Yunfan shouted and smashed the Mountain River Cauldron down.","Boom!","The Mountain River Cauldron smashed into the black fog, forcing the figure out of it.","At this moment, after the black fog dispersed, a middle-aged man wearing purple-gold armor and holding a halberd appeared before Chu Yunfan.","His blood-red eyes were filled with endless hatred. He hated everything.","“King Hatred Monster?” Chu Yunfan frowned and immediately knew who this person was.","When he was in Magi Circle, he did not do much else, but he had read a lot of information.","Magi Circle did not care about this. Anyway, what Chu Yunfan was looking at was not some cultivation technique. It was nothing more than the information on various experts that Magi Circle had collected for a long time.","After so many years of persistent searching, as long as an expert appeared in the Ancient Realm, he could basically find the corresponding information in Magi Circle. Especially those top-notch experts, the information was even more detailed.","Of course, the other sects had also collected a lot of information about Magi Circle. It was all an open secret, so no one took it to heart.","Of course, what they could collect was some relatively public information, and some experts even deliberately showed it.","It was not very confidential information, so Magi Circle did not care about Chu Yunfan. During that time, Chu Yunfan had already checked all the top experts in the various forces.","Among them, there was King Hatred Monster under Emperor Skyquake Monster.","Although he was a half-Emperor, that was something that the people of the world had to distinguish themselves. In fact, according to the true division of cultivation, there was no such thing as a half-Emperor. After the King Stage, there was the Emperor Stage.","Therefore, those who had not reached the Emperor Stage could only call themselves Kings. Even half-Emperors were only Kings in essence.","Even the human king who ruled a world only dared to call himself a human king and not a human emperor. Otherwise, he would become a laughing stock."]},{"number":2513,"title":"Chapter 2513: You’re Trash","paragraphs":["Chapter 2513: You’re Trash","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","However, according to the information, this King Hatred Monster was not originally called King Hatred Monster. He was an expert who had come to the Ancient Realm from another world.","It was unknown which world the monsters came from, but it could be said to have set off a monstrous tide.","Later, he was defeated by Emperor Skyquake Monster with a single finger.","Later on, he submitted to Emperor Skyquake Monster, and he also changed his name to something something Hatred.","It was King Hatred Monster, of course!","He didn’t know how long the hatred that had seeped out of his body had lasted!","According to Magi Circle’s information, this King Hatred Monster had obtained some kind of inheritance. It was very likely that it was the inheritance of an ancient Emperor. His cultivation could be said to be earth-shattering.","It was said that it was very possible for him to become an Emperor!","Later, he was defeated by Emperor Skyquake Monster with a finger and his Dao heart was broken!","After that, he had no hope of breaking through and had been stuck at the ninth half-Emperor Stage for many years!","Emperor Skyquake Monster was also a big-hearted person. After breaking King Hatred Monster’s Dao heart, he immediately ignored it. As it turned out, although King Hatred Monster was full of resentment, he could no longer pose any threat to Emperor Skyquake Monster.","Chu Yunfan knew that for cultivators, the most important thing was to cripple their cultivation.","However, what was more terrifying than crippling one’s cultivation was breaking one’s Dao heart.","This was because if one’s cultivation was crippled, they could still cultivate again. However, if their Dao heart was broken, the possibility of them recovering was very, very small.","King Hatred Monster, who had the possibility of attaining Dao, had his Dao heart destroyed by Emperor Skyquake Monster. Since then, he had been left with an undefeatable shadow.","This made Chu Yunfan even more certain that in such a good environment in the Ancient Realm, there were countless geniuses, but no one had broken through to the Emperor Stage in so many years. It was indeed because these Emperors had already taken a step forward and blocked their way up.","Since then, King Hatred Monster had become King Hatred Monster. He hated everything. Of course, the most important thing was to hate Emperor Skyquake Monster.","However, for Emperor Skyquake Monster, King Hatred Monster had no chance of breaking through to the Emperor Stage, so the rest didn’t matter.","He even took King Hatred Monster as his subordinate and entrusted him with important tasks. No matter how many years King Hatred Monster resisted, it was useless.","Against the top ten Emperors, any resistance was nothing but a joke.","Therefore, Emperor Skyquake Monster didn’t even stop King Hatred Monster’s actions. Instead, he allowed King Hatred Monster to rise to the top of the monsters. To be able to control such an army was equivalent to at least one-tenth of the entire monsters’ strength.","He seemed to be a figure with immense power and status, but in front of a true Emperor, he was so weak that he could not withstand a single blow.","The difference between a half-Emperor and an Emperor was like the difference between heaven and earth. The difference was so great that it was impossible to understand.","Among the ten forces, only the monsters was an exception. They could allow foreign experts to join the monsters.","The other forces had a very strict distinction between direct descendants and itinerant cultivators.","However, it was also because of this that the strength of the monsters grew very quickly. It had always been the strongest faction in the world.","One of the most important reasons was that there were too many races among the monsters.","In addition, their bloodlines would evolve or degenerate, and they would evolve into a new race.","Basically, it was impossible to talk about origin among the monsters.","In the monsters, different bloodlines would evolve into different cultivation techniques. It was a fantasy to cultivate the same cultivation technique at the same time.","That was impossible.","Therefore, this was the biggest difference between the monsters and other factions!","“You recognize me? Are you from the Ancient Realm?” King Hatred Monster’s hatred swept out. The entire Imperial Capital felt his monstrous hatred.","At the critical juncture of attaining Dao, he was blocked by someone. One could imagine how shocking his hatred was.","There would not be a second chance in this lifetime!","“You don’t have to know about this. You’re going to die soon anyway!” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“You want to kill me? What arrogance. Over the years, no one in the Ancient Realm has dared to say such words to me!” King Hatred Monster gritted his teeth and looked at Chu Yunfan coldly. He didn’t make a move just now and let these monster experts be slaughtered because he hated these monster experts.","They were all subordinates of Emperor Skyquake Monster and were his enemies, but they had been conquered by him with his great strength over the years.","However, King Hatred Monster hated Emperor Skyquake Monster deep down and wished he could kill him.","However, Emperor Skyquake Monster did not care about him. He even knew that Emperor Skyquake Monster did not even monitor him.","That was the greatest confidence of a high and mighty Emperor.","Even if he had 300 guts, he would have rebelled.","However, for Emperor Skyquake Monster, all the rebellions could be quelled with a single slap.","In front of an Emperor, any kind of scheme was a piece of cake. Unless there were multiple Emperors plotting at the same time, there was nothing to fear.","“That’s because you’re a coward. You’re just a good-for-nothing. Do you think you’re strong?” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","“What did you say?” King Hatred Monster stared at Chu Yunfan with a pair of scarlet eyes. As soon as he finished speaking, endless hatred materialized and turned into a demonic wind that swept toward Chu Yunfan.","“I said, you’re just a good-for-nothing!” Chu Yunfan said indifferently. “People say that your Dao heart was shattered by Emperor Skyquake Monster, but that’s just a way of saying that you don’t want to lose face!”","Chu Yunfan grinned and said, “Actually, you’re scared out of your wits! You’re just a coward who’s scared out of his wits!”","“You’re courting death!” King Hatred Monster could not control the killing intent in his mind because Chu Yunfan’s words had hit his sore spot.","Indeed, he was scared out of his wits by Emperor Skyquake Monster.","That kind of endless despair, the despair that could destroy you with a finger, what kind of shocking power was that?","He was only a step away from becoming an Emperor, but this step was like a natural moat, like the two ends of the Milky Way.","Back when he went to the Emperor Monster Realm to challenge Emperor Skyquake Monster, he thought that Emperor Skyquake Monster was old and weak.","It was time for the monsters to change its master!","Back then, he was so proud and confident.","The spring breeze triumphed over the galloping horse!","However, reality gave him a tight slap in the face!","Emperor Skyquake Monster didn’t even look at him. He defeated him with just one finger. Even now, he still felt the greatest humiliation in his dreams."]},{"number":2514,"title":"Chapter 2514: The Monster Army Collapses","paragraphs":["Chapter 2514: The Monster Army Collapses","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“What do you know? You haven’t fought with Emperor Skyquake Monster, so how can you understand the despair? The gap between a half-Emperor and an Emperor is like the gap between heaven and earth. We will never be able to compete with an Emperor in our lifetime!” Emperor Skyquake Monster roared loudly as if he wanted to roar out all the grievances he had suffered over the years.","Chu Yunfan grinned and said, “That’s why I said you don’t have a Dao heart. Your Dao heart has been broken. Failure isn’t scary. What’s scary is that after this failure, you don’t even have the courage to get back up!”","“Back then, you couldn’t attain Dao because you were unlucky? No, that’s predestined. You don’t deserve to become an Emperor. If even trash like you can become an Emperor, then the world is truly unfair!” Chu Yunfan said lightly. “In my eyes, you’re just a stray dog. How dare you bark at me.”","From the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, Chu Yunfan had seen the process of many Emperors attaining Dao. In a sense, it was even more difficult to achieve Dao in ancient times than it was now because one had to face many Emperors who existed in the world.","The Emperors of that era were generally younger and more active. Which enlightened person had not suffered interference and difficulties from other Emperors?","There were even people who personally hunted the upcoming Emperors down!","The Alchemy Emperor knew that many Emperors had been hunted down and almost died before they had attained Dao.","However, after experiencing life and death, those people had regained their spirits. Only then could they press forward and charge into the Emperor Stage.","King Hatred Monster had lost his confidence after a single failure. Such a person was a stepping stone for the Emperors to achieve Dao even in ancient times.","Because success was too easy for them, it was very rare for them to fail.","Because of this, such a person was not worthy of success in Chu Yunfan’s eyes!","Having the courage to draw a sword against any expert was the key to becoming an Emperor.","After all, those who could cultivate to such a level were all geniuses. King Hatred Monster’s aptitude, bloodline, and opportunities were not necessarily inferior to Emperor Skyquake Monster.","However, Emperor Skyquake Monster was unrivaled in the world and led the rise of the monsters in the Ancient Realm. He did not even spare a glance at a genius like King Hatred Monster and was destined not to achieve Dao.","Those who cultivated in the Ancient Realm were instilled with the idea that the Emperors were invincible since they were young. The Ten Great Emperors were high and mighty, and they had never changed since the end of the antiquity era.","In their minds, Emperor Skyquake Monster was an invincible god.","In ancient times, there had been more than one battle between Emperors. It was not the first time that Emperors had been frightened like stray dogs. In that kind of environment, the people respected the Emperors, but they did not feel that the Emperors were invincible. They were the gods of the world.","Therefore, he would not be suppressed by the Emperor’s pressure!","However, it was different in the Ancient Realm. It was too peaceful. It was so peaceful that no one in the Ancient Realm had such a heart for countless years.","King Hatred Monster was one of the rare experts who dared to challenge an Emperor. Perhaps this was also related to his origin from the outside world.","However, it was a pity that he was only a silver spearhead, just for show!","A single failure had already broken his Dao heart. He was no different from a good-for-nothing!","“What’s the use of explaining so much? You’re scared out of your wits. Without your Dao heart, you’re not just a good-for-nothing even if you have monstrous cultivation!” Chu Yunfan said lightly. “Stop talking nonsense. I’m going to take your life today. I still have a lot of things to do, so I won’t waste my time on you!”","“How dare you!” Emperor Skyquake Monster roared in embarrassment and anger.","In his hand, the ancient halberd slashed down. In an instant, a terrifying halberd light that could shatter the world slashed down, emitting a trembling sound of the great Dao laws.","This attack turned into a monster with fangs and claws. In the shadows, it was impossible to tell what kind of monster it was. It was covered in scales, had eight legs, and two tails. It flew toward Chu Yunfan with fangs and claws.","The Mountain River Diagram above Chu Yunfan’s head suppressed everything. In an instant, the monster that was baring its fangs and brandishing its claws was crushed.","Even if the Mountain River Diagram was unable to display the terrifying cultivation level of the Alchemy Emperor in Chu Yunfan’s hands, it was already very terrifying.","This simple attack was able to erupt with monstrous cultivation.","Boom!","The Mountain River Diagram destroyed everything. At the same time, Chu Yunfan held the Mountain River Cauldron in his hand and smashed it directly at King Hatred Monster.","Clang!","The entire world was shaking, the ground was shaking slightly, and the mountain peak was roaring with difficulty.","The battle between the two of them made everyone in the Imperial Capital feel so pressured that they wanted to vomit blood.","At this moment, the human king, the Elder Princess, and Tang Siyu all used their monstrous divine power to support the defensive barrier above the Imperial Capital.","Without the protection of the Luck Dragon, the Imperial Capital’s defense was clearly weaker.","The three of them were struggling!","Although they were all half-Emperors, just resisting the shockwaves from the battle was enough to make them want to vomit blood, let alone other things.","There was no way for them to participate in the battle of such experts.","Especially when they heard the conversation between Chu Yunfan and King Hatred Monster, their hearts surged with emotions.","There was actually an Emperor in this world. It was not an existence in myths and legends, but a true Emperor!","King Hatred Monster had fought such an existence before. This made the trio’s hearts tremble.","Although Chu Yunfan said that this King Hatred Monster was like a stray dog and a complete waste, however, that was only to Chu Yunfan. To them, this King Hatred Monster was very strong.","Spurt!","Emperor Skyquake Monster hastily retreated as he spat out a mouthful of blood.","His red eyes were filled with disbelief.","Chu Yunfan had easily injured him!","Although he was defeated by Emperor Skyquake Monster with one finger, he didn’t care about him and didn’t guard against him.","However, his strength was still genuine and not fake!","His Dao heart had been broken, but his strength was still genuine. He was even the first tier below the Emperors.","Even though he was also a ninth half-Emperor, his cultivation was several times that of Divine Lord Flame!","After all, he had once been at the peak and had almost become an Emperor!","Now, he was actually severely injured by a single attack and spat out blood. It was simply a great humiliation.","He had almost reached the peak of the half-Emperor Stage. Since ancient times, there were not many people who could match him in this realm. The other Emperors were probably on par with him in this realm.","How did Chu Yunfan manage to severely injure him with a single blow? He was simply a monster!","However, he had no other choice but to fight with his back against the wall!","At this moment, the lightning domain under Chu Yunfan’s feet expanded again, and countless experts of the monster army were wiped out.","Boom!","The monster army collapsed!"]},{"number":2515,"title":"Chapter 2515: A Physical Body Comparable to Emperors","paragraphs":["Chapter 2515: A Physical Body Comparable to Emperors","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The monster army collapsed!","Facing the abnormality that was Chu Yunfan, even the strong-willed elite of the monsters couldn’t hold out.","All of their attacks would be swallowed by the Mountain River Diagram and turned into nutrients. Their attacks were completely useless against a magic artifact of this level.","This was the case in the cultivation world. Different levels and different realms could not be piled up with numbers.","“None of you will escape!” Chu Yunfan shouted, and the Mountain River Diagram above his head flew out. It grew bigger and bigger until it covered the sky and the sun. Then, it froze the nearby space.","Layers of light screens were cast down, blocking the endless monster army.","“I’ll leave them to you. Kill them!” Chu Yunfan telepathically told the human king and the others.","The human king and the others were instantly shocked. In their eyes, that endless army was really nothing to be afraid of.","The only thing they were afraid of was the half-Emperors in the monster army.","However, these half-Emperors had already been killed by Chu Yunfan’s lightning domain.","Even if they didn’t come looking for him, Chu Yunfan would still control the lightning domain to find them and kill them.","Now, only King Hatred Monster was left in the entire monster army.","The rest was nothing to worry about.","With the strength of the three half-Emperors, the monster army was nothing!","When one’s cultivation reached a different level, their strength would be completely different!","The three of them joined in and soon began a massacre. Although their strength was far inferior to Chu Yunfan’s, it was still very easy for the three of them to deal with the Kings in the monster army.","This was especially true for the half-Emperor monsters of the Central Plains. They were scared to death.","No one had expected that the situation would be completely reversed.","In their eyes, such a lineup could sweep through all the worlds except the Ancient Realm, but it was reversed by Chu Yunfan alone.","However, they did not have the time to think too much about it. They were directly turned into a bloody rain by Tang Siyu’s sword and dissipated.","Above the Imperial Capital, the Mountain River Diagram formed a screen of light, protecting the Imperial Capital within. They could go on a slaughter without worrying about anything else.","Without the protection of the Mountain River Diagram, King Hatred Monster felt that his chance had finally arrived.","At least both sides were standing on the same starting line. At least Chu Yunfan had lost the Emperor artifact’s help and had his defensive power greatly weakened. This was his chance.","“Roar!” King Hatred Monster roared and once again slashed down at Chu Yunfan with his halberd.","The terrifying monster appeared again. It was King Hatred Monster’s Martial Dao, which had evolved according to its original form. Even though it had been defeated by Chu Yunfan once, it immediately condensed again.","Unless Chu Yunfan could shatter King Hatred Monster’s Martial Dao like Emperor Skyquake Monster, he would not be able to stop him from condensing this monster again.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t take it seriously. He continued to smash down with the Mountain River Cauldron with his hand. The Mountain River Cauldron flew into the sky and fought against the halberd.","At the same time, he flew out and collided with King Hatred Monster.","Boom!","A terrifying collision erupted.","Spurt!","King Hatred Monster took a few steps back. Blood splattered out of his body. It came from his chest. He had almost collapsed from the blow.","Chu Yunfan’s fist landed on his chest, almost causing his body to collapse.","However, his halberd also landed on Chu Yunfan’s body. He thought that even if he couldn’t split Chu Yunfan in half, he could still severely injure him.","However, the sound of metal clashing was heard from the surface of Chu Yunfan’s skin, and sparks flew everywhere.","King Hatred Monster widened his eyes in disbelief. How could Chu Yunfan’s body be so powerful? He had tried his best to attack Chu Yunfan, but he couldn’t hurt him.","One had to know that if his attack landed on an ordinary planet, it would be enough to split the planet in half.","However, when it landed on Chu Yunfan, it only produced a few sparks!","What kind of terrifying defensive power was this? Just in terms of the strength of the physical body, it could probably be compared to the Emperors.","When he thought of this, King Hatred Monster felt his entire body tremble as he sucked in a cold breath.","Although the strength of the Emperors was all-rounded, it was not only the strength of the physical body, but also the domain, the understanding of the Great Dao, various divine power martial arts, and so on. There were no shortcomings, and it was not just the strength of the physical body.","But even so, it was still shocking for a half-Emperor to cultivate his body to the level of an Emperor.","Since ancient times, those who could achieve this level could be said to be very rare. As long as those people did not die in the end, they would eventually become an Emperor, or even an expert among the Emperors.","He had seen such records in the monster race, but he felt that it was a fantasy. How could someone in the half-Emperor Stage do this?","If even a top expert like him, who was only a step away from attaining Dao, could not do it, then how did others do it?","It was impossible!","However, this impossible thing actually happened right in front of his eyes!","Chu Yunfan was truly a monster!","Originally, he thought that he was the invincible existence below the Emperors. However, compared to Chu Yunfan, he was obviously not on the same level.","“H-How could you...” King Hatred Monster stuttered.","King Hatred Monster didn’t say it in detail, but Chu Yunfan knew what he wanted to say.","“Do you think I’m strong because I have an Emperor artifact?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “No, I am the strongest. I rely on myself! I can kill you barehanded!”","This was Chu Yunfan’s second battle after he broke through to the ninth half-Emperor Stage.","Yes, after such a long time, Chu Yunfan had not only just broken through to the ninth half-Emperor Stage, but he had also cultivated this stage to the peak.","Relying on the massive supply of Origin Yang Pills and the help of the godhead, he was able to digest the comprehension of the ninth half-Emperor Stage. It took him a long time to reach the peak.","His cultivation was at least several times stronger than when he had broken through during the battle with Divine Lord Flame.","Back then, he had to rely on the Brahma Tree that transformed into a combat suit before he could fight against Divine Lord Flame.","But now, he could beat King Hatred Monster with his bare hands until King Hatred Monster spat out blood and retreated.","Just as Chu Yunfan had said, nothing was his true reliance. He only had himself to rely on.","Only when one was strong could one be truly strong!"]},{"number":2516,"title":"Chapter 2516: Slaying King Hatred Monster","paragraphs":["Chapter 2516: Slaying King Hatred Monster","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan’s physical body was comparable to the Emperors. This was the biggest trump card that Chu Yunfan had prepared for himself during this period of time!","If it was an ordinary person, it would be impossible to do it!","A half-Emperor was a half-Emperor, and an Emperor was an Emperor. They were not the same thing, nor were they on the same level.","Other people couldn’t do it, but Chu Yunfan was different. He had three completely different Emperor physiques at the same time.","And then, he truly possessed the level of being comparable to the Emperors!","It wasn’t that no one had ever done something like this since ancient times. The Emperor Supreme, who had written the Mighty Emperor Battle Book, had done it before.","The difference was that their physiques were different, but the method was the same. After so many years of trying, Chu Yunfan had truly fused the three physiques into one and transformed them into the Imperial Physique.","Of course, his Imperial Physique was different from the Emperor Supreme’s Imperial Physique, and the physiques they formed were also different, but they were equally unprecedented!","Although this was only a part of the power of the Emperors, it was already very rare. It could be said that even if Chu Yunfan met the Emperors, he would still be able to fight back. Although in other aspects, he was still not enough to face the Emperors. He might even be killed by the Emperors with a thought.","But now that his body was comparable to the Emperors, coupled with the protection of the Brahma Tree, Chu Yunfan dared to say anything.","He already had the ability to challenge the Emperors!","Although it was just a challenge and impossible to defeat them, this was already a rare and shocking existence since ancient times.","At least in the eyes of the Emperors, he was no longer an ant.","Even though the difference between an adult and a baby was still the same when facing the Emperors, at least it was not the difference between an ant and a human.","So what if there were more ants? It was just a few more steps.","With this capital, he would have the true might to roam the Ancient Realm. He did not have to worry about being slapped to death by any Emperor.","Even though Chu Yunfan could have defeated the other half-Emperors in Elements Sect back then, he had left. He didn’t kill them all because he was afraid of Emperor Elements.","If he had his current cultivation base back then, there would be nothing to be afraid of. Even if Emperor Elements attacked him on the spot, he would still be able to escape if he could not defeat Emperor Elements.","This was already very shocking!","“Monster! You’re a monster!” King Hatred Monster stared at Chu Yunfan, his eyes revealing a bone-deep hatred.","His hatred was mixed with jealousy!","How could Chu Yunfan, who was only a half-Emperor, be able to obtain the power of an Emperor? And how could he, whose Dao heart had been broken, be like a stray dog?","After Chu Yunfan exposed his thoughts, even he himself felt that he was indeed a stray dog.","When he thought of this, the hatred in King Hatred Monster’s body deepened. This was an inheritance he had obtained since he was young. It was the legendary Emperor Hatred’s inheritance.","Emperor Hatred was a very rare person who had become an Emperor through the emotions path!","Although it was rare, it was still a part of the Great Dao of Heaven and Earth. This was because all living beings had feelings, and there were even more who knew how many who had hatred.","This was also an upright Great Dao!","There was only one requirement to cultivate this Great Dao, and that was to hate, hate, hate. The more one hated, the more powerful one would be!","At this moment, King Hatred Monster felt that his hatred had reached the limit!","He hated Emperor Skyquake Monster for crippling his Dao heart!","Emperor Skyquake Monster looked down on him and didn’t even bother to be on guard!","He hated Chu Yunfan for having such strength!","He hated Chu Yunfan for looking down on him and seeing him as a stray dog!","He hated everyone who laughed at him behind his back!","He hated himself for being useless and not being able to reignite his Dao heart. One failure was a permanent failure!","He hated the heavens, the earth, all living beings, everything, and even himself!","Boom!","The hatred in his body had reached its peak. At the same time, his strength had also risen to its peak.","“Great Hatred of the Sky!” King Hatred Monster roared loudly.","With a whoosh sound, the entire world was ignited by this hatred. He wanted to sacrifice all the living beings in the world to the world and obtain powerful strength!","And the first person he wanted to sacrifice was Chu Yunfan!","Chu Yunfan immediately felt as if the world was about to ignite everything about him. His body, his spirit, his laws, everything about him was about to be ignited.","“Humph!” Chu Yunfan snorted coldly. His divine power surged out and stopped everything.","King Hatred Monster wanted to ignite him?","This Great Hatred of the Sky technique was indeed something. If it was an ordinary ninth half-Emperor, he might really be ignited.","However, Chu Yunfan was a figure whose body was comparable to that of the Emperors. How could he be ignited by this Great Hatred of the Sky technique?","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan’s face revealed a cold smile.","In an instant, he attacked. He clenched his fists and transformed into eight heavenly dragons that attacked King Hatred Monster.","Boom!","There was another loud explosion. King Hatred Monster, who was using the Great Hatred of the Sky technique, did not expect Chu Yunfan to be able to break free from the restrictions of his technique and directly punched him.","He had no other choice but to take this punch head-on!","King Hatred Monster’s chest was already injured. Now that he was hit by the punch, a large hole formed in his chest. Blood spurted out, making the wound look extremely terrifying.","His Great Hatred of the Sky was also directly stopped!","Chu Yunfan took the opportunity to launch another attack and stomped down with one foot.","King Hatred Monster had no choice but to form a domain. Endless hatred was released, transforming into a huge domain that protected him.","However, Chu Yunfan’s Nine Netherworld Stomps turned into a big foot that stomped on the domain and shattered it on the spot.","King Hatred Monster was stepped on the spot. He let out a miserable cry as his body shattered.","Chu Yunfan’s stomp could crush stars, let alone the body of King Hatred Monster. This was not an exaggeration at all.","Not far away, King Hatred Monster reconstructed his body. He panted heavily as he had exhausted a lot of his vitality. His face turned pale and he even aged a little.","This time, he had suffered heavy injuries and burned his vitality to survive. However, even so, his condition was far from his peak.","King Hatred Monster turned around and fled. He transformed into a beam of light and fled into the starry sky.","In an instant, the screen of light from the Mountain River Diagram appeared in front of him.","With a loud shout, he used his halberd to break the light curtain. However, although the light curtain hanging down from the Mountain River Diagram could not be compared to the main body, how could it be broken in a hurry?","Chu Yunfan caught up with him and chopped King Hatred Monster head off with a backhand slash.","King Hatred Monster died tragically. This time, he was unable to reconstruct his body. Even his soul was ignited and he died without a burial place."]},{"number":2517,"title":"Chapter 2517: Hiding Their Location","paragraphs":["Chapter 2517: Hiding Their Location","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the Imperial Capital, in the Imperial Palace, Chu Yunfan, the human king, the Elder Princess, Tang Siyu, Chu Hongcai, and the others were all gathered.","Basically, the core talents of Grand Xia and King Chu’s faction were all gathered together.","Everyone listened to Chu Yunfan’s narration of his encounters and experiences in the Ancient Realm.","After hearing this, everyone could not help but exclaim in admiration.","It turned out that there was really an extremely powerful world in the endless starry sky.","The Ancient Realm was a world where powerful Emperors truly existed!","This was something that countless people had never imagined. Perhaps in the distant past, there had been people who had left the Central Plains for the Ancient Realm, but no one had returned like Chu Yunfan.","And in the era before the human king, there was no one who could reach Chu Yunfan’s level.","This was because before Chu Yunfan had appeared, the various factions of the Central Plains had restrained each other and had no ability to develop in the outer realms. They had basically been restricted to the Central Plains.","In fact, even half-Emperors were legends in the Central Plains.","And after Chu Yunfan’s sudden appearance, the strength of the human race had increased explosively, and it had pacified the entire Central Plains in one go.","Only after the humans became stronger did they nurture many half-Emperors.","But no matter how powerful the humans of the Central Plains were, when faced with an unreasonably powerful world like the Ancient Realm, they had no chance of winning, not even a sliver.","Any Emperor could easily pacify the Central Plains.","“I didn’t expect that there would still be Emperors living in this world, and they’ve lived since ancient times!” the human king could not help but sigh with emotion. He was somewhat emotional, but also somewhat excited, because he saw the infinity of the Great Dao.","In the Central Plains, he could already feel the ceiling that Chu Yunfan had felt before. He was firmly locked in the Central Plains, unable to move.","But now, they learned from Chu Yunfan that their path was still far away.","This was undoubtedly great news for cultivators. Even if this path might not end in their lifetime, it was better than having no path in front of them.","“However, even if they have some means to survive until now, they probably don’t have much time left!” Chu Hongcai said, sighing in his heart.","In the years that Chu Yunfan had been away, he had already stepped into the peak of the King Stage and was only a step away from the half-Emperor Stage.","“That’s why the Emperors joined forces to fight Emperor Evil. They wanted to plunder the Emperor essence in his body to prolong their life!” the Elder Princess said with a serious expression.","Chu Yunfan’s arrival had brought them too many terrifying things that they had never dared to imagine before.","In their understanding, Emperors were the most terrifying existences. Only Emperors could defeat Emperors.","However, in their impression, many things about Emperors were still myths and legends.","According to the legends, in the ancient times when Emperors stood side by side, although some Emperors were already old, to them, death was probably the concept of fighting to the death.","To them, they simply did not dare to imagine that something like dying of old age would happen to an Emperor.","In order to survive and extend their lives, the Emperors had no choice but to kill other Emperors and devour their Emperor origin.","This kind of hideous reality hit them in the face, making them feel suffocated.","Even the Emperors would face the same situation of dying of old age. Even if their lifespans were much longer than they imagined, they would still not be able to live long.","“But that’s good. At least we’ve settled the matter with Evil Gods Creed. We don’t have to worry about Evil Gods Creed suddenly attacking us!” Tang Siyu said.","Everyone nodded. They had originally thought that behind the Evil Gods stood a world that was slightly more powerful than the Central Plains.","But now, it seemed that their estimation was completely wrong. With the strength of Emperor Evil behind Evil Gods Creed, a single slap was probably enough to destroy the Central Plains.","With a single slap, at least half of the living beings of the Central Plains would perish.","Even if Emperor Evil didn’t act, Evil Gods Creed could easily destroy the Central Plains.","Such a terrifying behemoth had finally been destroyed under Chu Yunfan’s scheme. This was undoubtedly a great thing.","However, they could also imagine how many benefits would be redistributed behind the collapse of Evil Gods Creed, which had always been one of the top ten forces.","Who knew how many people would lose everything in the process of Evil Gods Creed’s destruction, and who knew how many people would eat their fill in the process.","Even Chu Yunfan had benefited greatly from the destruction of Evil Gods Creed. Otherwise, if he had continued to accumulate resources for cultivation, who knew how many years it would have taken him?","Chu Yunfan relied on Evil Gods Creed’s resources to cultivate to the ninth half-Emperor Stage in a short period of time.","It was definitely a bloody storm now, and their Central Plains had been besieged by the forces under Emperor Skyquake Monster. To a certain extent, they had also been affected by the aftermath of Evil Gods Creed’s destruction.","This was just a clean-up army under the command of Emperor Skyquake Monster, and this army was enough to wipe out the myriad worlds.","It could really be said that a giant stomped his foot, and a large group of ants would be trampled to death.","“But now that you’ve killed the Emperor Skyquake Monster army, I’m afraid that they will come to us soon!” Chu Hongcai quickly said.","Everyone’s expression turned cold. With such a huge army under his command destroyed here, even if Emperor Skyquake Monster’s reaction was slow, he would come soon enough.","At that time, the Central Plains would truly be in danger. If they were targeted by Emperor Skyquake Monster, the Central Plains would truly be doomed.","“It’s fine. I’ve already thought about it. I plan to set up a great barrier around the Central Plains to seal off the Central Plains’ location so that they won’t be able to find it for a while!” Chu Yunfan said, “It’s inevitable that we’ll be exposed if we wait too long. However, I don’t think we’ll be caught that soon!”","Chu Yunfan remembered a kind of great barrier of the Array Emperor that was recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book. It could be used at this time.","If it was set up by the Array Emperor, then it could be said that it completely covered all traces, so there was no need to worry.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t have that kind of power. At most, he could only hide the Central Plains for a short time."]},{"number":2518,"title":"Chapter 2518: Preparing to Break Through to the Emperor Stage","paragraphs":["Chapter 2518: Preparing to Break Through to the Emperor Stage","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","No matter what, Emperor Skyquake Monster was an Emperor. Even though he wasn’t as good at divination and wasn’t as powerful as Emperor Magus, after a long time, it would be enough for Emperor Skyquake Monster to deduce it! They could only hide for such a short time.","However, such a long time was enough. In the following time, Chu Yunfan had to think of ways to break through to the Emperor Stage.","If he did, then even if Emperor Skyquake Monster calculated something, he wouldn’t be able to do anything to him.","However, if Chu Yunfan could not reach it, he would probably be hunted down all over the world.","Previously, he could deceive everyone and kill a Grand Elder of Magi Circle, but that was done with the Evil Gods’ methods.","Even Emperor Magus could only deduce to this extent. After all, Chu Yunfan had the protection of the Mountain River Diagram, which could shield him from divination to a certain extent.","It was impossible for Emperor Magus to know anything more precise.","At that time, Chu Yunfan was just a nobody to Emperor Magus. The death of a mere half-Emperor was not enough to make Emperor Magus go to war.","Besides, Emperor Magus had wanted to attack for a long time, and he was worried that he couldn’t find an excuse. At this moment, an excuse came to him, which was like a saber.","Therefore, Emperor Magus didn’t make any further calculations at that time. He simply assumed that it was the Evil Gods who did it.","After all, everyone knew that Evil Gods were a specialty of Evil Gods Creed. Every single one of them was a mass-produced artifact. It could even be said that there was no possibility of them being bought over.","If there was a group of people who would fight until the end, it would be those Evil Gods.","Those Evil Gods had been completely brainwashed. They only had Emperor Evil in their minds and there was no possibility of being bought over.","Since it was the Evil Gods, no matter what the reason was, it could be related to Emperor Evil. This was the best reason to start a war.","However, in reality, this reason was just a smokescreen to numb Emperor Evil.","If only Emperor Evil had known that he would be surrounded and killed by such a force, he probably wouldn’t stay for even a moment longer. He would have uprooted the Evil Realm and fled into the starry sky of the universe.","However, this time, it was not so simple. Such a large-scale troop had disappeared in space. If they did not find out who did it, Emperor Skyquake Monster would probably have trouble sleeping and eating.","The incident with Emperor Evil was a very bad start for the Ten Great Emperors. Originally, the Ten Great Emperors had existed since ancient times, and no one had wanted to change the situation.","But now, all the Emperors had to be wary of others killing them.","Under such circumstances, it would be strange if Emperor Skyquake Monster could not sleep for the whole night after such a large army had disappeared.","Therefore, he would definitely not let it go. In fact, other than the freak Chu Yunfan, only the Emperors had the ability to cause such losses.","If Emperor Skyquake Monster did not find the mastermind, he would not give up easily.","“But even so, it’s only a temporary solution!” the human king said worriedly.","After all, no matter how one looked at it, a powerful Emperor might be involved in the end. A moment of peace was only temporary.","“That’s right. We can’t place all our hopes on the fact that Emperor Skyquake Monster can’t find out anything about it!” At this moment, the Elder Princess also nodded and joined in. “We have to be prepared to move at any time. If it really doesn’t work, we can only take some people away. At least, we have to leave some seeds behind so that they won’t be killed by Emperor Skyquake Monster!”","Everyone else nodded. The pressure that Emperor Skyquake Monster gave them was too great, forcing them to do this.","Even if they had to sacrifice the vast majority of people, there was no other way.","“In any case, we have to prepare in advance. We can move in advance. We can’t be killed by Emperor Skyquake Monster in the end!” At this moment, Chu Hongcai also spoke.","Chu Yunfan pondered for a moment and said, “But don’t worry too much. Although my chances of winning against Emperor Skyquake Monster are not high, I still have one last chance. If I succeed, I can break through to the Emperor Stage. If I succeed, you don’t have to worry. After all, we’re all Emperors. Who’s worse than who?”","Chu Yunfan’s news shocked everyone.","What kind of existence were the Emperors? It could be said that since ancient times, they had always been the object of admiration for countless people. In fact, since ancient times, no one had successfully broken through.","Now that Chu Yunfan wanted to break through to the Emperor Stage, they didn’t dare to imagine what kind of level it would be.","This was because the strongest among them was the human king at the third half-Emperor Stage. He was still far from the true Emperor Stage.","However, they also knew that once Chu Yunfan succeeded, all the problems would be solved.","They would also have an Emperor to guard them. Even Emperor Skyquake Monster would not be able to do anything to them.","They knew Chu Yunfan well enough to know that with his cautious personality, he wouldn’t have said such a thing if he wasn’t confident.","He definitely had a certain degree of confidence!","Thinking of this, everyone could not help but reveal a somewhat surprised and happy expression.","“I’m afraid it’ll be very difficult for a ninth half-Emperor to break through to the Emperor Stage. Otherwise, it’s impossible for no one to break through after so many years!” the human king asked.","“Yes, it’s very difficult here. There are also many traps!” Chu Yunfan then explained to them why so many prodigies from ancient times to the present were unable to reach this Emperor Stage.","Only now did everyone realize that after reaching the half-Emperor Stage, no one could enter the Emperor Stage because their path had been cut off.","The ten Emperors spread their martial arts in the myriad worlds. On the one hand, it was to nurture talents for their own forces.","On the one hand, it was also to block the future development of these prodigies.","It could be said to be killing two birds with one stone!","However, when everyone heard Chu Yunfan’s words, their expressions became somewhat solemn. This was because their Dao was essentially the Dao passed down by the Emperors. It was easier said than done to break through.","If they wanted to break through the limit, they had to waste their cultivation and re-cultivate. Only then would they have the hope of breaking through to a higher stage.","However, the willpower required for this was not to be underestimated!","“I’ve decided. I’m going to waste my cultivation and cultivate again!” At this moment, the human king was the first to speak.","“I will also waste my cultivation and re-cultivate!” The Elder Princess nodded. “But it will be after you. After all, the Central Plains will need someone to protect it while you cultivate!”"]},{"number":2519,"title":"Chapter 2519: The Key to Becoming an Emperor: Dao Integration","paragraphs":["Chapter 2519: The Key to Becoming an Emperor: Dao Integration","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Everyone had plans to re-cultivate. King Hatred Monster had served as a lesson.","They were all top prodigies, heaven-sent geniuses!","Who wouldn’t want to step into the Emperor Stage?","When they were young, the Emperors might not be much stronger than them.","If they didn’t re-cultivate now, they would never be able to become an Emperor in this lifetime!","“After I’m done setting up, I’m leaving!” Chu Yunfan said.","“You want to leave? Aren’t you going to stay here?” Tang Siyu said with concern.","“I’m not staying!” Chu Yunfan shook his head and said. “There’s an opportunity right in front of me. I won’t give it up!”","“What opportunity?”","The human king and the others were a little surprised. With Chu Yunfan’s current cultivation and wealth, it could be said that there was very little that could move Chu Yunfan.","He was only a step away from becoming an Emperor. What else could attract him to rush over to such a person?","“Emperor Evil!” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","Everyone was shocked, because the main point of Chu Yunfan’s conversation was undoubtedly Emperor Evil.","Even though Emperor Evil was now like a stray dog and Evil Gods Creed had been uprooted by all sides, Emperor Evil was still an existence that many people could not underestimate.","In reality, Emperor Evil’s foundation was not Evil Gods Creed, but himself. As long as Emperor Evil was still alive, his foundation would still be there.","Even though he had been severely injured by the four Emperors and had lost a large amount of essence, he was still the same Emperor Evil.","In fact, even the Emperors would not let down their guard against Emperor Evil.","A living Emperor would be a huge threat no matter what.","It could even be said that Chu Yunfan had put in a lot of effort into Emperor Evil’s downfall. Even if it was just a fuse, if it wasn’t for this fuse, the few Emperors might not have besieged Emperor Evil for a while.","And now, it had become Chu Yunfan’s opportunity?","“Exactly!” Chu Yunfan nodded. “Before I came here, I had already received news that someone had found Emperor Evil in the depths of the starry sky. Many people have already rushed there. Although no Emperors have been heard of, there are many half-Emperors there. A lot of experts above the seventh half-Emperor Stage!”","Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, everyone sucked in a breath of cold air. Any expert above the seventh half-Emperor Stage could easily destroy the Central Plains, let alone a large group of them.","They didn’t dare to go to such a large scale.","“Do you have to go?” Tang Siyu said. Her delicate face was filled with worry.","Even with Chu Yunfan’s strength, he couldn’t guarantee that he would be safe against so many half-Emperors.","“Don’t worry, I’m confident. Unless it’s an Emperor, I have nothing to fear! Besides, this is the only way to attract the attention of Emperor Skyquake Monster so that he won’t immediately investigate the disappearance of King Hatred Monster and the others!” Chu Yunfan said.","“You don’t have to worry about me. This time, I have to go. It’s impossible not to!” Chu Yunfan shook his head. “With my current cultivation, I’m already at the peak of the half-Emperor Stage. However, it’s still not easy for me to break through to the Emperor Stage in a short period of time. Now, I still lack the last and most important part. The most important resource for becoming an Emperor, a complete world!”","“A complete world?”","They didn’t know much about the Emperors. After all, becoming an Emperor was still a very distant thing for them.","“That’s right, a complete world!” Chu Yunfan said. “Since we’ve said so much, I’ll take this opportunity to tell you guys. Have you ever thought about why Emperors are so powerful?”","Everyone shook their heads. They knew that Emperors were powerful, but they had never thought about why Emperors were so powerful.","It seemed that since ancient times, Emperors had always been powerful. No one had ever investigated why Emperors were so powerful. Wasn’t it natural for Emperors to be powerful?","“It’s very simple. Because they are Dao Integration experts!” Chu Yunfan said.","“After cultivating to a certain level, one naturally has to start comprehending laws and even condense them into a physical form. However, that is only the first step. The truly crucial step is the Dao Integration. Find a world that is still in its original state and has not developed naturally. Then, fuse your own Great Dao into it. This is the Dao Integration!","“After the Dao Integration, it is equivalent to one becoming the ruler of this world. As the saying goes, there is an end to human strength, but heaven and earth are endless. How can human strength fight against heaven and earth? This is the true secret of an Emperor’s strength!”","When everyone heard about this ancient secret, they could not help but go wide-eyed. It turned out that the reason why no one had achieved Dao was not only because their Dao was suppressed by the Emperors, but more importantly, they could not find such a world and could not achieve Dao Integration.","Although a world like the Central Plains was powerful and prosperous, it already had a complete Heavenly Dao, and no one was allowed to join it.","If one wanted to reach the Dao Integration, he naturally couldn’t find a world like this.","He had to find a pure, undeveloped world!","And such worlds were the most common in the immemorial era. At that time, the worlds had just been created and had yet to stabilize. In the ancient times, they were much more common.","And now, it was almost impossible to find them.","In any case, they had never heard of such things again. Perhaps there might be such a world, but it would take many years to find it.","At least Chu Yunfan didn’t have time to wait. What he needed to do was to seize the pure world from Emperor Evil.","In such a world, Emperor Evil’s Dao was engraved.","After killing Emperor Evil and erasing his Dao, Chu Yunfan could inject his own Dao into the world and make it his own.","This was a bit like a domain!","A domain was the product of countless laws interweaving, but a domain didn’t have a physical body. Although its power was powerful, it was limited.","However, if he could rely on a powerful world and become the world’s will, he could use the world’s origin power.","Against existences below the Emperor Stage, it was almost an existence that could crush them.","This was the reason why Emperors were so powerful and famous.","In essence, they were no longer ordinary living beings. Each and every one of them was a small-scale Heavenly Dao.","It was the same existence as the Ancient Realm and Pangu Continent in ancient times, but on a much smaller scale.","However, there was no difference in essence.","Just like the managers of small companies, no matter how small the company was, it was still better than others.","Moreover, they were the best among the workers."]},{"number":2520,"title":"Chapter 2520: Consolidating the Central Plains, Concealing It","paragraphs":["Chapter 2520: Consolidating the Central Plains, Concealing It","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","If one couldn’t reach the Dao Integration, one couldn’t erase the gap between them!","The strength of an Emperor came from this!","If Chu Yunfan wanted to break through to the Emperor Stage in the shortest time possible, this was the only way.","It would be very difficult to find an undeveloped world.","Chu Yunfan had no other choice, especially when the conflict with Emperor Skyquake Monster was right in front of him.","However, the prerequisite for doing so was to kill Emperor Evil first!","And there were probably many people who had such thoughts.","Countless powerful half-Emperors were also frantically searching for Emperor Evil.","If Emperor Evil was still intact, no one would dare to cause trouble for him, let alone kill him, even if he was already old.","That was something that the people of the past did not even dare to think about!","However, things were different now. Emperor Evil had been robbed of a large amount of his Emperor essence, and he was already severely weakened.","In the eyes of many people, he had already lost his dignity as an Emperor.","Many people wanted to kill Emperor Evil to take the most crucial step to becoming an Emperor.","Even without this undeveloped world, killing Emperor Evil would have been a great benefit.","Furthermore, the four Emperors had offered a generous reward for killing Emperor Evil. Killing Emperor Evil would bring one countless benefits.","This forced all the experts to go and kill Emperor Evil, not giving him any way out.","Although they had already confirmed that they had severely injured Emperor Evil, who knew if Emperor Evil would do anything else? No matter how much they valued an Emperor, it was never too much.","These Emperors were Emperors themselves, so they understood how much deterrence an Emperor had, even if the Emperor looked like he was about to die.","Something big could happen at any time, especially when he decided to do something.","When everyone heard Chu Yunfan’s explanation, they couldn’t help but sigh. They didn’t expect that someone as powerful as Emperor Evil would end up like this. If they hadn’t seen it with their own eyes, no one would have thought that.","“This time, Emperor Evil is doomed. Not only are the half-Emperors after him to obtain his Emperor essence and the unformed world, but the other Emperors won’t let him live either!” Chu Yunfan said. “As long as the news is reliable, he will die. Not to mention how much strength he has left to deal with the group of half-Emperors, once he is caught, even the Emperor will have to take action!”","At this moment, everyone realized that Emperor Evil was truly doomed. This time, Emperor Evil would not only have to face the experts of the myriad worlds, but also a few Emperors.","The whole world wanted him dead. Even if he was an Emperor, he would still have to die.","What did it mean to push a wall down? At this moment, everyone pushed a wall down.","The Emperor who was still awe-inspiring and dominating a region more than ten years ago had now fallen into such a state.","“I’m going to take the lead now!” Chu Yunfan said.","After settling everyone down, Chu Yunfan began to set up the great barrier.","The human king had mobilized all of the resources of the Central Plains for this project, and many of the heavenly and earthly treasures needed had been handed over, so no one had any objections.","This was especially true for the upper echelons of Grand Xia. All the experts above the King Stage knew that this matter concerned the life and death of the Central Plains.","Only by relying on the great barrier to conceal the Central Plains could they avoid Emperor Skyquake Monster’s schemes.","The previous incident had thoroughly let everyone understand the gap between them and the top forces in the world.","Even a single army under Emperor Skyquake Monster could easily wipe out the entire Central Plains. Even one expert could do it, let alone Emperor Skyquake Monster, who could probably pierce through the entire Central Plains with a single finger.","If Chu Yunfan hadn’t returned, they would have died.","Under this sense of danger that could kill them at any time, everyone worked together to set up formations at the locations Chu Yunfan had designated.","Great formations that spanned several hundreds of miles rose from the ground, their spiritual light soaring into the sky. Soon, the entire Central Plains was covered bit by bit.","In the Central Plains, there were two remaining tribes. The demi-humans had completely submitted to Emperor Skyquake Monster, which had angered all the experts of Grand Xia. They had been completely scattered, and the remaining tribes had been raised by various factions as vassals of the humans.","The status of an independent race could no longer be preserved. This was the outcome of a loser.","However, the marine folks were different. This time, they did not get involved in the matter of Emperor Skyquake Monster, although they were also one of the targets of Emperor Skyquake Monster’s forces.","However, this time, Grand Xia did not show them any mercy. After the lesson of the monsters, Grand Xia did not hold back anymore.","They hadn’t cleaned up before because they didn’t know that there would be so many terrifying experts and such a powerful force outside.","But after this incident, everyone had come to understand that the Central Plains was not the center of the world, much less powerful.","They had to prepare for the worst. Other than the monsters being scattered and raised as spirit beasts, the marine folks were scattered and mixed into various forces. It could be considered that they had completely integrated with the humans.","The marine folks were trembling. They were secretly furious, but they did not dare to show it. They did not mention the difference in strength between the marine folks and the humans.","Any one of the three half-Emperors of the humans could easily wipe out all the marine folks.","There was still the most terrifying Chu Yunfan in the humans!","Although the marine folks didn’t participate in that battle, they still sent people to watch. The experts of the marine folks were all watching from afar, ready to flee at any moment. If the Imperial Capital of Grand Xia couldn’t hold on, the marine folks experts would flee with the essence of the marine folks.","No one felt that the humans could withstand such a lineup. It was just how long they could withstand it.","However, no one expected that Chu Yunfan would return and easily kill the endless monster army and pacify these powerful enemies from beyond the heavens.","In the eyes of the marine folks, the powerful half-Emperors were all killed by Chu Yunfan with a single sword strike. They were all killed easily, not to mention the army. They couldn’t withstand Chu Yunfan’s sword strike at all.","King Chu, who had returned, shocked the world with his shocking strength and intimidated the marine folks, allowing the merger of the humans and the marine folks to be completed smoothly."]},{"number":2521,"title":"Chapter 2521: The Purgatory Realm","paragraphs":["Chapter 2521: The Purgatory Realm","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","With Chu Yunfan in charge, the unification of the Central Plains was exceptionally smooth!","Basically, it was not difficult. Be it the marine folks or the monsters, regardless of whether there was a King guarding them, they had to obediently accept this reality.","The strength that Chu Yunfan had displayed was too terrifying. He had easily defeated the army of Emperor Skyquake Monster.","After making all the necessary arrangements, Chu Yunfan left the Central Plains and entered the void.","For the first time, star paths appeared in front of Tang Siyu.","Apart from Chu Yunfan, Tang Siyu had also come out with him. While Chu Yunfan was overseeing things, Tang Siyu had finally decided to follow Chu Yunfan to the starry sky.","After all, they were husband and wife, and they were much stronger than one person. If things really didn’t work out, they could let Tang Siyu enter the Mountain River Diagram. With Chu Yunfan’s protection, there wouldn’t be too much danger. In fact, it would be much safer than in the Central Plains.","“Is this the star path of the universe?” Tang Siyu felt the ancient starry sky paths. These paths couldn’t be seen with the naked eye, but she could sense them with her divine will. This was the star paths of the universe. If one wasn’t a half-Emperor, they wouldn’t be able to sense them at all, because a path could be dozens of light-years wide. If one wasn’t a half-Emperor, it was impossible to sense such a long distance.","“That’s right, it’s here!” Chu Yunfan nodded. “But we’re not going to the Ancient Realm, we’re going to the Purgatory Realm!”","“The Purgatory Realm? What kind of place is that?” Tang Siyu said.","“The Purgatory Realm is where Emperor Evil is hiding now. The environment is very, very bad. It was a battlefield of Emperors before the collapse of the antiquity era. Many Emperors fought there, so the natural laws there are very distorted. It’s so distorted that even the natural laws and space are broken. Those who aren’t half-Emperors can’t pass through!” Chu Yunfan said. “It’s said that it’s very difficult to survive there, which is why it’s called the Purgatory Realm. Even the Emperors don’t go there easily because it’s the battlefield where the Emperors fought. There are many traces left behind by the Emperors, some of which are powerful enough to severely injure the Emperors. If there’s one place in the world that can protect Emperor Evil, it must be the Purgatory Realm!”","These were all the information that Chu Yunfan had collected over the years. He had not only cultivated in the dark, but he had also collected a lot of information.","Because he had the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, so he knew long ago what kind of conditions were needed to be able to break through to the Emperor Stage.","Thus, he had long since set his sights on Emperor Evil’s evil world.","He had already gathered a lot of information, and had been waiting. He knew that someone else wanted Emperor Evil dead even more than he did.","They were the four Emperors who had surrounded Emperor Evil. As long as they followed them, there was nothing wrong. Although Emperor Evil was good at hiding, he couldn’t stop the four Emperors from scouting him.","The news of Emperor Evil’s appearance spread throughout the entire ancient star path. Not only were there top experts above the seventh half-Emperor Stage, but there were also many ordinary half-Emperors among them.","Emperor Evil had far too many treasures on him. At the same time, many people believed that he also had the secret to becoming a true Emperor, and that countless people were eagerly waiting to see it.","“Let’s go! We have to get out of here before the others kill Emperor Evil!” Chu Yunfan said.","Chu Yunfan wasn’t interested in anything else on Emperor Evil. What he was really interested in was the world that had yet to take shape.","He also believed that this was the true goal of many people.","A month later, Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu finally arrived at the Purgatory Realm through the ancient star path.","In the outer area of the Purgatory Realm, there were gaps in space and laws. In the eyes of a half-Emperor, the laws could not be hidden, so the gaps in laws could be seen clearly.","This was something only an Emperor could do!","Kings could only sense the existence of laws, while half-Emperors could actually see the existence of laws. However, it was impossible to influence laws.","The laws used by the half-Emperors were formed by themselves. They were their own laws, and they used their own laws to trigger the power of heaven and earth to fight.","However, Emperors were different. Emperors could directly activate the laws of heaven and earth and trigger the power of heaven and earth.","They had already come into contact with the most basic power of heaven and earth. Their power could even go deep into the level of basic laws and shatter laws.","Even though he had long understood the principle, when he saw this scene, he still felt very shocked.","However, Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu didn’t sigh for long.","“Get ready and be careful. Open your domain anytime and anywhere to avoid being hurt by the sudden interruption of the laws!” Chu Yunfan said.","In his eyes, these broken laws were like sharp weapons. If one was not careful, one could be directly cut into two.","“Okay!” Tang Siyu nodded.","The two of them stepped on flowing lights and entered this area. Neither of them chose to directly tear space to advance. The various laws were too chaotic, and so were the spatial laws. They did not support tearing space at all.","There was a chaotic space everywhere, and there were even many terrifying and strange creatures wandering in it.","These strange creatures were born in this Purgatory Realm. They were real purgatory creatures. The chaotic environment wasn’t an obstacle to them. On the contrary, it became a help to them.","These powerful creatures were either alone or in groups. When they saw Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu, they launched a desperate attack.","There were simply too many of them, and they were endless. Chu Yunfan simply let Tang Siyu enter the Mountain River Diagram and start cultivating.","With Evil Gods Creed’s countless resources and the fact that she had left the Central Plains, there were no longer any restrictions. Tang Siyu could do her best to cultivate.","Not long after, she broke through to the third half-Emperor Stage and was beginning to advance to the fourth stage.","Although this wasn’t a powerful force in the current Purgatory Realm, it had further strengthened her ability to protect herself.","During this process, Chu Yunfan kept approaching the core area of the Purgatory Realm. He spread his wings of lightning and flew toward it like a stream of light.","“Roar!”","Suddenly, a furious roar came from the depths of the Purgatory Realm. The sound waves shook the entire Purgatory Realm."]},{"number":2522,"title":"Chapter 2522: Encircling and Supressing Emperor Evil","paragraphs":["Chapter 2522: Encircling and Supressing Emperor Evil","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Purgatory Realm was trembling slightly!","Even the creatures in the Purgatory Realm who were still attacking Chu Yunfan panicked.","Chu Yunfan’s expression changed slightly. To be able to make these creatures in the Purgatory Realm, who were not even afraid of a half-Emperor, start to be afraid, there was no one else except for an Emperor.","These creatures were exterminated creatures born from the destruction. They were an extremely rare type of creature. From the perspective of Emperors, they would usually not be seen.","Creatures that would only be born during the end of the world, when the world collapsed, and when the gods fell. The only purpose of these creatures’ ‘existence was to destroy the entire world.","There was nothing they were afraid of. Even if they weren’t a match for a half-Emperor, they would still come in groups. These creatures could use the aura of destruction to revive themselves endlessly. Even a half-Emperor had no chance of winning in such a terrifying situation.","That was why it was called the Purgatory Realm, and even half-Emperors were unwilling to set foot in it.","This time, a large number of half-Emperors were involved because the temptation was strong enough. Otherwise, these half-Emperors wouldn’t have been so tempted.","If he was not mistaken, it was Emperor Evil!","Something must have happened to Emperor Evil for him to suddenly make such a noise.","Chu Yunfan no longer hesitated. He flapped the lightning wings on his back and stopped fighting with these creatures of extinction.","He directly flew into the distance.","At this moment, in the depths of the Purgatory Realm, countless broken laws appeared in front of everyone. They didn’t need to use divine will to sense them. They could be seen with the naked eye. It was extremely shocking.","In the depths of the Purgatory Realm, an enormous figure stood in the center of the entire Purgatory Realm.","It looked to be over ten thousand miles tall, and it looked like a giant that stood between heaven and earth.","It was an unimaginable height!","It was a body that gathered countless evil, chaos, and terror. It was impossible to tell what kind of terrifying existence it was.","One could only see that the huge body was covered in endless scales. Each scale was larger than a few people combined.","The only thing that could be seen was that there was a huge wound on the creature’s chest. It had been pierced through by someone.","It looked extremely terrifying.","Near the wound, the endless evil energy was fighting against balls of monter energy, magic energy, corpse energy, elemental energy, and so on.","This was a confrontation that involved the origin, and it was also a wound left behind during the Great War of the Five Emperors.","Not even the powerful Emperor Evil could heal such a wound.","Everyone could see that his life force was draining away.","However, Emperor Evil was an Emperor, and his life force was simply too strong. Even though his life force was rapidly draining away, he was still able to drag out his life despite the injuries that would have killed an ordinary person long ago.","In the void, powerful figures emerged one after another. They were all half-Emperors from various forces. In addition to the experts under the four Emperors, there were also many itinerant cultivators.","This was the first time Chu Yunfan had seen so many itinerant cultivators, and there were even many of them who were at the ninth half-Emperor Stage.","But after a moment, Chu Yunfan understood, because these experts had all gone into hiding.","Why did they hide?","It was probably to avoid the pursuit of the ten Emperors.","In the Ancient Realm, the top ten forces only allowed the existences of sixth half-Emperors. If they got close, they would be killed. If they exceeded the limit, they would die from all kinds of things.","Under such circumstances, there was no other way for them to hide.","At this moment, a fierce battle was taking place in the core area of the Purgatory Realm. The blood of Emperor Evil quickly merged into the bodies of the purgatory creatures, turning into half-Emperor Evil Gods.","And these Evil Gods clashed with the experts that came from all directions.","Without exception, all the experts who dared to rush here were the best of the best. Their bodies erupted with a terrifying aura that was boundless and vast like the sea.","Some of them were fighting the new Evil Gods, while others were attacking Emperor Evil.","All sorts of terrifying attacks that could shatter planets were launched toward Emperor Evil.","However, Emperor Evil couldn’t move at all. He could only rely on his powerful body to resist.","Above Emperor Evil’s head, a long spear was spinning, radiating boundless power.","It was the terrifying Emperor artifact that Emperor Evil was famous for, the Evil God Spear.","With the Evil God Spear, Emperor Evil had killed countless enemies, and the Evil God Spear had drunk the blood of countless enemies, including Emperors.","What was contending against it was a stone saber that emitted endless stone energy. The stone energy spread out and almost turned the world into a stone painting. It looked vast and strange.","It was Emperor Stone’s In-Stone Saber!","It was the Emperor artifact that made Emperor Stone famous!","Only the In-Stone Saber could contend against the Evil God Spear!","However, other than the In-Stone Saber, there was also a dazzling light. Upon closer inspection, it was a banner made of unknown material.","This was the Myriad Monster Banner that belonged to another Emperor, Emperor Skyquake Monster!","It was the powerful Emperor artifact that Emperor Skyquake Monster relied on to become famous!","The Myriad Monster Banner combined with the In-Stone Saber finally restrained the Evil God Spear.","Because their masters had not come personally, the power of the In-Stone Saber and the Myriad Monster Banner was not enough to suppress the Evil God Spear.","After all, although Emperor Evil was heavily injured, he was still alive. He could easily use the Evil God Spear to fend off the In-Stone Saber and the Myriad Monster Banner.","At the same time, Chu Yunfan saw that there were five enormous five-colored divine mountains on Emperor Evil’s body, firmly suppressing him. Otherwise, these half-Emperors might not be a match for him.","Emperor Evil’s four limbs and even his head were suppressed by the five different-colored divine mountains.","This was the Emperor artifact of the Emperor Elements, the Elements Divine Mountain!","The five-colored divine mountain represented the powerful power of the five elements, metal, wood, water, fire, and earth!","Only an Emperor artifact could temporarily suppress Emperor Evil’s body, rendering him immobile.","However, Chu Yunfan felt a little strange. Since he had seen the Emperor artifacts of the three Emperors, why didn’t he see the Emperor artifact of Emperor Magus?","There had to be a reason for this. Otherwise, among the four Emperors, the one who led the attack on Emperor Evil had the biggest grudge against Emperor Evil.","He should be the one most afraid of Emperor Evil escaping.","However, not only did Emperor Magus not show up, even his Emperor artifact didn’t show up."]},{"number":2523,"title":"Chapter 2523: Die Together","paragraphs":["Chapter 2523: Die Together","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan didn’t know what was going on, but he knew that Emperor Evil was doomed.","Although none of the nine Emperors were present, there were three Emperor artifacts. Although they could not be compared to the peak combat strength that could be erupted when their masters were present, it was still possible to suppress Emperor Evil for a short period of time!","Emperor Evil didn’t have time to recover, so he was forced to die.","The wound looked extremely terrifying. What was even more terrifying was that with the strength of an Emperor and the strength of his body, ordinary wounds could recover in the blink of an eye.","However, more than ten years had passed, and the wounds on Emperor Evil’s body had not healed. Instead, they had worsened.","It was easy to imagine that Emperor Evil’s injury was no ordinary one.","At this moment, the experts in the battlefield were very tacitly not attacking each other. Instead, they divided into different camps to work together.","The powerful cultivators under the command of the Emperors began to channel their divine power to control the Emperor artifacts to suppress Emperor Evil.","The remaining people either dealt with the Evil Gods or directly launched attacks at Emperor Evil.","Although these attacks didn’t seem to hurt Emperor Evil much, the overwhelming number of half-Emperors was enough to make Emperor Evil scream in pain, and his injury worsened.","Chu Yunfan knew that these people were determined to exhaust Emperor Evil to death.","If they wanted to kill an Emperor, this was the only way. Other than this, they had no chance of winning!","Chu Yunfan hid in the air and didn’t show himself. This was not the time to show himself. In any case, there were always people who were making a move. He could wait slowly.","They waited for an entire month, during which time everyone used the same method to keep Emperor Evil occupied.","Everyone was very patient, and no one was impatient. Slowly, they weakened Emperor Evil, making him their prey.","Emperor Evil’s aura was weakening bit by bit. It was not as strong as Chu Yunfan had sensed a month ago. It had been weakened by at least half.","The half-Emperors who were in charge of controlling the three Emperor artifacts had also been changed one batch after another. This was because these three Emperor artifacts weren’t something they could easily control.","Their realms were too far away from the Emperor Stage. They could only use this method to continuously control the three Emperor artifacts.","Suddenly, a vague figure appeared above the Elements Divine Mountain. He wore a five-colored robe and the power of the elements law around him turned into a wheel that spun around.","Many people recognized this faintly translucent figure. It was none other than the legendary Emperor Elements.","“Emperor Evil, as a fellow Emperor, I wanted to allow you to die in a dignified manner! Why didn’t you surrender? Why did you drag this out and lose the face of us Emperors?” Emperor Elements spoke indifferently, but his voice easily spread throughout the entire Purgatory Realm.","“Allow me to die in a dignified manner?” A cruel and mocking smile appeared on Emperor Evil’s terrifying face. “Then I really have to thank you for your great kindness, right?”","“Isn’t that so? Do you still have a chance to turn the tables? Since ancient times, there have been more than one or two Emperors who have fallen. It doesn’t matter if you’re one more!” Emperor Elements said indifferently. “Isn’t it good to die a dignified death and fulfill the dignity of an Emperor?”","“A dignified death? I’ve killed my way out of an endless mountain of corpses and sea of blood. I don’t know what dignity is!” Emperor Evil cursed in anger.","“Does the initiator have no descendants? Sooner or later, you will regret what you have done today!”","“What a pity, what a pity. I wanted to kill all of you together, but you were still as careful as ever. However, I didn’t lose out by taking all of your subordinates away!” Emperor Evil sighed. It was a pity that the other Emperors weren’t there.","When everyone heard this, they realized that things were not going well. Suddenly, a terrifying evil aura exploded out from Emperor Evil, which transformed into streams of evil fire that swept out in all directions like monstrous waves.","They headed straight for the half-Emperors.","Emperor Evil had been pushed to the limit, and he was ready to die together with them!","“Emperor Evil, how dare you!”","At this moment, Emperor Elements also let out an angry roar, but it was useless. His original body was not here. In an instant, this primordial spirit was destroyed by the evil fire.","In just a moment, the world was filled with evil flames. Some experts who could not dodge in time were all swept into it. In just a short time, they had all turned into green smoke that filled the sky and disappeared without a trace.","“You are like ants. Even if I am at this stage, I am not someone you can touch. Today, I will bury you all with me!” Emperor Evil let out a shrill cry, his evil red eyes filled with madness and reluctance.","Rumble!","Terrifying explosions erupted from Emperor Evil’s body, and more evil flames swept out throughout the Purgatory Realm.","Many half-Emperors didn’t even have time to scream before they turned into smoke and died without a burial place.","The strength of a half-Emperor was useless in this place!","Only the best among the half-Emperors could dodge this terrifying attack, because most of the explosive power of Emperor Evil was suppressed and absorbed by the Elements Divine Mountain.","Even so, the shockwave from the explosion easily swept away the cultivators at second and third half-Emperor Stage.","This was especially true for the itinerant cultivators. They had suffered heavy losses. In an instant, the explosion had taken away at least 300 half-Emperors.","The other experts at the sixth, seventh, and even eighth or ninth half-Emperor Stage were also injured.","At that moment, Chu Yunfan also formed the Mountain River Diagram to block the terrifying aftershock of the explosion.","And this explosion was only the first wave!","Emperor Evil’s body was still churning with energy, and it was spreading out in circles.","“Suppress him!”","At this moment, a half-Emperor under Emperor Elements roared.","At this moment, many of the remaining half-Emperors began to control the three Emperor artifacts, desperately suppressing the terrifying power that was about to erupt.","Boom!","At this moment, another terrifying explosion sounded. An even more terrifying explosive energy swept out from his body. Even the Elements Divine Mountain collapsed on the spot. There was no way to stop or suppress it."]},{"number":2524,"title":"Chapter 2524: Chaotic Battle, Unformed World in Hand","paragraphs":["Chapter 2524: Chaotic Battle, Unformed World in Hand","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Boom!","The terrifying explosion shook the entire universe. The entire Purgatory Realm was shaking crazily. The already cracked and destroyed laws of heaven and earth surged in all directions like a tidal wave.","Countless shockwaves swept out, and no one could stop Emperor Evil from self-destructing.","Everyone was trying to protect themselves, especially the ordinary half-Emperors, who were filled with regret. Who would have thought that Emperor Evil would go so crazy?","Just as they had expected, Emperor Evil had reached the end of his life.","Most of his Emperor essence had been taken away, so he couldn’t live for long. But at the same time, he still had the ability to fight back. No wonder those Emperors were so cunning and didn’t come. At most, they only sent their artifacts.","Because they were also Emperors, they naturally knew that even in the end, Emperors could still erupt with power. It was extremely terrifying.","In the end, if he fought with all his might, he might even bring a certain Emperor to his death.","This was the most terrifying part!","Only the half-Emperors didn’t know anything. They had made a huge mistake in judging the strength of an Emperor based on the strength of a half-Emperor.","The three Emperor artifacts were all trying their best to suppress Emperor Evil’s explosion. No one cared about the Evil God Spear at all.","After suppressing this last wave, they would be safe.","At the same time, those half-Emperors were also unleashing their greatest power. Some of them even started to burn their own vitality to resist this terrifying explosive force.","Even though the three great Emperor artifacts had neutralized most of the shockwaves from the explosion, there were still many weaker half-Emperors who evaporated into thin air.","He didn’t know how much time had passed. It felt like only a second had passed, but it also felt like a century had passed.","Every second that passed in that explosion felt as long as a century.","“It’s over. I’m still alive!” someone said in disbelief.","It was as if he could not believe that he was still alive. It was really an unbelievable miracle.","Under such circumstances, everyone felt that it was a miracle that they had survived.","At this moment, less than one-fifth of the half-Emperors had survived.","Almost all the low-level half-Emperors were killed in the explosion.","The losses of the various forces were immeasurable. Although most of them were itinerant cultivators, there were still many half-Emperors under the command of several Emperors. The losses were immeasurable.","There were even many seventh and eighth half-Emperors who had been killed in the explosion.","No one had expected Emperor Evil to be so crazy as to drag them down with him. If it weren’t for the three Emperor artifacts that had suppressed most of the damage, there wouldn’t even be a fifth of them left alive.","It would be a miracle if one of them survived.","Emperor Evil had used all of his remaining Emperor essence to create this self-detonation. The power of this self-detonation was no different from that of a small world.","Even the three great Emperor artifacts had cracks and damage. It was unknown how many resources and how much time it would take to repair them.","Just the loss of the three great Emperor artifacts was already an incalculable amount.","“Evil God Spear! It’s the Evil God Spear!”","Suddenly, someone remembered that there was another Emperor artifact in the sky other than the three Emperor artifacts. It was the Evil God Spear.","As expected, the thing floating in the sky was the Evil God Spear.","The Evil God Spear floated quietly in the air. Since it had lost its master, it only floated quietly, emitting a faint evil aura that shattered the void.","Before anyone could react, there were already half a dozen half-Emperors flying toward the Evil God Spear.","In an instant, they were already in front of the Evil God Spear.","“You’re courting death!”","At this moment, the Elements Divine Mountain pressed down on the few half-Emperors.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","The few half-Emperors were shattered on the spot, turning into blood mist. Even though they were the best among the half-Emperors, they had no chance of winning against the power of the elements.","Everyone went crazy. Even with the suppression of the Elements Divine Mountain, they couldn’t stop this madness. This was an Emperor artifact. Whoever could get one would be able to sweep across the entire half-Emperor Stage.","All kinds of fights broke out at once, and the Elements Divine Mountain could not sweep through the area, because at the same time, the In-Stone Saber and the Myriad Monster Banner also joined the battle.","At this moment, the three Emperor artifacts collided in the air. The dazzling pressure of the Emperor path forced the group of half-Emperors to retreat.","At this moment, the core of the Purgatory Realm had turned into a chaotic battlefield.","Everyone was attacking crazily, and they no longer had the tacit understanding they had when they were working together. There was only one Evil God Spear, and it was impossible to satisfy everyone. Even if they couldn’t get it, they definitely couldn’t allow others to take it.","For a moment, the entire world turned into a battlefield. Although there were less than one-fifth of the original number of half-Emperors left, they were all the top half-Emperors. In terms of real combat power, they were not much worse than when they were at their peak.","Under such circumstances, no one noticed that after Emperor Evil self-destructed, an ethereal, almost transparent substance floated out.","“An unformed world!” Chu Yunfan could see clearly from the Mountain River Diagram that this was the unformed world he had been waiting for.","It was like a universe that was taking shape and about to explode. It was in a state where it was about to explode into a world, but it had yet to explode.","This was an unformed world, and it was what many half-Emperors needed the most to become Emperors.","“Attack!”","With a thought, Chu Yunfan left the world of the Mountain River Diagram and directly flew into this unformed world. He grabbed at this world with one hand.","“How dare you!”","Suddenly, just as Chu Yunfan was about to succeed, a shocked and angry voice was heard. Then, Chu Yunfan felt a terrifying energy wave sweep over from behind him.","Chu Yunfan had no other choice. He immediately conjured the Mountain River Cauldron and shielded behind him.","Boom!","A terrifying attack came, and Chu Yunfan’s movements were slowed down for a moment. However, he still successfully grabbed the unformed world in his hand.","“Success!” Chu Yunfan was overjoyed. He had finally succeeded.","This time, his plan had succeeded. He was only a step away from the Emperor Stage."]},{"number":2525,"title":"Chapter 2525: Some Paths Are Invincible Paths","paragraphs":["Chapter 2525: Some Paths Are Invincible Paths","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","At this moment, Chu Yunfan finally had the time to turn around and see a huge beast hidden in the void. The huge beast looked like a qilin, but it had a single horn on its head.","There was a terrifying energy fluctuation on this horn.","“King Scaly One-Horn!” Chu Yunfan immediately knew who it was. It was almost the number one general under Emperor Skyquake Monster, even more shocking than King Hatred Monster.","Basically, they could be considered the top experts of the world. If there were ten experts in the world, then King Scaly One-Horn must be one of them.","Because Emperors were too aloof, and they were basically sealed all year round, no one would count Emperors in.","Even though Emperors were very active now, it was normal for many cultivators to not hear of Emperors reviving in their entire lives, for hundreds, or even for thousands of years.","Clearly, unlike the others who were chasing after the Evil God Spear, King Scaly One-Horn was more interested in this unformed world.","Although the power of the Evil God Spear was shocking, if he could seize it, he would be known as the number one person under the Emperor.","But what use was that?","Even if he wasn’t the strongest person below the Emperor Stage, he was still one of the top experts below the Emperor Stage.","This kind of false reputation was completely useless to him.","However, this unformed world was different. It was enough for him to become a Emperor.","Who would be interested in being the number one person below the Emperor Stage? If they wanted to be, they would become an Emperor and become an existence that could truly decide their fate.","It truly broke the curse that no one had been able to become an Emperor for countless years.","“Hand over that thing and you can live!”","At this moment, another figure landed. This figure was not a person at all, but a jade person with a jade color.","If he sat up straight, he would be like a jade statue!","This was Emperor Stone’s subordinate, the top expert of the Rock Spirit lineage, King Jade!","Because Emperor Stone himself was from the Rock Spirit lineage, most of the experts under his command were top experts of the Rock Spirit lineage. Among them, King Jade was the best of the best.","His status was similar to King Scaly One-Horn, and he was the number one expert under Emperor Stone.","“It seems that everyone wants to compete with me!”","Suddenly, another cold snort was heard, and a robust figure descended from the sky. It was a man dressed in the magi’s uniform. He had a robust figure, a resolute face, and the energy and blood in his body were the most astonishing. It was almost possible to see the grand occasion of his boiling energy and blood with the naked eye.","“Imperial Frontier!”","Instantly, everyone’s expression changed. They did not expect to meet the peerless master of Magi Circle, Imperial Frontier, here.","In fact, Imperial Frontier was even older than the people here. Imperial Frontier had already become famous in Magi Circle in ancient times.","He had once shone for an era. Almost everyone felt that he was the most likely existence to become an Emperor in that era.","He was to be the second Emperor in Magi Circle after Emperor Magus.","However, Imperial Frontier was completely out of everyone’s expectations. He didn’t become an Emperor, but disappeared. Later, they found out that he had sealed himself.","Since then, Imperial Frontier had come out of seclusion a few times, and each time, it had solved a huge problem for Magi Circle.","In the current Magi Circle, Imperial Frontier was simply a living legend.","Although he didn’t appear often, there were still legends about him in the martial arts world.","Moreover, due to the method of self-sealing, people from different eras often mingled together in the Ancient Realm.","This made it so that even experts from a very long time ago were well-known.","Only those who had reached the peak of the ninth half-Emperor Stage were qualified to covet the unformed world.","For ordinary people, even if they obtained it, it would be useless. They had not reached the standard to truly use it.","These few experts formed a faint encirclement around Chu Yunfan.","They had reached a tacit agreement to destroy Chu Yunfan first.","Chu Yunfan sensed that more and more experts were turning their attention to him.","Although the Evil God Spear was the favorite of many people, the value of this unformed world was no less than the Evil God Spear. In fact, many people felt that the value of this unformed world was far above the Evil God Spear.","Although Emperor artifacts were rare, it was not impossible to see them. What was even rarer was the unformed world.","“Looks like I have to end this quickly!” Chu Yunfan sighed.","He knew that he didn’t have much time left. Before the half-Emperors who were still chasing the Evil God Spear could react, he had to get rid of these people to leave with this unformed world.","Even Chu Yunfan would feel his scalp go numb when facing so many half-Emperors.","More importantly, there were terrifying Emperors behind these experts.","What Chu Yunfan wanted was to buy time!","What he lacked the most was time!","He couldn’t delay!","“End this quickly? Humans are a little too confident!” At this moment, King Scaly One-Horn slowly opened its mouth and said.","“Confidence? I don’t think so! I’m just stating the facts!” Chu Yunfan replied indifferently.","“What do you have to fight with us?” King Jade’s jade-colored light illuminated the heavens and earth. It was incomparably resplendent and looked extremely vast.","“That’s right. If you hand it over today, you might have a way out. There are some things that you can’t touch!” Imperial Frontier looked at Chu Yunfan coldly as if he was looking at a dead man.","They had absolute confidence that with their strength, they were just below Emperors.","“Some paths are the path of invincibility!” Chu Yunfan said. “I know that there are many experts who are afraid of some Emperors, but that doesn’t include you!”","Chu Yunfan’s voice was extremely domineering and shook the world.","In the blink of an eye, Chu Yunfan made his move. Behind him, countless phenomena boiled. The Brahma Tree turned into a combat suit, and above his head, the Mountain River Diagram spun.","He directly punched out with a backhand. The laws entangled together and transformed into eight heavenly dragons.","These eight heavenly dragons were no longer fist intent. Each of them was evolved from powerful laws. They were truly powerful and invincible.","His first target was King Jade!","“You’re courting death!” King Jade sneered.","The Rock Spirit lineage was invincible in terms of physical strength.","Everyone in the Ancient Realm knew this. Even the powerful warriors of the magi, who were also good at physical strength, would find it difficult to gain an advantage in their hands.","This was because their bodies were not made of flesh and blood at all. They were just a pile of stones. How could human flesh compete with stones?","Boom!","The fists of both sides collided fiercely."]},{"number":2526,"title":"Chapter 2526: Killing Peak Half-Emperors Like Killing Ants","paragraphs":["Chapter 2526: Killing Peak Half-Emperors Like Killing Ants","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Boom!","It was as if two huge stars had collided on the spot.","Both of them were already at the ninth half-Emperor Stage, and they were even the best among them.","However, the outcome was decided in an instant.","After a loud bang, King Jade’s arm, which was originally as warm as jade and extremely hard, actually exploded. First, his palm, then his entire arm, completely exploded.","King Jade screamed and retreated!","He stared at Chu Yunfan as green sweat began to flow from his forehead.","One could imagine how shocking this punch was.","That was just a moment ago. At the most critical moment, he had left the range of the battle. Otherwise, he even suspected that Chu Yunfan’s punch might have smashed half of his body.","This was something that had never happened before. Even if he encountered a magi with unparalleled physical bodies, his Rock Spirit lineage had never been afraid.","This was nothing to the Rock Spirit lineage.","There had never been such a situation before. In a battle of the same level, he was almost blown up!","This had never happened before!","None of the other half-Emperors present had expected the outcome to be decided so quickly!","Chu Yunfan’s aura surged to the extreme!","Chu Yunfan looked at him coldly, his eyes bursting with a terrifying light.","His aura was constantly rising. In his eyes, these people were all his whetstones to temper his invincible aura!","To break through to the Emperor Stage, one had to have an invincible aura. As long as one was invincible, one would be able to break through in one breath!","However, that kind of aura was not easy to nurture. With Chu Yunfan’s current cultivation, it would be difficult to nurture it no matter how many people he killed.","This kind of invincibility was not the invincibility of slaughtering the weak, but the supreme aura of daring to wield a saber in the face of a top-notch expert. At the very least, it had to be an expert of the same level.","Normally, it would be difficult to find one as they were scattered across the vast Ancient Realm. But now, because of Emperor Evil, they were all gathered together.","It could be used as a whetstone to sharpen his aura!","“Impossible!” King Jade stared at Chu Yunfan, unable to believe that he had lost in a physical battle, and in such a tragic way.","“Why is it impossible? If an Emperor can crush you with a single punch, so can I!” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","Chu Yunfan’s physical body was no longer inferior to that of an ordinary Emperor. Although he was not considered outstanding among Emperors, it was a simple matter for him to deal with King Jade.","The Rock Spirit lineage was indeed impressive. In the same level, their physical bodies were not inferior to the magi. In fact, they were even more powerful.","The strength of the magi lay in the strength of their energy and blood, while the strength of the Rock Spirit lineage was purely based on one’s own strength.","They were born to be this strong. They did not even need any special training methods. As long as time passed, they would become more and more powerful. They were a completely unreasonable race.","If it wasn’t for the fact that the Rock Spirit lineage was relatively small in number, it might not be impossible for them to unify the world.","However, in front of Chu Yunfan, these were really nothing.","He couldn’t block Chu Yunfan’s casual punch at all!","“Everyone, this b*stard is definitely not a good person. Although we don’t know his background, if we don’t kill him, our Emperor path will be blocked!” King Jade clutched his arm and circulated all his energy, trying to expel Chu Yunfan’s energy.","His entire body was wrapped in a jade-colored light. At this moment, he erupted with a monstrous pressure. The power in his entire body was boiling and surging.","The other experts were the same. Their blood and energy were surging at the same time.","All kinds of strange phenomena covered the sky and covered the earth. Domains were opened. Even in this extremely dangerous Purgatory Realm, domains could be spread out smoothly without being affected by the broken laws. This was something that only the top experts could do.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan made his move, and it was in the direction of King Jade. His expression was solemn, and behind him, eight powerful gods appeared, suppressing all the terrifying aura and preventing it from invading his body.","“Die!” Chu Yunfan’s body swayed.","In an instant, he tore open the space in the broken Purgatory Realm. All kinds of spatial fluctuations were like sharp blades, wanting to smash Chu Yunfan into pieces.","However, Chu Yunfan directly passed through it. He was protected by the mature Brahma Tree, which turned into an emerald green battle robe and stabilized the space.","In an instant, he had already arrived in front of King Jade.","King Jade was caught off guard. Chu Yunfan had torn his domain apart, leaving him no room to fight back.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan threw a punch, and in an instant, it landed directly on King Jade’s body.","King Jade didn’t even have time to react. His body was unparalleled, but his speed was only average. He didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to tear open space.","This seemed like a very simple thing on the outside, but in here, it was terrifyingly difficult. Even they could not do it.","It wasn’t that they couldn’t forcefully tear open space, but that after tearing open space, they might be torn apart by the torn space. The space here was too unstable, and even spatial laws were broken here.","Without the support of spatial laws, any kind of tearing of space was courting death.","Even with his tyrannical body, he didn’t dare to do so.","However, Chu Yunfan was still able to reach him and tear his defensive domain apart.","He was unable to react in time and was hit by Chu Yunfan’s punch on the spot.","Boom!","A terrifying explosion erupted from King Jade’s body. He spat out a mouthful of blood as his chest was completely destroyed. Blood kept spurting out as immortal light filled the air.","The mist that was released from his body looked extremely terrifying, causing the entire Purgatory Realm to tremble slightly.","King Jade’s eyes were wide open. His body was still surrounded by the jade-colored light that had just erupted. He had never thought that he would be pierced through by a punch so easily.","Then, his body shattered inch by inch. He actually disintegrated in the air and turned into fragments that scattered all over the sky.","However, the emerald green battle armor on Chu Yunfan’s body suddenly extended many tentacles and absorbed King Jade’s broken body into the battle armor.","The light of the battle suit became even more brilliant, and it was greatly replenished.","All of this might seem like a long story, but in reality, it had only happened in a very, very short period of time.","In an instant, King Jade was defeated and died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","The domain collapsed and the world shook!"]},{"number":2527,"title":"Chapter 2527: Killing Imperial Frontier, Unparalleled Combat Strength","paragraphs":["Chapter 2527: Killing Imperial Frontier, Unparalleled Combat Strength","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The speed was too fast!","To be precise, King Jade died too quickly!","It was so fast that no one could react!","King Jade was a well-known existence in the Ancient Realm. Even though everyone else had a different standpoint from him, no one doubted King Jade’s strength.","It was hard to say if he would be ranked in the top ten, but King Jade would definitely be ranked in the top twenty.","Of course, this was without counting the Emperors.","This was already a situation that counted the experts of countless eras since ancient times. Among the experts who were still alive, they were definitely the top.","Moreover, at their level, the difference in cultivation was not very big. They had already reached the peak.","Unless one could enter the Emperor Stage, the difference in cultivation should not be too big.","This was undoubtedly a huge shock to everyone. It simply made their hair stand on end.","In an era where Emperors were rarely seen, they were the rulers of this era, the overlords of a region.","Basically, everything in the Ancient Realm and even the myriad worlds really depended on these few people.","They had not encountered any danger for many years, and no one could do anything to them.","Other than the Emperors, there was nothing to be afraid of. Even in a dangerous world like the Purgatory Realm, it was as easy as walking on flat ground for them.","They weren’t ordinary half-Emperors. An environment that was dangerous for ordinary half-Emperors wasn’t that dangerous for them.","However, they finally understood that the real danger did not come from the outside, but from Chu Yunfan.","Many people felt their hair stand on end.","“I’ll kill you first!”","Before they could think about it, Chu Yunfan flashed and appeared in front of Imperial Frontier.","Imperial Frontier’s body was surrounded by chaotic light. He had no weapons on his body. His fists were his weapons. He directly punched Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","A terrifying battle erupted between the two sides. This was an absolutely terrifying existence that had helped Magi Circle suppress peerless experts from countless eras.","But even so, the outcome of the battle with Chu Yunfan was also determined. Chu Yunfan’s body did not move at all as if he was Mount Tai.","Imperial Frontier retreated more than a hundred steps before he regained his footing.","Spurt!","Imperial Frontier spat out a mouthful of blood. His body was trembling, and his eyes were filled with horror.","He finally understood why King Jade was so vulnerable in front of Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan was too terrifying.","King Jade’s Rock Spirit lineage was considered extremely powerful in the entire Ancient Realm, and his physical body was unparalleled.","Even the magi did not dare to say that they were superior to the Rock Spirit lineage in this aspect.","After King Jade’s fist met Chu Yunfan’s, his entire arm was crippled and half of his body was almost smashed.","He only spat out blood and retreated. He was not seriously injured!","This was already very impressive, especially with King Jade as a warning. It could be seen that it was not a problem with his strength, but that Chu Yunfan was too abnormal.","It wasn’t a war crime!","However, Imperial Frontier only felt that this was a great humiliation!","At this moment, King Scaly One-Horn had also joined the battle. When his huge and terrifying body rushed toward Chu Yunfan, it was like a huge star smashing down in Chu Yunfan’s direction.","In an instant, the entire world was filled with dense monster energy. This was the power of King Scaly One-Horn.","Especially the horn on its head, which emitted a terrifying destruction energy.","It was completely filled with destruction laws.","Tens of thousands of endless laws swept out, turning into a torrent that swept toward Chu Yunfan.","This was the law that King Scaly One-Horn cultivated. It was the law of destruction. The horn on its head was actually the embodiment of the destruction law. In a fit of anger, the world would collapse. It could even destroy an entire world with this horn.","Even one of the destruction laws could easily destroy a continent, let alone thousands of them that swept over like a flood.","Chu Yunfan didn’t move at all. He didn’t even look at King Scaly One-Horn. The Mountain River Diagram above his head spun and directly swept away these destruction laws into nothingness. In an instant, they disappeared in the air without a trace.","It was like a dream as if it did not exist from the beginning!","Chu Yunfan caught up with Imperial Frontier once again.","Imperial Frontier instantly knew that things were not good. Chu Yunfan’s speed was too fast. He had caught up in an instant and did not give him a chance to escape.","“I have to go all out!” At this moment, Imperial Frontier had no other choice but to clash with Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","Terrifying sounds of collision shook the entire Purgatory Realm. Everyone saw Chu Yunfan and Imperial Frontier collide hundreds and thousands of times in an instant.","In an instant, Imperial Frontier’s arms exploded on the spot, turning into a bloody mist that filled the sky.","Although Imperial Frontier’s body was much stronger than King Jade’s, he was still too weak compared to Chu Yunfan. It was just a simple exchange of blows, and Imperial Frontier’s body was shattered.","Not only his arms, but even his body was covered in all kinds of cracks. He looked like a porcelain that was about to shatter. It was extremely terrifying.","What kind of terrifying battle prowess was that?","Imperial Frontier looked at Chu Yunfan in horror. He didn’t know how Chu Yunfan cultivated. They were both at the ninth half-Emperor Stage, but his combat strength was so different from Chu Yunfan’s. Since ancient times, he was said to be only one step away from reaching the Dao, but he was no match for Chu Yunfan. Who else could be his match?","However, just as his thoughts scattered, he saw Chu Yunfan already slap out.","His palm turned into a star and slammed into the Imperial Frontier.","Boom!","Imperial Frontier’s body was torn into pieces on the spot.","This was the power of the Flying Celestial Palm Strike, which shattered a peak half-Emperor.","At this moment, another figure joined in and suppressed the world.","The Elements Divine Mountain was shining above his head. He was another peak half-Emperor.","“Elements Sect, Supreme Sun Blaze!”","Chu Yunfan recognized the person. This person was none other than Supreme Sun Blaze of Elements Sect. Above his head, the powerful Elements Divine Mountain flickered and faintly emitted a pressure. It was a middle-aged man.","Around him, there were five elemental spirit spheres formed by the elements law. They coiled around him and spun around, looking extremely terrifying."]},{"number":2528,"title":"Chapter 2528: Being Beaten up Fiercefully","paragraphs":["Chapter 2528: Being Beaten up Fiercefully","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After Chu Yunfan easily defeated and killed Imperial Frontier, another peak half-Emperor joined the battle.","It wasn’t as if no one had seen the battlefield. The half-Emperors weren’t fools. They scanned the battlefield with their divine will and saw everything.","However, they were all chasing after the Evil God Spear. None of them dared to join the battle.","What kind of joke was this? Chu Yunfan’s combat strength was simply out of bounds, alright?","He easily killed King Jade and Imperial Frontier!","He was simply a super killing god. Even the Emperors might not have such killing efficiency!","Moreover, to them, Chu Yunfan was no different from the Emperors!","Because the Emperors could easily kill them, and Chu Yunfan could also easily kill them!","He could easily kill them anyway. What difference was there?","Therefore, even if they saw the battle situation here, they did not dare to join in. If it was not for the Evil God Spear that could attract their attention, they would have wanted to leave as soon as possible!","However, under such circumstances, another person had joined the battlefield!","Elements Sect’s Supreme Sun Blaze!","His strength had reached the peak of perfection. He was not below Imperial Frontier, King Jade, or the others. He was basically on par with them. Although there was a gap, it was basically impossible for him to kill the other party as easily as Chu Yunfan.","Most importantly, he had the Elements Divine Mountain with him. At this moment, only with the Emperor artifact could he have any hope of fighting Chu Yunfan.","No matter how one looked at it, it was the same!","“That’s right. Hand over the unformed world. Otherwise, you won’t be able to escape death!” Supreme Sun Blaze’s words shook the world and were sonorous and forceful.","“You? Do you think you can fight me just because you have an Emperor artifact?” Chu Yunfan calmly looked at the two half-Emperors in front of him.","At this moment, the Myriad Monster Banner on the head of King Scaly One-Horn was rotating, emitting a shocking monster energy to protect him.","Under such circumstances, those half-Emperors could only use their Emperor artifacts to have the courage to step forward. Without Emperor artifacts, they wouldn’t dare to step forward at all.","As soon as he finished speaking, Chu Yunfan erupted with astonishing speed. In an instant, he had already rushed in the direction of King Scaly One-Horn.","When King Scaly One-Horn saw this scene, he immediately knew that it was not good. At the same time, he was extremely angry. Chu Yunfan actually chose him as a breakthrough point. This was looking down on his rhythm.","Thinking of this, he became even more furious. In an instant, he transformed into a human. It was an ugly middle-aged man. He held a spear in his hand, and the spear emitted an endless destructive aura.","It was none other than the terrifying spear that had evolved from the horn on his head.","The spear light swept out and suppressed the heavens!","Destruction energy spread out, causing a commotion nearby. The nearby half-Emperors were all shocked and felt extremely terrified.","Was this still the power of a half-Emperor?","Chu Yunfan was even more direct. He threw a punch with a backhand.","Boom!","Eight gods tore the world apart and shattered everything. The golden light was incomparably dazzling, causing all colors to lose their original appearance. The entire Purgatory Realm was immersed in this terrifying golden light.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s punch collided with the spear formed by the horn.","The fist intent of the Eight Astonishing Punches and the destruction energy evolved from destruction law shook and swept in all directions.","Boom!","A terrifying force swept in all directions.","King Scaly One-Horn felt the destruction energy sweep over. At this moment, he finally understood why both King Jade and Imperial Frontier had been killed by Chu Yunfan.","The difference between the two sides was too great!","However, he was fearless. With a shake of the Myriad Monster Banner above his head, the huge force disappeared without a trace.","This was his greatest reliance. With the Emperor artifact on him, there was nothing to be afraid of.","No matter how strong Chu Yunfan’s attack was, could it surpass the Myriad Demon Flag?","The Myriad Monster Banner spun, and in an instant, a shocking ferocious beast appeared. It was the Myriad Monster Banner’s artifact spirit, and this ferocious beast was indescribable.","It was impossible to describe what it looked like. It was as if the appearance of all the demons in the world had been engraved into it.","It was the collective belief of countless demons in the world.","It seemed to have a vague shape, but it also seemed to have no shape.","In an instant, it charged straight at Chu Yunfan!","Above Chu Yunfan’s head, the Mountain River Diagram burst out with a terrifying light.","Only Emperor artifacts could resist Emperor artifacts!","But the power of the Mountain River Diagram had decreased without a weapon spirit. It was not comparable to the current Myriad Monster Banner. Moreover, the Mountain River Diagram itself was not an offensive Emperor artifact.","However, it was enough to buy Chu Yunfan some time.","The Mountain River Diagram transformed into a world, condensing reality from nothingness, directly suppressing this indescribable ferocious beast.","This indescribable beast kept struggling, trying to break free, but it could not break free from this world for a while.","However, every time it struggled, cracks would appear in the entire world, as if it was the end of the world.","However, the beast was still firmly suppressed!","At this moment, King Scaly One-Horn realized that things were not looking good for him. Chu Yunfan had an Emperor artifact protecting him. This was completely unexpected. But although the Mountain River Diagram was protecting Chu Yunfan, it had not used its full strength. Or rather, it had not encountered a situation where it needed to use its full strength.","Therefore, he thought that Chu Yunfan’s Mountain River Diagram was only a half-Emperor artifact. Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan would be so ferocious and hide an Emperor artifact on him, catching him off guard.","The moment the Myriad Monster Banner was delayed by the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan attacked again. The light from the Brahma Tree on his body tore everything apart and entered King Scaly One-Horn’s domain.","It swept through everything in its path, shattering everything.","Boom!","A punch once again blasted toward King Scaly One-Horn. King Scaly One-Horn blocked it with the Destruction Spear. However, this time, without the protection of the Myriad Monster Banner, the difference in strength between the two sides suddenly became obvious.","Bang!","In just an instant, King Scaly One-Horn’s entire arm was blasted apart. The Destruction Spear was sent flying, turning into a meteor that scattered.","In the battle with Chu Yunfan, he had suffered a great loss. King Scaly One-Horn’s body was also strong, but he could not be compared to King Jade and Imperial Frontier.","With just one punch, his arm exploded and spread to half of his body. It was extremely tragic.","“Flying Celestial Palm Strike!”","Chu Yunfan turned his hand and sent a Flying Celestial Palm Strike smashing down on King Scaly One-Horn.","“Don’t even think about it!”","At this moment, on the other side, Supreme Sun Blaze finally made his move."]},{"number":2529,"title":"Chapter 2529: This Is an Invincible Road Paved With Bones","paragraphs":["Chapter 2529: This Is an Invincible Road Paved With Bones","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","All of that happened in an instant!","It was so fast that even Supreme Sun Blaze couldn’t react in time.","He had never thought that King Scaly One-Horn would not be able to hold out for such a short time.","King Scaly One-Horn had the protection of the Myriad Monster Banner. No matter how one looked at it, he should be able to last for a long time.","Even if his cultivation was not as monstrous as Chu Yunfan’s, the existence of the Myriad Monster Banner could completely flatten this gap and even surpass Chu Yunfan’s combat strength.","This was the power of an Emperor artifact!","Otherwise, there wouldn’t be so many half-Emperors who wanted to fight for the Evil God Spear. Even if King Scaly One-Horn could only use a small part of the power of the Myriad Monster Banner, it should be more than enough to protect himself.","However, even with the protection of the Emperor artifact, King Scaly One-Horn was defeated in such a short time.","If Supreme Sun Blaze hadn’t seen it with his own eyes, he wouldn’t have believed it!","He didn’t even think that King Scaly One-Horn would be defeated. He was worried that if King Scaly One-Horn defeated Chu Yunfan, he would be one step ahead of Chu Yunfan and snatch the unformed world.","However, reality proved that he had thought too much. The reality was completely different from what he had imagined. Just as he was forming a circle around Chu Yunfan, intending to intercept him when he escaped, he suddenly felt a little uneasy.","King Scaly One-Horn had already been defeated!","“Useless!” Supreme Sun Blaze roared, and the Elements Divine Mountain above his head smashed down.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at it and slapped down on the spot.","Boom!","A terrifying explosion sounded. Chu Yunfan’s Flying Celestial Palm Strike had already hit King Scaly One-Horn. King Scaly One-Horn screamed and he flew backwards. His body was directly blasted into pieces in the air.","Even with the Myriad Monster Banner, it couldn’t protect him. When the Myriad Monster Banner was held back, the difference in strength between him and Chu Yunfan completely exploded.","Spurt!","King Scaly One-Horn spat out a mouthful of blood and tried to reorganize his body.","On the other side, Chu Yunfan had withstood the bombardment of the Elements Divine Mountain.","The divine power of the five elemental mountains almost shattered Chu Yunfan’s body.","However, with the protection of the armor formed by the Brahma Tree and the toughness of Chu Yunfan’s body, he was able to withstand the terrifying attack that could easily kill a half-Emperor.","He didn’t rely on the Emperor artifact, he just relied on himself to block it.","Chu Yunfan’s body was comparable to some Emperors, and it was no joke!","A trickle of blood flowed out from the corner of his mouth. He was injured, but this injury disappeared in the blink of an eye and he recovered in an instant.","He didn’t stay for long because he didn’t have much time. He flew up and instantly arrived in front of King Scaly One-Horn.","Before King Scaly One-Horn could catch his breath, Chu Yunfan grabbed at the void. A bolt of lightning turned into a sword and appeared in his palm.","Slash!","The sword light swept across the sky and directly pierced through the head of King Scaly One-Horn, destroying his primordial spirit.","This time, King Scaly One-Horn’s body did not explode again. Only his head exploded. However, he could not come back to life. His brain was pierced through and his primordial spirit was instantly shattered.","In front of Chu Yunfan, his defense was not even worth mentioning!","At this moment, after losing control of the Myriad Monster Banner, which was entangled with the Mountain River Diagram, it turned into a stream of light and disappeared into the sky. It should have returned to the hands of Emperor Skyquake Monster.","At this moment, there was only Supreme Sun Blaze left in the arena.","Chu Yunfan killed King Scaly One-Horn so quickly that even Supreme Sun Blaze couldn’t react in time.","His eyes were filled with extreme shock. He never expected Chu Yunfan to be so fierce.","Those powerful half-Emperors who were as powerful as him were killed in the blink of an eye. There wasn’t even a battle.","Chu Yunfan displayed his overwhelming strength, completely crushing these veteran half-Emperors.","At this moment, he had a feeling. Where did such a terrifying monster come from?","However, he did not escape immediately. On the contrary, the Elements Divine Mountain formed a defensive Grand Elements Array around him, protecting him.","He didn’t choose to escape because he knew that the situation had completely changed.","Originally, he was on the offensive side, while Chu Yunfan was on the defensive side, so he could attack at any time.","But now, Chu Yunfan was the one attacking.","The Mountain River Diagram above Chu Yunfan’s head faintly emitted a stream of light to protect him.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan was the most terrifying. Supreme Sun Blaze could feel that Chu Yunfan’s aura was obviously stronger than before. His strength might not have become stronger, but his own aura had become stronger.","It might seem like nothing, but a top-notch expert like him understood what it meant to be the brave to win when they met on a narrow road.","In a situation where their strength was similar, the person with the stronger aura would naturally have an easier time winning.","The battle between experts only lasted for a moment, not to mention that his current strength was probably not as good as Chu Yunfan’s.","Chu Yunfan had no intention of letting him go. It was impossible for him to retreat even if he wanted to.","“Human, do you know that you’ve already offended several Emperors? Do you still want to offend Elements Sect?” Supreme Sun Blaze stared at Chu Yunfan, hoping that Elements Sect and the reputation of Emperor Elements could scare Chu Yunfan away.","At this moment, he even felt a little powerless. He had never felt this way before. He only felt this way when he was facing the Emperors.","He had completely become the prey, and now, Chu Yunfan was the real hunter in front of him.","He had no other choice!","“So what? After walking on this path, will the various Emperors be able to tolerate me?” Chu Yunfan smiled faintly. “For so many years, there has never been a new Emperor. Have you never thought about the reason?”","Upon hearing this, Supreme Sun Blaze was stunned. His expression was somewhat sinister. How could he not think of the reason? Everyone was smart, and their intelligence was no less than the Emperors. It was just that the times did not allow it.","This time, it might be his only chance, so he didn’t want to let it go.","“This path is the path of invincibility. If you lose, you will die. The only way is to kill your way out, and you are all stepping stones on my path to becoming an Emperor!”"]},{"number":2530,"title":"Chapter 2530: Killing Supreme Sun Blaze","paragraphs":["Chapter 2530: Killing Supreme Sun Blaze","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","At this moment, Supreme Sun Blaze finally understood Chu Yunfan’s plan!","Stepping stone!","They were all stepping stones!","With Chu Yunfan’s current strength, it could be said that he didn’t lack anything to break through to the Emperor Stage. In addition, with this unformed world in hand, all the conditions were met. The only thing missing was that invincible aura!","And they were all stepping stones used to nurture this invincible aura!","Thinking of this, even someone as determined as Supreme Sun Blaze couldn’t help but gasp.","Because he finally understood that Chu Yunfan had never intended to let them go from the beginning!","From the very beginning, Chu Yunfan had planned to kill them all!","There was no difference!","And it just so happened that they had delivered themselves to his doorstep!","At this moment, Supreme Sun Blaze finally understood that they had been wrong from the beginning, and they were ridiculously wrong!","From the beginning, it was not them who surrounded Chu Yunfan, but Chu Yunfan who surrounded them.","This sounded like a fantasy, but judging from the astonishing strength that Chu Yunfan had displayed, it was not a fantasy at all!","This was very realistic!","Chu Yunfan was too strong!","He was so strong that he could ignore their encirclement!","Now, they could say that Chu Yunfan was definitely the number one person below the Emperors. He was even the number one person below the Emperors since ancient times.","Even the Emperors before attaining Dao were definitely not as powerful as Chu Yunfan.","Before the Emperors of ancient times attained Dao, their strength was at most similar to theirs. It was impossible for them to be much stronger. How could they be Chu Yunfan’s match?","What kind of monster was this?","How could he be born in such a chaotic era? Even in ancient times, such a person would be a monster. He would definitely be able to sweep through the world and finally reach the top.","They could even leave behind an eternal name in the future, just like the Emperors who were now circulating in the world.","Other than the ten Emperors who had survived to this day, most of the Emperors had long disappeared with the passage of time and were no longer known to the public.","Only a small number of Emperors, the best among them, could pass down their names over time.","Chu Yunfan had such potential!","“You’re really a scourge!” Supreme Sun Blaze looked at Chu Yunfan coldly. He made a hand seal and the five mountains above his head instantly doubled in size. He had unlocked the first seal of the Elements Divine Mountain, and his control over the mountain had increased greatly.","This was his only hope of fighting against Chu Yunfan. If this move could not do anything to Chu Yunfan, then he was really finished.","He was going to die!","Boom!","In an instant, the Elements Divine Mountain transformed into a torrent of elements law. Tens of billions of laws swept toward Chu Yunfan.","These laws evolved into different elemental powers of metal, wood, water, fire, and earth. In an extremely terrifying instant, they swept toward Chu Yunfan.","“Set!” Chu Yunfan shouted, his expression calm.","The Mountain River Diagram above his head flew out and instantly turned into a real world, stabilizing the tens of billions of laws evolved by the Elements Divine Mountain.","The two Emperor-based magic artifacts instantly exploded with terrifying power, shaking the entire Purgatory Realm.","For a moment, the two sides were in a stalemate. Chu Yunfan’s strength was much stronger than that of Supreme Sun Blaze, but the owner of the Elements Divine Mountain, Emperor Elements, was still alive. Therefore, the battle between the two sides was almost inconclusive.","“There’s no other way. Only by awakening the artifact spirit of the Elements Divine Mountain can we suppress this human!” Supreme Sun Blaze made a decision. It was very disadvantageous for him to be in a stalemate.","Only by awakening the artifact spirit of the Elements Divine Mountain could he further mobilize the true power of the Elements Divine Mountain.","In fact, both of them were half-Emperors. Even though Chu Yunfan’s strength was much stronger, he was still a half-Emperor. Therefore, he was not much better than Supreme Sun Blaze.","In reality, neither side was able to unleash the true power of the Emperor-based magic artifact.","Through the artifact spirit of the Elements Divine Mountain, he could mobilize even more power. However, the Mountain River Diagram did not have an artifact spirit. It had long been scattered in ancient times.","Therefore, if they continued, they would definitely suffer a huge loss in the battle of Emperor artifacts.","Meanwhile, Supreme Sun Blaze was about to mobilize the artifact spirit of the Elements Divine Mountain.","However, at this moment, the space in front of him tore open. A hand reached out from within, holding a long saber formed from the power of lightning.","The large hand flickered with the light of a genius, and the long saber flickered with the power of lightning. In an instant, it slashed down.","The beauty of that blade was indescribable. It was too magnificent.","The speed was too fast. It was just a simple move, but it had unimaginable power.","The saber landed on Supreme Sun Blaze’s body, and the ball formed by the elements law that was used to protect his body was also cut into nothingness.","At the same time, all the armor on Supreme Sun Blaze’s body exploded, and the defensive enchantment was also destroyed by this slash.","Slash!","Blood spurted out as half of Supreme Sun Blaze’s body was cut into pieces on the spot. This slash was too fierce and almost killed him.","However, even so, Supreme Sun Blaze was still severely injured and retreated while coughing up blood.","Chu Yunfan’s sudden attack was too powerful. Without the protection of the Elements Divine Mountain, Supreme Sun Blaze could only resist it with his own strength.","In an instant, he was severely injured.","At this moment, the Elements Divine Mountain was completely at a disadvantage in the battle with the Mountain River Diagram.","He was completely suppressed by the Mountain River Diagram!","Spurt!","Supreme Sun Blaze spat out a mouthful of blood. At this moment, he only knew that things were not good and was about to turn around and escape.","However, in front of him, another crack was torn open. Another hand grabbed out and slashed down.","Boom!","Supreme Sun Blaze’s body was sent flying again.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","Every time the long saber struck out, the group of half-Emperors could see Supreme Sun Blaze being sent flying. Each time, he would be sent flying for tens of thousands of miles.","Even with Supreme Sun Blaze’s powerful body, after being hit by so many sabers in succession, it exploded. Only his primordial spirit managed to escaped, trying to get away.","Boom!","The void was torn apart, and another saber beam slashed down, instantly destroying Supreme Sun Blaze’s primordial spirit.","Chu Yunfan’s speed was too fast. He did not give Supreme Sun Blaze any chance to react and killed him with lightning speed.","Without anyone controlling it, the Elements Divine Mountain was no longer entangled with the Mountain River Diagram. It turned into a stream of light and disappeared.","Suddenly, just as everyone thought that everything had settled down, something unexpected happened."]},{"number":2531,"title":"Chapter 2531: Defying the Heavens, Battle Emperor","paragraphs":["Chapter 2531: Defying the Heavens, Battle Emperor","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Just when everyone thought that everything was about to be settled!","The void was torn apart, and a huge hand suddenly tore through the space and smashed down in Chu Yunfan’s direction.","Boom!","Heaven and earth cracked, and the group of half-Emperors were all shocked. The terrifying aura swept out like an ocean.","The huge hand immediately enveloped Chu Yunfan, and a terrifying explosion erupted. The huge hand seemed to have grabbed the world and broken the ancient silence. It was as if a demon god had awakened from chaos.","Boom!","Above Chu Yunfan’s head, the Mountain River Diagram was constantly emitting bursts of shocking light, resisting this huge hand.","Clang!","Chu Yunfan took a few steps back before he finally stabilized himself.","His face turned green and white, and blood seeped out from the corner of his mouth.","In the collision just now, he suffered a loss and was injured.","When the half-Emperors saw this scene, they were almost scared to death. There was no doubt about Chu Yunfan’s strength. There were not many people who participated in the battle just now, but without exception, they were all the top existences in the world.","However, even such a peerless figure as Supreme Sun Blaze could not withstand a single blow from Chu Yunfan. He could not even injure Chu Yunfan.","However, this huge hand had only slapped down. Under the protection of the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan was still injured.","One could imagine how much of a shock it was to everyone.","“An Emperor!” someone cried out in surprise.","The only person with such strength in the world was definitely an Emperor.","It was just it was unknown which Emperor had made a move!","Chu Yunfan looked at the huge hand that was falling from the sky.","“Emperor Magus!” Chu Yunfan looked at the big hand and immediately recognized who the owner of the big hand was.","This was because this large hand was wrapped with the powerful magi path laws of Magi Circle. There were unique laws of the magi path.","This was also the first time Chu Yunfan had seen someone who had cultivated magi path laws to such a terrifying level. Although Imperial Frontier was already a first-class figure among the half-Emperors, he was still far from being a real Emperor.","They were existences on completely different levels!","Emperor Magus’ magi path law had already touched the origin of the world, and each of his movements had great power.","Only an Emperor could contend with an Emperor, and only an Emperor could defeat an Emperor.","Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, everyone realized that this was the legendary Emperor Magus.","Many people wondered why Emperor Magus had suddenly appeared. It must be known that even when Emperor Evil was being surrounded, those few Emperors didn’t show up. Clearly, they were still digesting the essence of Emperor Evil to extend their lives.","“Hm? You survived?”","On the other side of the space-time crack, a doubtful voice came. Apparently, even Emperor Magus did not expect that his attack could not kill Chu Yunfan.","One should know that a casual attack from him could easily kill a peak half-Emperor. Even if the expert had an Emperor artifact protecting them, he could still injure them severely. It was just a matter of expending more energy.","In any case, to an Emperor, there was no difference at all.","However, they were all ants. It was just that among these ants, some were stronger and some were weaker. There was no difficulty in essence.","But now, this ant was actually not killed by his attack!","On the other side of the space-time rift, a pair of huge and cold eyes appeared. When he looked at Chu Yunfan, a cold light flashed in his eyes.","“I didn’t expect it to be you.” Emperor Magus still remembered Chu Yunfan. To be precise, at that time, in the eyes of Emperor Magus, Chu Yunfan was nothing at all. He was just a Guest Elder of Magi Circle.","These Guest Elders were basically cannon fodder working for Magi Circle. At that time, he did not take Chu Yunfan seriously at all. Since ancient times, there were at least a thousand half-Emperors who worked for Magi Circle. How could Emperor Magus care about them all?","However, this existence that he had looked down on had grown to the point where it could kill Imperial Frontier, destroy his plans, and even seize the world inside Emperor Evil’s body.","If Emperor Magus hadn’t been paying attention to this matter before he went into seclusion, he probably wouldn’t have discovered it in a short period of time. In fact, Chu Yunfan might have succeeded.","At the thought of this, his cold gaze became even colder.","“You’re just an ant, but you actually made a difference!” said Emperor Magus coldly.","“Even ants can transform into divine dragons!” Chu Yunfan said lightly. “Emperor Magus, you might have forgotten that before you became an Emperor, you were also one of those ants. However, since the end of the antiquity times, you have joined hands to suppress the later generations. Countless geniuses were blocked from the Emperor path and could only serve you. Emperor Magus, don’t you feel ashamed?”","Many half-Emperors heard this and their expressions changed slightly. They were not ignorant of the fact that no one had ever become an Emperor since ancient times. They had some understanding of it.","It was impossible to say that they knew nothing about the inside story.","However, their opponents were the Emperors, who were too powerful. Since ancient times, it was not that no one had challenged the Emperors, but none of them had succeeded.","The half-Emperor Stage sounded like it was only one step away from the Emperor Stage, but it was still the King Stage in essence. It was impossible for half-Emperors to challenge an Emperor.","Even though they knew that their future was cut off, many people still pretended to be deaf and dumb, pretending not to know.","Just to survive, wasn’t the essence of cultivation for longevity?","Many people had already lost their ambition.","“Shameful? An ant is an ant. Today, your good luck has come to an end!” Emperor Magus sneered. For many people, these things were secret, and he didn’t even want to explain them.","Why should the divine dragon in the sky care about the thoughts of the ants on the ground?","At that moment, Emperor Magus made his move. A fist smashed down fiercely, as if it had shattered the sky. The entire universe was about to be shattered by this fist.","All the half-Emperors felt a terrifying aura pressing down on them, and they almost knelt down.","An Emperor’s casual attack had forced all the half-Emperors to retreat, especially the weaker itinerant cultivators. They had to flee for millions of miles before they dared to stop. The area around them had become a battlefield.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan clenched his fist and met the punch head-on. A world-shaking collision erupted on the spot."]},{"number":2532,"title":"Chapter 2532: The Strongest Half-Emperor Since Ancient Times","paragraphs":["Chapter 2532: The Strongest Half-Emperor Since Ancient Times","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Boom!","A terrifying explosion instantly sounded. That terrifying punch landed, and in almost an instant, it blasted through the entire world.","For an Emperor, casually blasting through the world could only be considered a normal operation.","This was nothing.","Bam!","Chu Yunfan was sent flying and landed heavily on the ground. It was as easy as he had done to those half-Emperors.","Spurt!","Chu Yunfan spat out a mouthful of blood. The Mountain River Diagram above his head formed a barrier to protect him.","In the collision with Emperor Magus, he had suffered a great loss.","“As expected, it’s far from enough to have a body comparable to an Emperor!” Chu Yunfan knew that his current body was comparable to an ordinary Emperor. However, it was useless against Emperor Magus, because Emperor Magus was the most powerful being among Emperors.","His body, which was as strong as that of an ordinary Emperor, was nothing in front of Emperor Magus.","Not to mention, the strength of an Emperor was all-rounded. It was far from being as simple as the strength of their physical body.","Whether it was their comprehension of the laws, the power of their primordial spirit, or their control over the world, they were far more powerful than half-Emperors. They were not on the same level at all.","“I didn’t expect that among the ants, there would actually be an anomaly like you!” The cold voice of Emperor Magus slowly drifted out. “To be able to cultivate your physical body to such an extent, you are indeed worthy of being proud. However, in front of me, there is no difference.”","Chu Yunfan looked at Emperor Magus on the other side of the crack. He had beaten him to the point where he could not fight back with just one hand.","The power that he was so proud of was nothing in front of Emperor Magus.","Emperor Magus were too powerful. The gap between an Emperor and a half-Emperor was like the difference between heaven and earth.","“There’s no other way. I can only fight!” Chu Yunfan looked coldly at Emperor Magus in front of him. He knew that he didn’t have many chances left. To be more precise, he didn’t have any.","It was almost impossible for him to escape. Even though he had the protection of the Mountain River Diagram, he had no chance of winning against Emperor Magus.","Emperor Magus could suppress him with just one hand.","The only way was for him to enter the Emperor Stage as well. Only Emperors could fight Emperors, and only Emperors could kill Emperors. This was the only way.","At this moment, the godhead in his mind was activated, and the unformed world in his body began to integrate with him.","He wanted to break through to the Emperor Stage on the battlefield. This was simply impossible for others, but he had the memories of the Alchemy Emperor and the help of the godhead. He might have a chance to go all out.","However, at this moment, a fist broke through the world formed by the Mountain River Diagram without any warning and smashed down in his direction.","Boom!","In an instant, the entire world trembled. The world was shattered, and the fist with endless glory landed on Chu Yunfan’s body.","Chu Yunfan’s entire body was almost torn apart.","Fortunately, the Brahma Divine Tree had protected him at the crucial moment, preventing him from being crushed by the punch.","Thud, thud, thud!","Chu Yunfan retreated several steps and spat out a mouthful of blood. At the same time, he frantically circulated the Emperor Method to heal his injuries.","“Hmph, a trapped beast will fight. You’re just an ant!”","Emperor Magus’ cold voice came from the other end of the crack. In an instant, countless fists came crashing down on Chu Yunfan like a storm.","Chu Yunfan had no other choice. The Brahma Divine Tree turned into armor to protect him. At the same time, the Mountain River Diagram blocked the attack, creating a barrier to protect him.","Boom!","Countless explosions sounded, almost destroying the Purgatory Realm. The half-Emperors who were a million kilometers away looked like they had seen a ghost. They couldn’t even imagine what was happening.","An Emperor’s attack could be so terrifying. Even though it was just a normal attack for Emperor Magus, it was more terrifying than any fist attack for them, at least ten times more terrifying.","In the face of such a terrifying attack, they could see that Chu Yunfan was struggling to resist. It was like a small boat facing a stormy sea. Although it was very difficult, he still fought against the wind and refused to admit defeat.","Many people were shocked. This Chu Yunfan was probably the most terrifying existence they had ever seen. He could actually fight for so long against Emperor Magus.","If it were them, they would not be able to withstand any attack.","However, Chu Yunfan was able to withstand it and even resist it. Many people couldn’t help but think that if Chu Yunfan didn’t die, he might have a chance to break through and become an Emperor.","The only Emperor since the ancient times!","However, they immediately dismissed this idea because they knew that it was impossible.","Unless Emperor Magus flipped him over on purpose, how could Chu Yunfan possibly fight against Emperor Magus? It was impossible for him to escape from Emperor Magus.","Even if he escaped to the edge of the universe, he would never be able to escape from the pursuit of Emperor Magus.","This was the most terrifying manifestation of Emperors!","“Die!”","Amid the endless explosions, Chu Yunfan let out a furious roar. Everyone could only see that his clothes were tattered, his black hair was fluttering, and blood was seeping out of every pore on his body. His skin was dry and cracked, and cracks covered his entire body. No matter how they looked at him, he looked extremely terrifying.","To be able to fight until now without being beaten into a bloody mist was already very, very difficult for everyone. It was even unimaginably powerful.","Without a doubt, this was a glorious battle that would be passed down for many, many years.","This was the first time a half-Emperor had challenged an Emperor and not been killed by the Emperor.","Even though the Emperor had only used one hand and hadn’t used his full strength, it was enough for many people. It had boosted their morale. Perhaps the Emperor wasn’t completely invincible.","However, even more people were terrified. Even Chu Yunfan, who was so powerful, was seriously injured by the one-handed Emperor Magus. He was bleeding all over. It was unimaginable how powerful that Emperor Magus could be.","Chu Yunfan looked really miserable. His entire arm had been blown up, and only his right hand was still resisting.","Being able to persist until now seemed to be his limit.","Suddenly, everyone saw Chu Yunfan’s body crack inch by inch, instantly turning into flesh and blood that filled the sky."]},{"number":2533,"title":"Chapter 2533: Becoming an Emperor","paragraphs":["Chapter 2533: Becoming an Emperor","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Was there a winner?","When many people saw this scene, they could not help but sigh. To them, they did not know whether to be happy or sad!","Although Chu Yunfan’s position was completely different from theirs, and even completely hostile, they still had some hope in their hearts.","That was to use a half-Emperor to fight an Emperor, even if the Emperor was already old, even if the Emperor only used one hand.","To them, it was impossible, but to Chu Yunfan, it might be possible.","They had never seen such a powerful and terrifying half-Emperor.","He was able to do this almost by himself.","He could be considered the strongest half-Emperor in history!","If even Chu Yunfan, who was so powerful, could not do it, then they definitely had no hope.","Although it was said that only an Emperor could fight against an Emperor, the chances of becoming an Emperor were extremely slim. It was even more difficult than cultivating Chu Yunfan’s level of strength.","To them, Chu Yunfan’s failure was no different from the destruction of their dreams.","Suddenly, just as they were sighing, a ball of golden light burst out from the exploded flesh. Everyone saw that in the ball of golden light, a figure slowly took shape and slowly emerged.","A moment later, he transformed into a human. Everyone looked at him and saw that he was Chu Yunfan.","“He didn’t die?” Many people couldn’t help but have such a thought in their minds. They were incomparably shocked.","Suddenly, at this moment, they found that Chu Yunfan, who had changed into a ball of light, was regrowing pieces of flesh and blood. As the flesh and blood grew more and more, his strength was actually rising.","If the original Chu Yunfan was already the most powerful and terrifying half-Emperor in history, then the current Chu Yunfan seemed to have surpassed this line and had truly begun to move toward the stage that they had dreamed of.","Could that be the legendary enlightenment?","Many people suddenly thought of a terrifying legend. In ancient myths and legends, when the Emperors achieved Dao, they would shed their old bodies and transform into Dao. They would use the power of the Great Dao to recondense their bodies.","This level of fleshly body was completely different from the previous level. It was known as the Dao Physique!","It was just like in the legends of some small worlds, cultivators who ascended to the immortal world would shed their original physical bodies and transform into immortal bodies.","Originally, the body was the foundation, but once one attained Dao, it was completely different. The primordial spirit after attaining Dao was the foundation. With the primordial spirit as the core, the most powerful physique that was born and most in line with the Great Dao of Heaven and Earth was the Dao Physique.","If the essence of cultivation was a transition in the essence of life, then this transformation from an ordinary body of flesh and blood to a body of Dao was the last transition in the origin of life.","This rise would also completely distinguish Emperors and half-Emperors. The half-Emperors were still based on their physical bodies and could be called flesh and blood life forms, while the Emperors seemed to be another form of life in the legends, the Dao Spirits.","A terrifying creature that had fused with the Great Dao of Heaven and Earth!","However, it had been a very long time since anyone had broken through. Thus, the various strange phenomena that occurred when an Emperor broke through had already become ancient legends.","On the other side of the crack, Emperor Magus seemed to have realized what kind of transformation Chu Yunfan was going through. He immediately snorted and then threw a punch at Chu Yunfan’s body that had yet to completely reassemble.","Boom!","There was a loud explosion. To everyone’s horror, Chu Yunfan raised his arm, which was still growing and most of it was still in a ball of light, and blocked this terrifying fatal blow.","The terrifying shockwave created by the collision of the two sides overturned the space almost in an instant. However, the punch of Emperor Magus could not advance any further and was easily intercepted by Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at it as he sped up the process of forming his body. Countless Great Dao laws entangled his body and turned into his flesh and blood.","He had completely shed his original physical body and turned into a Dao Spirit, an existence that had never existed before.","But he was not unfamiliar at all. Because in the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, he already knew.","This was a crucial step in his breakthrough. When he turned into a ball of light, his primordial spirit had already turned into a Dao Spirit. When his corporeal body was re-condensed, his Dao Physique had already been completely condensed.","He had already attained Dao.","He could feel that his aura was rising bit by bit, rising to a terrifying level. It was a terrifying aura that he had never come into contact with and only felt in the memories of the Alchemy Emperor.","At the same time, he also felt that his perception was unprecedentedly sensitive. His eyes were like torches. No one in the upper nine heavens or the lower nine netherworlds could hide from him.","All the laws were exceptionally clear in front of him. In front of him, the world was no longer a simple world. The laws that he could barely see when he was at the half-Emperor Stage were unprecedentedly clear now. Moreover, they were very simple and clear at a glance.","He could create an extremely powerful attack by casually fluctuating a bit of the laws!","This was the power of an Emperor. He could casually borrow powerful power from the laws.","The world contained endless power. Usually, people could not see or use this power. However, with the help of the laws, they could easily open this treasure vault.","Although a half-Emperor could also do it, it was still too far away from the level of an Emperor. They were not on the same level at all.","Similarly, there was also the problem of control authority.","An Emperor’s control was far greater than a half-Emperor’s. Even if it was the same law, even if Chu Yunfan wasn’t good at it, and a half-Emperor was based on this law, Chu Yunfan could easily control this law, making it impossible for the half-Emperor to control it.","This was the power of an Emperor. It was so powerful that it was unbelievable and indescribable.","He was a creature from a completely different world from a half-Emperor!","And this was what an Emperor was!","After hundreds of years of cultivation, Chu Yunfan had finally gone from a muddleheaded high school student who knew nothing to the peak of the universe, a true Emperor.","Even facing Alchemy Emperors, he could also treat them equally.","“Impossible!” From the other end of the crack came the furious roar of Emperor Magus. His voice was filled with disbelief and fear."]},{"number":2534,"title":"Chapter 2534: Destroying the World, Might of the Emperor Path","paragraphs":["Chapter 2534: Destroying the World, Might of the Emperor Path","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In an instant, the world changed color.","Everyone could feel that the entire Purgatory Realm was filled with a supreme majesty.","The world suddenly changed!","Everyone could feel a vast and majestic aura vaguely permeating the world.","It directly spread out for a radius of a million kilometers, ten million kilometers, a billion kilometers, a billion kilometers, and a billion kilometers. Its might continuously spread out.","An Emperor!","This was the majesty of an Emperor!","All of the half-Emperors immediately knelt down. It wasn’t that they were willing to kneel down, but the power of their souls made them kneel down to worship the Emperor.","Everyone knelt on the ground, feeling extremely shocked!","Chu Yunfan had become an Emperor. Since ancient times, there was actually someone who became an Emperor!","Many people felt that their worldview was about to collapse.","Although logically speaking, there was a possibility of becoming an Emperor, it had been many years since anyone had become an Emperor.","Almost everyone had a fixed formula in their minds, and that was that no one could become an Emperor!","But now, after countless years, someone had finally broken through that iron curtain and become an Emperor!","In that almost impossible situation, he had attained Dao!","Chu Yunfan felt the powerful power surging crazily in his body. He used the Great Dao laws as the foundation to reconstruct his body.","At this moment, he finally realized that the strength of an Emperor was far beyond that of a half-Emperor. They were not existences in the same dimension.","If it were an ordinary person, it would be impossible. In such a short period of time, it was almost impossible to fuse with the unformed world and become an Emperor.","It was almost impossible for anyone to do it, but Chu Yunfan did it.","He had the Alchemy Emperor’s memories as a ready-made reference, knowing what to do to want to become an Emperor.","Although there were different Daos, the key points were the same.","Coupled with the power of the godhead, his comprehension of the Great Path far surpassed that of an ordinary half-Emperor, comparable to an Emperor. Everything had been prepared in the past ten years. The only thing missing was the world that had yet to take shape.","Everything was just a little bit of an opportunity.","Now that he was given this opportunity, he had attained Dao.","At this moment, the laws of heaven and earth were no longer a secret to him.","Even if there were many areas that he was not good at or had never stepped into before, he could still see them clearly.","The domain he was least proficient in was much stronger than the half-Emperor who was most proficient in this domain.","Although each Emperor might have different areas of expertise, to a half-Emperor, any Emperor was perfect and flawless.","Just like when Chu Yunfan faced Emperor Magus, even though his physical body was already comparable to that of an ordinary Emperor and could be said to be unprecedentedly powerful since ancient times.","However, he couldn’t resist Emperor Magus. It was already not easy for him to fight against Emperor Magus.","Chu Yunfan let out a long breath. After so many years of hard work, he had finally stepped onto the path of an Emperor.","The events of the past hundreds of years replayed in front of his eyes like a movie clip, and he had finally reached this step.","He had reached an unprecedented realm.","Chu Yunfan’s aura was rising crazily. After reaching the Emperor Stage, it didn’t stop. It was still rising crazily.","On the other side of the crack, a look of horror flashed in Emperor Magus’ eyes. Obviously, he did not expect Chu Yunfan to not stop after reaching the Emperor Stage.","Thinking back, even after he broke through, he had completely consolidated it.","However, Chu Yunfan’s improvement seemed to have no limit and continued to improve.","This was enough to prove how deep Chu Yunfan’s foundation was before he broke through. It was terrifyingly deep.","Before attaining the Dao, the deeper one’s foundation was, the more powerful one would be after attaining the Dao!","He knew this too well!","He absolutely could not allow Chu Yunfan to continue breaking through.","He had to disrupt Chu Yunfan’s rhythm, or else he would become a huge threat.","In the blink of an eye, a pair of iron fists blasted out from the other end of the crack, crossing the universe as if it had run through the long river of history.","In an instant, it flew directly in Chu Yunfan’s direction.","“Are you sure that I’m still breaking through and can’t be distracted? You want to damage my Dao foundation?” Chu Yunfan immediately understood Emperor Magus’ plan.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan had already achieved his Great Dao. It was almost impossible for Emperor Magus to kill him. His strength was already very strong.","However, he could take advantage of the fact that Chu Yunfan was still improving and consolidating his realm to break his rhythm and directly destroy his Dao foundation.","Even if it was just a little damage to his Dao foundation, it was enough to pose a huge threat to Chu Yunfan. Although it would not prevent him from becoming an Emperor, it would pose a huge threat to his future growth.","However, Chu Yunfan was not the kind of person who would not retaliate when he was at a disadvantage.","The Mountain River Diagram above his head flew out and grew bigger and bigger, directly enveloping the entire world.","The entire Purgatory Realm was enveloped by the Mountain River Diagram.","This was the true power of the Mountain River Diagram. Chu Yunfan’s strength had not reached the required level before, so he could not fully unleash it.","However, it was different now. It was enough for him to unleash his full strength.","The Mountain River Diagram had been cultivated by him for many years and they had long fused into one. The only difference was the difference in his own strength.","Boom!","The pair of iron fists pierced through the world, blasting through the Purgatory Realm that was wrapped in the Mountain River Diagram.","Many half-Emperors panicked.","They had never thought that the Purgatory Realm, which they had regarded as an extremely dangerous world, would be destroyed by a single punch from Emperor Magus.","This absolute difference in strength made them almost despair.","It was rare for them to see an Emperor fight. Even if an Emperor fought, it was only against a half-Emperor. It was rare for them to see an Emperor fight another Emperor.","Only when facing an Emperor would they unleash their full strength.","At this moment, they remembered that there were many legends about Emperors who could capture the stars and the moon. With a casual strike, they could cut down the stars in the sky.","The stars in the sky were not just planets, but even worlds.","A casual strike could break the world.","They had thought that it was an exaggeration. If it were them, their destruction of the world would only be destroying all the living beings on that planet.","As for Emperors destroying the world, it was the literal meaning. They could easily penetrate the world, destroy the world, and disintegrate the world at the law level.","And the Purgatory Realm was a broken world left behind by the war between Emperors.","Now, they understood that it was not an exaggeration at all. Emperors could really destroy the world!"]},{"number":2535,"title":"Chapter 2535: Battling Emperor Magus","paragraphs":["Chapter 2535: Battling Emperor Magus","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The iron fist of Emperor Magus pierced through this seemingly chaotic yet sturdy world.","The entire world was shaking violently, as if the entire world was about to disintegrate in the next second.","What kind of terrifying attack was this? It was earth-shattering.","It was as if everything in the world was about to collapse.","This was the power of an Emperor!","Many people had never seen such a terrifying scene in their lives. Only Emperors would unleash their full strength against Emperors.","They finally witnessed what a battle between Emperors was like!","The hands of Emperor Magus pierced through the entire world, almost sinking the Purgatory Realm.","However, the Purgatory Realm still managed to buy some time for Chu Yunfan.","“Emperor Magus, aren’t you best at physical combat? Then let me experience your physical cultivation!” Chu Yunfan shouted loudly. His fists were like two world-destroying millstones as they directly smashed into the crack.","Boom!","A massive explosion sounded out, and time seemed to stop for a moment. After that, an even more terrifying explosion that seemed to be able to destroy the world sounded out. Countless half-Emperors in the Purgatory Realm frantically fled into the distance. Even a million kilometers, or even ten million kilometers, felt unsafe.","They even had to flee to the edge of the universe to escape such a terrifying collision.","The terrifying crack that had covered the entire Purgatory Realm was shattered by this attack.","A figure fell out of it. It was a middle-aged man with a strong figure and a resolute expression.","His entire body emitted a tyrannical aura, and that terrifying aura suppressed the heavens.","Many half-Emperors of Magi Circle prostrated themselves on the ground when they saw this middle-aged man. He was the supreme existence of Magi Circle, Emperor Magus.","Although everyone already knew who was behind the crack, they still couldn’t hide their excitement when they saw Emperor Magus being beaten out by Chu Yunfan.","“How is that possible?” At this moment, Emperor Magus spoke slowly. It seemed that he did not expect that he would actually be blasted out from the other side of the universe by Chu Yunfan’s fists.","Chu Yunfan’s attack was too violent. Not only did he fail to stop Chu Yunfan’s strength from increasing, but he was also dragged into the fray.","Chu Yunfan’s accumulation was too deep, and it was still climbing.","Such a terrifying increase caused a huge sense of oppression even for him.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s aura exploded to the extreme, and his powerful aura shook the edge of the universe. Even in some corners of the universe, one could vaguely sense that a powerful existence was being born.","Emperor Magus was one who understood this kind of terrifying situation the most, because he was also an Emperor, so he naturally understood it.","Boom!","Emperor Magus attacked again, his eyes piercing Chu Yunfan’s chest like a pair of blades.","His magic path laws condensed in the air, turning into an incomparably huge world. That was the Magi Realm.","The Magi Realm instantly enveloped Chu Yunfan, wanting to suppress him alive.","Chu Yunfan sneered and rose from the ground like a divine mountain. Then, he suddenly attacked.","“Emperor Magus, you’re old. You don’t have the invincible heart anymore. You’re just like the other Emperors, waiting for a chance to survive!” Chu Yunfan shouted, not backing down at all.","In his eyes, although Emperor Magus was young, he was actually already old. He no longer had the confidence to be invincible.","Even when facing Chu Yunfan, a newly ascended Emperor, he had to use all kinds of third-rate methods.","He no longer had the courage to improve. The only thing he could do was to live on, to live on, to live on for a long time. That was probably the only thing that Emperor Magus had to think about.","Including Emperor Magus, many Emperors had already given up on improving themselves. They only wanted to live longer!","Compared to the mindset of the Emperors in ancient times, this was a complete change.","The Emperors of that era did not even have the idea of the main character’s descendants becoming Emperors. Because in their eyes, if they wanted to take a step further and become the legendary Divine Dao, they had to compete with countless people.","Just like raising dragon, the dragon king that was raised to the end was the strongest existence!","And everyone was confident that they would be the dragon king who could become a god in the end!","After all, every Emperor had suppressed an era and was the number one person among all the elites.","But now, the ten surviving Emperors no longer had the ambition to fight for supremacy. They were even afraid of a successor like Chu Yunfan.","In Chu Yunfan’s eyes, they were already a bunch of bones in a coffin.","“How dare you! You think you can be on equal footing with us just because you’ve become a Martial Emperor?” Emperor Magus sneered. “It’s not uncommon for Emperors to fall. We just killed Emperor Evil a few years ago!”","“On equal footing with you? Now, you’re no longer qualified to be compared to me! I’ll kill you here today,” Chu Yunfan said calmly. “You’ve been obstructing the Great Dao for too long. It’s time for the curtain to fall!”","“You want me to wait for the curtain to fall? Shameless boasting!” Emperor Magus laughed out loud and said, “It’s good that you’re here. Emperor Evil’s remaining Emperor essence isn’t enough for me to live for another thousand years. Now, I can kill you and take your Emperor essence. That way, I can live for at least five thousand years!”","Emperor Magus’s eyes flashed with coldness and fanaticism.","After killing Emperor Evil and taking his Emperor essence, it was like opening Pandora’s box, unleashing all the evil in order to survive longer.","There was nothing that Emperor Magus couldn’t do.","“Kill me? Snatch my Emperor essence? Do you think you can do it?” Chu Yunfan laughed out loud. Behind him, eight groups of dragons and eight gods appeared.","These eight gods protected him. At this moment, he was the only god suppressed in this world.","Boom!","In the next moment, both Chu Yunfan and Emperor Magus attacked at the same time. In the next moment, the two sides collided.","The two huge worlds collided, causing the earth to tremble and the mountains to shake.","Time and space collided, and the world twisted.","The half-Emperors who were billions of kilometers away were the ones who had the most right to speak about how terrifying the collision between two Emperors was.","They could almost feel the most terrifying collision in the world. A terrifying shock wave almost ignored the distance in space and instantly rushed in front of them, sending them flying.","Spurt!","Spurt!","Spurt!","The half-Emperors were sent flying for millions of miles. They were shocked by the aftershock of the battle and spat out blood. Their bodies were almost torn apart.","They did not dare to get close at all and fled frantically."]},{"number":2536,"title":"Chapter 2536: Emperor Magus Is Stabbed to Death","paragraphs":["Chapter 2536: Emperor Magus Is Stabbed to Death","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The collision caused the heavens and earth to collapse. Everyone could see that the world was collapsing in this collision.","Half of the Purgatory Realm was destroyed by this collision.","However, in this collision, the victor had already been decided!","Chu Yunfan’s chest was torn open, and blood was flowing out!","In the hands of Emperor Magus, there was a saber condensed from the magi path. The saber swept in all directions, directly sweeping toward Chu Yunfan.","It was this slash that tore a wound on Chu Yunfan’s chest.","However, an even more terrifying fist print emerged on Emperor Magus’ body.","Chu Yunfan had punched through Emperor Magus’ chest!","Emperor Magus’ gaze turned colder and colder. He didn’t expect that a fist mark would be directly pierced through his body, even though his body was so strong.","It could even be said that if he was not careful, he might die in Chu Yunfan’s hands.","Chu Yunfan was too domineering!","In this state, Chu Yunfan could be said to be a powerful enemy he had never seen before.","The collision just now had caused both sides to suffer. It could even be said that his injuries far exceeded Chu Yunfan’s.","This was a situation that had never happened before because with his physical body, even in the ancient era when the Emperors stood side by side, he was still one of the best among the Emperors.","And now, other than Emperor Stone, who could rely on the strength of the Rock Spirit lineage to compete with him, the others no longer had the foundation to pose any threat to him.","At the very least, he had never been afraid of anyone in a physical confrontation.","But now, Chu Yunfan had only just become an Emperor, and he had actually injured him to this extent.","It could be said to be unprecedented!","However, in just a moment, Chu Yunfan’s injuries recovered at an astonishing speed. Chu Yunfan’s speed was still increasing.","Emperor Magus’ recovery speed was also fast, but it was incomparable to Chu Yunfan’s recovery speed.","However, all of this fell into the eyes of many half-Emperors. They felt extremely sad, because they could all sense one thing: Emperor Magus was getting old.","The faster one recovered, the more vigorous one’s blood essence was, and the more their various functions were at their peak.","But now, Emperor Magus couldn’t keep up with Chu Yunfan’s speed at all. This could only prove one thing: Emperor Magus was really old, so old that he couldn’t keep up with Chu Yunfan’s speed.","How tragic was this!","Such a situation was rare since ancient times. When an old Emperor faced a successor, even if their cultivation level was high, they would face a problem. They were old.","A living being that had yet to become a god, no matter how much their life essence transformed, they would still be a mortal living being and would grow old!","Emperor Magus couldn’t contain his anger. He didn’t give up. At this moment, a hint of fanaticism flashed in his eyes. He hadn’t lost yet. It was just that his recovery speed was a little slower than Chu Yunfan’s. That was nothing.","In an instant, Chu Yunfan attacked again. Relying on the advantage of recovering first, Chu Yunfan launched an attack. He didn’t use any other magic artifacts. His pair of iron fists were the best Emperor artifacts.","It was enough to shatter all of spce.","This punch shattered the sky and reached right in front of Emperor Magus.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan saw a supreme and indescribable door in front of Emperor Magus. It seemed to be the embodiment of the Great Dao.","This was the most powerful imperial artifact of Emperor Magus, the Magi Door!","The Magi Door contained the strongest Great Dao of Emperor Magus.","Chu Yunfan could vaguely make out the word “Magi” in it. The Great Dao that Emperor Magus had learned was ultimately related to this word.","It was said that this character was directly derived from the Great Dao, and it contained the power of the Great Dao’s origin.","Because of this, Emperor Magus who got this word could touch the essence of the Great Dao from the very beginning.","Only then could he be invincible among his peers and finally kill his way out to become an Emperor.","Later on, it was said that Emperor Magus had refined this word into a gate, a gate that contained the magi path. It was said that whoever could enter this gate would be able to obtain all the inheritance of Emperor Magus.","The reason why Chu Yunfan knew about it was because he had joined Magi Circle before, so he knew what kind of tricks Magi Circle had.","Countless people in Magi Circle wanted to enter the Magi Door, which was an Emperor artifact, so that they could obtain the inheritance of Emperor Magus.","And now, the Magi Door had finally appeared and stood in front of Chu Yunfan, buying time for Emperor Magus to recover.","“Chu Yunfan, you can’t kill me. Today, you will be the one to shed blood on the battlefield. You will die for sure!” Emperor Magus roared.","“I can’t kill you? Do you think you are a god?” Chu Yunfan roared. The blood in his body was still expanding and rising. In other words, his strength was still rising crazily.","Chu Yunfan might be the youngest among the many Emperors, but he could be considered the one with the deepest foundation among them.","After he became an Emperor, his power had not stopped increasing. It had been increasing crazily, which was also the reason why Emperor Magus was most afraid of him.","Chu Yunfan didn’t sit still and wait for death. He attacked again, using his pair of iron fists to attack Magi Circle.","The Magi Door had no blind spots, and Emperor Magus was completely protected by it. If the Magi Door couldn’t be broken, Emperor Magus wouldn’t be hurt at all.","And this was also the reason why Emperor Magus was so confident.","Boom!","With a loud boom, the terrifying collision turned into a crazed wolf that swept in all directions, shaking the entire universe.","Chu Yunfan’s battle had attracted more and more attention, but no one dared to go forward.","Just thinking about the battle between two Emperors was extremely terrifying.","Chu Yunfan realized that although his physical body was comparable to an Emperor artifact, or even stronger than an ordinary Emperor artifact, it was almost impossible to break through the Magi Door.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan immediately grabbed the Evil God Spear that was being chased by countless half-Emperors.","The Evil God Spear couldn’t resist at all. The artifact spirit contained in it was instantly wiped out by Chu Yunfan.","With its previous master controlling it, the Evil God Spear had been very powerful. However, now that the Evil Emperor had been killed, the Evil God Spear naturally could not resist Chu Yunfan’s refinement.","“Spear, break!”","Chu Yunfan shouted and struck out with his spear. The spear transformed into a powerful Evil God that suppressed everything. In an instant, it collided the Magi Door.","Boom!","Countless cracks appeared on the Magi Door, and the spear instantly pierced through it.","Spurt!","Emperor Magus behind the Magi Door was pierced through and nailed to the void of the universe."]},{"number":2537,"title":"Chapter 2537: The Death of Emperor Magus, the World Cries","paragraphs":["Chapter 2537: The Death of Emperor Magus, the World Cries","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","No one expected Chu Yunfan to shatter the Magi Door so easily!","The power of the Evil God Spear in Chu Yunfan’s hands was even more terrifying than when it was in the hands of the Evil Emperor.","Even Emperor Magus did not expect that the Magi Door would be shattered in an instant, and the “Magi” word contained within it would be pierced through.","Then, this spear nailed him to death in the void of the universe.","The injuries that Chu Yunfan had already inflicted on him had completely erupted at this moment.","“You’re still alive?” Chu Yunfan looked at Emperor Magus in front of him, only to see that Emperor Magus’ nailed body had suddenly recovered.","“Huff, huff, huff!” Emperor Magus was gasping heavily.","Emperor Magus was resurrected, but apparently, he had paid a great price for this revival. Emperor Magus used to be a middle-aged man, but now, he looked like an old man, extremely old.","He was so old that Chu Yunfan could feel the aura of death and decay from his body. It was a terrifying aura that belonged to the Five Declines of Heaven and Man.","Originally, Emperor Magus had used the Emperor essence of Emperor Evil to recover to his peak state, but now, Chu Yunfan had used up his essence with a single spear strike.","He had done it with the Evil God Spear. It could be said that the Heavenly Dao had reincarnation.","“Since you’re not dead, I’ll send you on your way!” Chu Yunfan crossed his arms.","Emperor Magus didn’t die, but he suddenly came back to life. It was enough to make ordinary half-Emperors panic.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t feel anything. He was no longer a half-Emperor, but an Emperor.","He was confident that he could face any situation. Even if Emperor Magus was resurrected, it would be nothing more than killing him again.","“Three moves, I’ll kill you in three moves!” roared Emperor Magus.","He even had to consume a great amount of physical strength to shout those words. Emperor Magus had never imagined that he would be so weak.","He had seen too many powerful enemies in his life, and he had fought against too many powerful enemies. However, what he had never expected was that the one who had caused him a serious injury and even forced him to a dead end would be a junior countless years later.","At this moment, Emperor Magus had ascended. He was betting all his chances on his last three moves.","If he could kill Chu Yunfan in these last three moves, he still had hope. By then, he would devour Chu Yunfan’s Emperor essence. Not only would he not lose out, but he would also gain something.","Although it couldn’t be compared to when he was at his best, it was already much better than before.","“Three moves? You only have three moves left!” Chu Yunfan looked at Emperor Magus in front of him and sneered.","Emperor Magus made his move. He clenched his five fingers into a fist. In an instant, the straight fist of the Magi Path had reached its peak, and it had even surpassed its peak.","This punch directly evolved into a prosperous magi civilization, and then this powerful civilization swept toward Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at him as he flew into the sky and stomped down.","“Nine Netherworld Stomps!”","This stomp shattered the void in an instant. The terrifying water of the netherworld drowned everything, including the magi civilization.","Spurt!","Emperor Magus was sent flying away, coughing up a mouthful of blood. He had suffered a great loss in the collision just now.","His appearance looked even older. It seemed that he had consumed a little life force.","Emperor Magus’ face was filled with rage. He was not convinced. Why was Chu Yunfan so young?","Youth was king!","It was vividly reflected at this moment.","When he saw Chu Yunfan’s youth, his eyes were filled with jealousy.","He used to be so young. The more he was like this, the more jealous he felt. He knew that when he was so young, he never thought that he would be bullied to such an extent in the distant future. It was simply a great humiliation.","But in the next moment, Chu Yunfan’s attack arrived again!","His five fingers clenched into a fist, and the eight groups of heavenly dragons instantly suppressed the surroundings.","Time, space, Yin and Yang, the five elements, all the laws were completely suppressed.","Right after that, Emperor Magus saw the terrifying fist force sweeping across the sky like a huge meteor.","It directly hit Emperor Magus!","Spurt!","Emperor Magus coughed up a mouthful of blood. His chest was pierced through again. He was in such a miserable state that his body seemed to be about to collapse.","When those Emperors saw this scene, they couldn’t believe it. This was the grand Emperor Magus, one of the ten great Emperors, a terrifying existence who had ruled the entire Ancient Realm for countless years.","Now, he was actually beaten up so miserably.","The half-Emperors of Magi Circle were even more miserable. They felt as if their worldview was about to shatter.","They couldn’t imagine how Chu Yunfan did it.","However, this did not change Chu Yunfan’s attack.","“Even if I die, you must die!” Emperor Magus roared.","He knew that he was wrong. He had hoped that those three moves could turn the situation around, but in fact, it was impossible.","He couldn’t even defeat Chu Yunfan in his peak condition, so he couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan in this gambling state.","Emperor Magus performed his last secret skill. The word “Magi” appeared in front of him. He revealed a sinister smile and then detonated the word.","The “Magi” word was a word condensed from the most primitive Great Dao. Each letter contained the secrets of the origin of the Great Dao.","At this moment, it completely displayed its power.","Boom!","Everyone saw a huge ball of light cover everything. Everything disappeared. Space disappeared, time disappeared, laws disappeared, and the Great Dao disappeared. Everything turned into nothingness.","Emperor Magus only saw one of Chu Yunfan’s arms disappear without a trace in the terrifying explosion.","Even with Chu Yunfan’s physical body, he could not completely withstand the damage caused by the explosion of the Dao word.","However, before he could show a gratified smile, he saw Chu Yunfan use the Evil God Spear to pierce through him and nail him to death in the void of the universe.","This time, he could no longer recover. He had truly consumed all his vitality.","“You...” Emperor Magus never thought that Chu Yunfan could kill him so easily.","Inch by inch, the body of Emperor Magus cracked.","All the Daos in his body were collapsing!","The heavens and earth were wailing. Everyone could feel the sorrow of the heavens and earth. Every Emperor was the most outstanding creature born from the heavens and earth.","Now, such an Emperor had been killed!","It was a huge loss to the world!","Everyone in the world was trembling. They had never thought that Chu Yunfan could be so powerful and kill Emperor Magus so easily."]},{"number":2538,"title":"Chapter 2538: Emperor Chu Suppresses the World","paragraphs":["Chapter 2538: Emperor Chu Suppresses the World","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Emperor Magus was dead!","A powerful existence that had existed in this world since ancient times had died!","Ever since the war at the end of the Antiquity Age, another powerful Emperor had finally died!","Moreover, he had died at the hands of a rising star like Chu Yunfan!","Chu Yunfan’s first battle after becoming an Emperor was extremely glorious. Not only did he block Emperor Magus’ attack, but he also killed Emperor Magus at the same time.","This was different from Emperor Evil’s death. Emperor Evil had managed to escape from the siege of several Emperors.","One could imagine how powerful the Emperors were. Their strength was extremely terrifying. It was impossible for them to be killed on the spot.","But now, Chu Yunfan had done it. He killed Emperor Magus easily by himself.","Of course, he wasn’t completely uninjured. He had killed Emperor Magus with an arm as the price.","However, such an injury was nothing to an Emperor, especially to a powerful and young Emperor like Chu Yunfan.","A moment later, Chu Yunfan’s arm, which had been vaporized by the explosion of the “Magi” word, grew back as if it had never been injured.","Although he had consumed some of his Vitality, it was completely replenished after a short while.","Being young was the absolute truth, and this was vividly reflected in Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s energy and blood were still rising. After a long time, it finally stopped.","Although he had just broken through into the Emperor Stage, he had already walked very far in this stage.","It could be said that although he had just become an Emperor, he already inherited all of the Emperor Stage comprehensions of the previous Alchemy Emperor.","It was precisely because of this that if others looked down on him because he had just become an Emperor, they would suffer a huge loss.","He could feel that in the depths of the universe, there were powerful auras lurking, and pairs of extremely greedy eyes were looking at him.","They were all powerful Emperors!","Emperor Evil was dead, and Emperor Magus was killed by him. Besides Chu Yunfan, there should be eight other Emperors in the deep universe.","Behind every powerful aura was a powerful Emperor.","Each of these powerful Emperors could have attacked just now, but they all held back and did not attack.","Because they were frightened by the overwhelming power of Chu Yunfan killing Emperor Magus. Even though they knew that Chu Yunfan was not at his strongest state, they still did not have the courage to attack Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s power was also unquestionable. He had just attained Dao, yet he had already killed an Emperor. Moreover, it was in the domain of the most powerful physical body, which was the best and most powerful domain of Emperor Magus. This was not something that anyone could do.","At the edge of the universe, countless half-Emperors prostrated themselves at Chu Yunfan’s feet.","Although they belonged to different sects, they did not dare to show any disrespect when facing an Emperor, even if it was an enemy Emperor.","“Emperor Chu!”","“Emperor Chu!”","“Emperor Chu!”","Everyone was chanting this name silently as if there was a curse. No one dared to slack off at all.","Chu Yunfan glanced at them, grabbed the Evil God Spear, the fragments of the Magi Door, and the incomplete body of Emperor Magus, and left.","A shocking piece of news spread throughout the universe.","There was another Emperor in the world. He didn’t have his own title, but others already called him Emperor Chu.","With his surname as the prefix, from today onwards, his surname would also have a certain amount of power. With the support of the power of heaven and earth, it would become a taboo.","And the battle in which Emperor Chu became famous was when he directly killed Emperor Magus.","This battle shocked the world!","This battle was destined to go down in history!","This was an unprecedented battle between Emperors!","It could be said that many worlds, including the Ancient Realm, were scared out of their wits.","Since ancient times, no one had ever had such powerful combat strength!","Once upon a time, this world was very dark for half-Emperors because they had no chance of becoming Emperors.","But now it was different. Chu Yunfan had broken the shackles and the darkness.","After the ancient era, he attained Dao and even slaughtered Emperor Magus.","There was no doubt an Emperor had been killed!","This Emperor was still very young and had endless possibilities in the future.","This was Chu Yunfan’s era!","This was because Chu Yunfan was different from those ancient Emperors. He was young, and it was precisely because of this that his Dao could last for a long time and he could waste time.","This was also the time that the other Emperors were willing to spend everything in exchange for. This was something they did not have!","The world was about to be reshuffled, and the entire universe was about to enter a brand-new era. This era would be ruled by Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s name spread to every world in the universe.","“Emperor Chu is too powerful. According to the situation where the Emperors are generally powerful, the next tens of thousands of years might be the time for him to rule. Even if he wants to seal himself and sleep, it will be at least ten thousand years before it is possible!”","Some people analyzed that Chu Yunfan would be active in the next 10,000 years.","The other Emperors would probably choose to sleep instead of fighting against Chu Yunfan.","What a joke. Chu Yunfan had plenty of time to squander. A peak Emperor could live for tens of thousands of years, but those Emperors could only live for a few years. It was hard to say if they could even live for a thousand years.","They were all at the end of their lives, or else they wouldn’t have taken the risk to kill Emperor Evil.","They didn’t have much time to contend with Chu Yunfan, so the greatest possibility was that they would sleep until Chu Yunfan was old and around the same age as them.","In other words, for a long time in the future, it might be Chu Yunfan’s one-man show.","A scene of an Emperor suppressing the world was about to appear.","Just like what many people thought, Chu Yunfan went to the Ancient Realm after becoming an Emperor.","This was a fragment of the Ancient Realm, and the laws of the Great Dao in other places were not even complete.","There was no way to compare it to the Ancient Realm!","After Chu Yunfan arrived in the Ancient Realm, the first thing he did was to establish his own orthodoxy.","He was different from all the other Emperors; he called himself the Dao Lord!","He was a preacher!","He wasn’t like all the previous Emperors who blocked all future Emperors from attaining Dao for their own benefit.","Chu Yunfan would pass down the Great Dao, and at the same time, he would move the world of the Central Plains into this world, taking root in the Ancient Realm.","This time, the Central Plains no longer had to worry about being attacked by Emperor Skyquake Monster.","This was because they also had an Emperor standing behind them, and it was an extremely powerful Emperor."]},{"number":2539,"title":"Chapter 2539: A Hundred Years, Resounding Through the Heavens and Earth!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2539: A Hundred Years, Resounding Through the Heavens and Earth!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","No one in the Central Plains had expected that Chu Yunfan’s seemingly insane plan would actually succeed!","In the end, Chu Yunfan had actually turned the tables on Emperor Evil and become an Emperor. He had even killed Emperor Magus!","The Central Plains, as Chu Yunfan’s direct line of descent, was naturally also honored.","For Chu Yunfan, becoming an Emperor was not the end of everything, but the beginning of everything.","This was because there were still Gods above Emperors.","The godhead that the Emperors were fighting for was in his mind, he studied it day and night.","An unprecedentedly vast domain was displayed in front of him.","He finally understood many secrets, including why no one could become an immortal since the distant ages.","In fact, no one had been able to live forever since ancient times. The fundamental reason was that this world was incomplete.","Even in ancient times, that seemingly extremely powerful world was actually flawed and could not tolerate the existence of Immortals.","He had been cultivating all the way from Earth until now. Of course, he understood that for a cultivator, how powerful he could be was largely dependent on the vastness of the world he was in.","In the Central Plains, people could at most reach the third half-Emperor Stage, but in the Ancient Realm, they could easily reach the ninth stage because the perfection of the laws was completely different.","At the same time, the fundamental reason that limited the strength of these Emperors and even further advancement was none other than the imperfection of this world.","There was only one way to make this world strong, and that was to repair it!","Only by completing this world could he possibly become a God!","Compared to the Ancient Realm, the current Ancient Realm was even more incomplete.","Because there were too few Emperors!","In ancient times, the reason why that world was so glorious was because countless Emperors had appeared one after another. They had evolved the Great Dao to the extreme and even surpassed the original extreme.","The existence of every Emperor represented a great Dao, and it had even reached the grand occasion of all Emperors standing side by side.","It was precisely because of this that the possibility of the world being replenished appeared for the first time, and the godhead descended.","The reason for the collapse of the world was that before the ancient era, there was the even more terrifying and violent Immemorial Era.","At that time, there were too many ferocious beast experts. They conquered the world and destroyed the Great Dao of heaven and earth. The world was already damaged before it was completely formed.","After the Immemorial Era, it was the cultivation civilization that replaced the beast civilization.","By the end of the ancient era, it was already possible to repair the world.","However, at that time, countless Emperors didn’t understand this. Just fighting for the godhead had already caused the world to collapse.","How could they still decipher the godhead? The last Alchemy Emperor who obtained the godhead was also beaten to death. In the end, the Mountain River Diagram wrapped the godhead and disappeared into the endless void.","There were 50 Great Daos and 49 Heavenly Laws, and Chu Yunfan was the one who escaped!","If Chu Yunfan didn’t want to repeat the same mistake, there was only one way, and that was to develop the current civilization far better than the ancient civilization.","Only in this way could the world be repaired!","It was because he understood this that Chu Yunfan was different from all the other Emperors. He began to impart the Great Dao, the Great Dao that could truly make one an Emperor, and at the same time, he spread the various techniques of becoming an Emperor.","After receiving Chu Yunfan’s teachings, countless people were ecstatic. After countless years, someone had finally become an Emperor. Moreover, it was not just a crack in the black curtain.","On this basis, he opened the door wide and wanted everyone to become Emperors.","This was completely different from the previous Emperors. For a moment, everyone saw Chu Yunfan as their hope.","A powerful Emperor with an unprecedented breadth of mind.","In just a hundred years, Chu Yunfan’s reputation had spread to the myriad worlds along with his Great Dao.","Even the ordinary mortals in many worlds had heard of Chu Yunfan’s name.","Even many experts under the eight Emperors were restless and wanted to join Chu Yunfan.","The itinerant cultivators, Evil Gods Creed, and the remaining members of Magi Circle also prostrated themselves at Chu Yunfan’s feet.","Chu Yunfan did not discriminate against these people. On the contrary, he taught them the Great Dao.","The source of their Great Dao was, of course, the godhead in Chu Yunfan’s mind.","The godhead was the concrete embodiment of all the Great Dao in the world. On the other hand, if those people had higher achievements in cultivating the Great Dao, they would be able to feed back into the godhead, making the godhead stronger.","At the same time, Chu Yunfan could also find out through the godhead!","Step by step, he was moving toward the realm of omniscience and omnipotence in the myths and legends.","This was something that even Emperors couldn’t do!","Chu Yunfan spread the Great Dao day after day. In a very short time, the name “Dao Lord” had already resounded throughout the world.","Countless people’s cultivation levels rapidly increased with the help of the Great Dao that Chu Yunfan had spread. Their understanding of the Great Dao was also rapidly feeding Chu Yunfan.","For a time, the entire Ancient Realm was in a state of exuberance.","This situation angered the other powerful Emperors.","After lying low for hundreds of years, they finally couldn’t hold it in anymore. If they let Chu Yunfan continue to preach, the entire world would probably be overturned by Chu Yunfan.","They had maintained their rule for many years by cutting off the path of advancement for all living beings in the world.","However, Chu Yunfan had to fight his way out of this iron curtain.","Without a doubt, this was a taboo.","In the past hundred years, Chu Yunfan had completely ignored their recruitment and had no intention of becoming one of them.","“Since he doesn’t want to be one of us, then let him die. His path is crooked and will only bring the world back to the chaotic times of ancient times!” an Emperor muttered.","They had all seen the chaotic scene in ancient times. Many Emperors even fought and exploded the entire world, leaving only world fragments like the Ancient Realm.","“That’s right. Without us maintaining order, could the world have maintained its prosperity for so many years? He only saw us cutting off the path of advancement for countless lives, but he didn’t see our painstaking efforts, nor did he see us preventing the destruction of the entire world!” another Emperor roared angrily.","“That’s right. How big is the Ancient Realm now? It was less than one percent of the ancient era, how many Emperors could it withstand? Did he want to destroy the world that everyone lived in? He thinks he knows a lot, but in fact, he’s just an idiot!”","“Kill him and correct the world!” An Emperor slammed the table."]},{"number":2540,"title":"Chapter 2540: Emperor Stone’s Attack","paragraphs":["Chapter 2540: Emperor Stone’s Attack","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Dao Lord Emperor Chu!","These four words resounded throughout the myriad worlds for a hundred years.","An Emperor who was completely different from all the previous Emperors.","Previously, all the Emperors were unwilling to impart the true Great Dao, and they even set up all kinds of traps to cut off everyone’s path.","Furthermore, if they were itinerant cultivators, they would have to be extremely careful in order to cultivate to the seventh half-Emperor Stage. If they were not careful, they would break the taboo and be killed.","Many of the unspoken rules were clear to the group of itinerant cultivators and half-Emperors, but they couldn’t resist.","This was because they were not facing a single Emperor, but all Emperors.","The Emperors had conflicts in all sorts of matters, but they were unprecedentedly united when it came to suppressing those below them.","They had never been ununited on this matter before!","Everyone was faced with a dark cloud. The dark cloud pressed down on them, making it difficult for them to breathe.","Countless people dared to be angry but did not dare to say anything!","Compared to those powerful Emperors, so what if these half-Emperors rebelled collectively? They might not be a match for any of them.","A half-Emperor might seem like a reserve Emperor, but in reality, he was just a King.","How could a King defeat an Emperor?","No matter how one looked at it, it was impossible!","They were not on the same level of existence at all!","However, Chu Yunfan was different. He was willing to teach them all the Great Dao and guide them in their cultivation!","Imparting the Great Dao!","For a moment, countless itinerant cultivators were extremely grateful!","In Dao Haven Citp, Chu Yunfan was lecturing on the Dao as usual. Hundreds of half-Emperors were sitting down and listening to him.","In the city further away, countless peak Kings heard this and were mesmerized.","The reason why it could attract so many peak Kings was because in the past hundred years, after listening to Chu Yunfan’s Dao, countless experts had broken through from the peak King Stage to the half-Emperor Stage.","It was precisely because of this that it attracted countless cultivators. Even the Kings who belonged to the other Emperors’ forces came.","After all, even in the other Emperors’ forces, only one in ten Kings could break through to the half-Emperor Stage. If it was an ordinary inheritance, it might even be one in a hundred.","Because of this, no one didn’t want to break through to the half-Emperor Stage. In the absence of an Emperor, a half-Emperor was the true ruler in the Ancient Realm.","First, there were those who were bold, or those who were already old and only had one last chance to rush over. They found that Chu Yunfan did not reject them and even welcomed them.","Then, all kinds of Kings rushed over.","There were even many half-Kings waiting outside the newly built Dao Haven City.","However, their cultivation levels were too low, so they could not understand the Great Dao that Chu Yunfan had directly imparted to them.","However, apart from directly imparting the Great Dao, Chu Yunfan would also impart various cultivation methods and techniques for breakthroughs. Many half-Kings had also obtained benefits and advanced to the King Stage.","Of course, Chu Yunfan couldn’t control the lower stages because he couldn’t take care of so many people. They couldn’t even reach the half-King Stage, so it wasn’t in Chu Yunfan’s plan.","Chu Yunfan couldn’t be a nanny and take care of everyone.","He just wanted to complete his plan of nurturing Emperors.","If outsiders knew, they would probably be shocked. Chu Yunfan, who was only an Emperor and a newly ascended Emperor, actually had the idea of nurturing Emperors.","It was simply unbelievable!","They didn’t know what Chu Yunfan was planning, but the group of half-Emperors knew. Although they didn’t know why Chu Yunfan was doing this, this was an unprecedented opportunity for them.","Chu Yunfan’s words turned into golden lotuses. They were the golden lotuses of the Great Dao. When one’s cultivation reached a certain stage, they would be able to comprehend the profundities within.","Suddenly, just as everyone was intoxicated by the story, a terrifying aura burst out. Then, a stone saber split the sky and broke through the defensive barrier of Dao Haven, slashing directly at Chu Yunfan.","Everyone was jolted awake. When they saw this scene, they were instantly furious.","“Who dares to be so disrespectful to the Dao Lord?!”","Many people were furious because Chu Yunfan had taught them too much during this period of time.","They respected Chu Yunfan from the bottom of their hearts. He was an unprecedented Emperor.","Now that someone was slashing down at Chu Yunfan, they were instantly enraged.","But at this moment, Chu Yunfan directly attacked. He punched out, and in an instant, the world collapsed.","Almost immediately, the group of half-Emperors felt a terrifying aura sweep out.","However, before they could escape, this wave of air was directly contained within a hundred feet of Chu Yunfan, not leaking out at all.","Obviously, Chu Yunfan had the situation under control.","Even though this was an Emperor’s attack, it did not spread out. Chu Yunfan’s control over his own strength had long reached the peak.","After blocking the terrifying saber with one punch, Chu Yunfan immediately grabbed out with his big hand. It expanded with the wind, and in an instant, it turned into a monstrous hand. It suddenly tore open the space, and a figure fell from it.","His entire body was like a stone elf. His skin was stone colored, but there was a supreme Great Dao floating around his body.","Everyone looked at him. This person was none other than one of the Emperors who had ruled the world for countless years, Emperor Stone!","That stone saber was Emperor Stone’s artifact.","Only such a powerful expert would be able to break through the defenses of Dao Haven in an instant and deal such a terrifying blow to Dao Lord Emperor Chu.","“Emperor Stone?” Chu Yunfan glanced at Emperor Stone and said, “When I was fighting against Emperor Magus, I thought you would show up, but you didn’t. Now, you’re here again. Are you confident that you can defeat me now?”","A contemptuous smile appeared on Chu Yunfan’s face. When he was fighting against Emperor Magus, he had sensed the presence of several terrifying Emperors spying on him. One of them was Emperor Stone.","He roughly understood that Emperor Stone and the others wanted to wait until both he and Emperor Magus were injured before they attacked. Whether they seized Emperor Magus’ Emperor essence or cooperated with Emperor Magus to seize his Emperor essence, it was a win-win situation.","Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan would be so powerful that he could easily kill Emperor Magus?","After Chu Yunfan officially entered the Ancient Realm, these Emperors found various reasons to leave the Ancient Realm.","Although ordinary people didn’t know and couldn’t feel it, thinking that they were still in the Ancient Realm, Chu Yunfan knew it clearly."]},{"number":2541,"title":"Chapter 2541: One by One, They Came to Die","paragraphs":["Chapter 2541: One by One, They Came to Die","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan also knew the reason why they did this. It was probably to avoid his limelight!","Before Chu Yunfan became an Emperor, the strength of each Emperor was relatively balanced, and no one had the ability to deal with each other alone.","Emperor Evil had managed to escape even when four Emperors had attacked him, and it had taken him many years to find him and kill him.","However, Chu Yunfan’s appearance had completely broken this balance. He had killed Emperor Magus single-handedly.","Emperor Magus was definitely not weak among them!","This made the other Emperors extremely wary of Chu Yunfan’s strength!","They were afraid that Chu Yunfan would target them and they would become the next Emperor to be killed.","Therefore, after Chu Yunfan entered the Ancient Realm, they quickly left the Ancient Realm and entered the depths of the starry sky.","It was just that no one knew. After all, it was normal for the Emperors to self-proclaim that they had disappeared a hundred years ago. Everyone was used to it.","Chu Yunfan did not publicize it, so no one knew.","Only now did everyone realize from Chu Yunfan’s words that all the Emperors had left the Ancient Realm.","And there was only one reason to leave the Ancient Realm, and that was to avoid Chu Yunfan’s sharp edge!","Obviously, Chu Yunfan’s strength was inconceivable to even the Emperors. He was a huge threat.","It was as if a knife was on their back!","That was why they had no choice but to leave to take refuge!","However, everyone could understand the fear of the Emperors. Before Chu Yunfan, the Emperors had never encountered such a terrifying existence.","The problem was that Chu Yunfan was not only a newly-ascended Emperor, but he was also terrifyingly powerful. He had single-handedly killed Emperor Magus.","That was a major event that would have affected the situation for thousands of years in ancient times.","Not to mention now, the Ten Great Emperors covered the sky. From ancient times until now, everyone had been under the rule of the Ten Great Emperors for countless years. It almost made the entire world feel that there was no chance to breathe.","But now, Chu Yunfan had broken through the terrifying dark clouds by himself.","If the Emperors didn’t care, that would be the biggest joke in the world!","After living for too long, these Emperors had lost their original thoughts of advancing bravely. They were only left with the desire to drag out their lives and live longer.","Emperor Stone gripped the stone saber in his hand and did not speak. He stared at Chu Yunfan. The aura on his body was constantly surging as if he was guarding against Chu Yunfan’s sudden attack.","His eyes were filled with vigilance!","“You alone have the guts to appear in front of me? Where are the others?” Chu Yunfan said calmly. “Why don’t you come out together? It’s not a good habit to come knocking on our door one by one!”","When everyone heard this, they couldn’t help but be shocked. Chu Yunfan’s words pointed out a terrifying fact. There were probably other Emperors standing behind Emperor Stone.","That was why Emperor Stone dared to appear in front of Chu Yunfan.","“Chu Yunfan, you are too arrogant. Don’t think that you can do whatever you want just because you defeated Emperor Magus!”","Emperor Stone was a little angry because Chu Yunfan looked down on him.","Even though Chu Yunfan’s current combat strength made him feel very afraid, it was also because he was afraid of Chu Yunfan’s vigorous blood essence and jealous of his young life.","As for his true battle prowess, he had nothing to fear.","So what if Chu Yunfan was powerful now? Could he kill him so easily?","He wasn’t Emperor Magus, so he wouldn’t fall into Chu Yunfan’s trap without any precautions.","“In that case, I’ll kill you first and force them out!” Chu Yunfan looked at Emperor Stone with a hint of killing intent.","In his eyes, the Emperors provided no contribution to this world, only obstacles.","If they had obediently waited for death in outer space, Chu Yunfan would not mind letting them live and let them die of old age.","But now, since they couldn’t wait to jump out, Chu Yunfan would eliminate this evil for the world.","The ten Emperors were the ten old thieves who had harmed the world for a long time.","Boom!","In an instant, Emperor Stone made his move. The saber swept out, and the saber light directly turned the void into a world of stone energy. Almost instantly, everyone saw a petrified world like a scroll, spreading toward Chu Yunfan like mercury.","If an ordinary person was swept by this saber light, even if they were not killed immediately, they would be petrified into a stone painting.","It was a terrifying divine power that allowed one’s Great Dao to permeate the entire world!","Chu Yunfan was not to be outdone either. He stood up and a barrier rose up in an instant, isolating him and Emperor Stone. This prevented the aftermath of the battle from affecting the half-Emperors and Kings outside.","These were all important seeds and elites for Chu Yunfan’s future plans. Chu Yunfan would not allow any harm to come to them.","Immediately after, Emperor Stone discovered that his stone energy could not spread out. It was directly isolated by the Mountain River Diagram in a space.","Chu Yunfan threw a backhand punch.","Boom!","The terrifying fist force and saber light collided in the air. The terrifying collision almost caused the sky to collapse and the world to collapse.","The surging fluctuations of the laws emitted billions of multicolored lights. Everyone was dumbfounded as they watched everything in front of them.","After crushing the saber light with one punch, Chu Yunfan clenched his five fingers into a fist. A terrifying fist intent appeared behind him. It was the terrifying eight gods.","Chu Yunfan’s Eight Heavenly Dragons formed a brand new world that enveloped Emperor Stone.","It was Chu Yunfan’s domain world.","When Emperor Stone and the world that Emperor Evil had left behind fused together, it was as if the entire world would be transformed into a world of stone energy.","Suddenly, at this moment, Emperor Stone was shocked to find that his stone world was easily crushed and collapsed by Chu Yunfan’s domain.","“How is this possible?” Emperor Stone shouted in shock. This was because the competition in the domain world was largely a competition of one’s comprehension of the Great Dao and nothing else.","If one’s comprehension of the Great Dao was far inferior to the other party’s, they would be easily defeated and crushed by the other party like this.","Find the loophole in one’s domain and then break it.","However, the gap between the Emperors was very small. After all, they had already stepped into the Emperor Stage. Who was weaker than who?","Even if there was a difference, it wouldn’t be too big.","And even if there was a certain gap, he should be far stronger than Chu Yunfan.","His understanding of the Great Dao was actually inferior to Chu Yunfan’s, and it was far inferior. That was why he was defeated so easily.","His domain world was easily torn apart and then shattered. He was no match for it at all."]},{"number":2542,"title":"Chapter 2542: The Final Battle Has Arrived","paragraphs":["Chapter 2542: The Final Battle Has Arrived","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Boom!","The domain world was torn apart soundlessly. Under the cover of Chu Yunfan’s domain world, not even sound could be heard. Everyone could only see Emperor Stone’s domain world being torn apart soundlessly.","But then, Chu Yunfan’s punch exploded with a world-shaking bang. Chu Yunfan’s punch pierced through time and space, and in an instant, it pierced through Emperor Stone’s body.","It was too fast!","At the same time, this attack was too powerful.","It was so fast that even Emperor Stone could not react in time. In an instant, Emperor Stone’s body exploded in the air.","Bam!","Emperor Stone’s body was directly turned into countless blood clots and flew out.","In the next moment, Emperor Stone’s body reformed in the distance, his face filled with terror.","He realized that Chu Yunfan’s strength was completely different from what he had expected.","They had all made their judgment based on the battle between Chu Yunfan and Emperor Magus a hundred years ago. At that time, although Chu Yunfan was powerful, he was not that powerful.","At that time, Chu Yunfan could be said to have used all of his methods. First, he used the Mountain River Diagram, and then the Brahma Tree turned into a battle armor to protect himself. His strength was raised to the peak before he killed Emperor Magus.","But now, Chu Yunfan’s methods were nowhere to be seen. He was invincible with just his body. This was even more terrifying.","Compared to a hundred years ago, Chu Yunfan had become even more unfathomable.","However, it had only been a hundred years. For the Emperors who had tens of thousands of years of lifespan, a hundred years was really just a snap of the finger. It was not easy to make some progress.","Not to mention a huge improvement, it was almost impossible!","However, Chu Yunfan did it. This step was not just a simple step up, but a huge leap forward.","Chu Yunfan had completely broken Emperor Stone’s judgment of the speed at which Emperors could improve themselves.","Chu Yunfan was too strong!","Terrifyingly strong!","However, before Emperor Stone could figure it out, Chu Yunfan had already rushed in front of Emperor Stone in the next moment. He turned his body and kicked the air with lightning speed.","Boom!","The body that Emperor Stone had just reconstructed was once again shattered. His primordial spirit within escaped, attempting to reconstruct its body in the distance.","This was his core!","But he couldn’t stop Chu Yunfan!","Chu Yunfan was too strong, so strong that it was terrifying. He saw Emperor Stone’s primordial spirit at a glance and reached out his hand to grab it.","Bam!","Emperor Stone’s primordial spirit was caught on the spot, and the laws transformed into a huge net that directly trapped him within. He had no way of resisting at all.","Emperor Stone’s primordial spirit was still very terrifying, even more terrifying than a peak half-Emperor.","However, in front of Chu Yunfan, he had no power to retaliate at all. A ball of flames rose from Chu Yunfan’s hand, and Emperor Stone’s primordial spirit was burned to ashes in an instant.","All of this took a long time to describe, but in fact, it happened in a short period of time. Everyone only saw Chu Yunfan use two moves in a very short period of time, and then Emperor Stone was killed.","The terrifying efficiency of this almost made them tremble in fear.","It shocked them!","Chu Yunfan’s killing efficiency was too shocking!","At this moment, they looked at Chu Yunfan again. He stood with his hands behind his back, his black hair fluttering in the wind. He looked like a living God looking down on everyone.","“No wonder all the Emperors wanted to escape. Facing such a terrifying monster, how could they survive if they didn’t escape?”","Many people couldn’t help but have this thought. Initially, some people thought that those Emperors were making a mountain out of a molehill.","Although Chu Yunfan had the strength to kill an Emperor alone, he probably wouldn’t be able to do anything to those Emperors if they joined forces.","Although the Ancient Realm was huge, it didn’t take a long time for an Emperor to rush over from all over the world.","But now, they understood that the Emperors were wise. They had underestimated this Dao Lord who had been wholeheartedly preaching to them every day, Emperor Chu.","Chu Yunfan’s strength was probably not the strongest in the world, but it was close.","Although there was no clear distinction between the strong and the weak among the Emperors, it was obvious that no one could easily kill others.","Chu Yunfan, who had such strength, was naturally invincible.","However, they didn’t know how Chu Yunfan had succeeded in cultivating it. They only felt that since Chu Yunfan was the first person to break through to the Emperor Stage since ancient times, he might really have some skills that others didn’t have.","Chu Yunfan looked at the sky with an imposing manner.","It had only been a short hundred years. To the Emperors, it was just a snap of their fingers. If they sealed themselves, it would really be just a snap of their fingers. However, to him, it was really a different world.","A hundred years ago, Emperor Stone was not his match. However, he could only cripple Emperor Stone at most. If other Emperors interfered, he might not be able to kill Emperor Stone.","Not to mention that he had killed Emperor Stone in such a short period of time.","The secret of his improvement was all in the Great Dao he taught. He had imparted countless Great Dao to others, and countless people had improved because of it. The improvement of these people would perfect the Heavenly Dao.","Transcending the original way of the Emperors would make the world more and more perfect, and this comprehension would be fed back to Chu Yunfan’s godhead, which he would absorb.","Therefore, he was never afraid of those half-Emperors and was not stingy with teaching them the way to become Emperors. The stronger they were, the faster Chu Yunfan’s growth would be ten times, a hundred times, or even more.","In just a short hundred years, Chu Yunfan had become several times stronger and reached an unprecedented level.","However, he knew that this level was still far from becoming a God. He still had many things to do. Only by completing the steps in his plan step by step could he have the possibility of becoming a God.","Now, he was only testing the results of a hundred years of cultivation!","More importantly, these Emperors had become an obstacle on Chu Yunfan’s path to Godhood. It was fine if they didn’t come out, but since they came out, it was just nice to have a decisive battle to deal with these old Emperors.","Chu Yunfan tore open the sky in front of him, and a terrifying scene appeared in front of everyone.","They saw a group of Emperors appear in front of everyone. They counted the number of people one by one. There were a total of seven people, all of whom were the remaining seven of the ten Emperors.","Each of them exuded a monstrous might, making them feel that they were not facing a single person, but a world.","These seven worlds pressed down, almost causing the entire Dao Haven to collapse.","None of these Emperors backed down because they understood that the final battle had finally arrived."]},{"number":2543,"title":"Chapter 2543: Fighting the Emperors","paragraphs":["Chapter 2543: Fighting the Emperors","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","For the past hundred years, the various Emperors had been observing Chu Yunfan’s actions. They did not know if Chu Yunfan would choose to join their group.","Over the countless years, there was naturally no lack of competition between the various Emperors. However, when it came to suppressing the other competitors, they all cooperated tacitly.","What could not be obtained in the territory of a certain Emperor, could not be obtained in the territory of another Emperor.","This side didn’t allow itinerant cultivators to break through to the seventh half-Emperor Stage, and neither did the other side. No place would allow it.","This was the bottom line.","They weren’t even afraid that a new Emperor would appear under their command, because the forces under their command cultivated the cultivation techniques they had personally created, and they would grow step by step according to their imagination.","However, in the end, they would realize that there was a huge monster blocking their way. If they walked on this path, they would never be able to surpass them.","The only ones who had a chance were those itinerant half-Emperors. Those half-Emperors walked their own paths. Although they were inevitably influenced by them, they had the opportunity and the ability to walk their own paths.","Although the chances of such a thing happening were extremely small, it was still something that the Emperors could not tolerate.","Because of this, all the Emperors joined hands to ban those itinerant cultivators.","Chu Yunfan’s rise in the end also proved that they were right.","It was impossible for an Emperor to appear under their command. Only a top expert who was completely unaffected by them and walked their own path could appear among the itinerant cultivators.","Their prediction was right!","However, they had different opinions about Chu Yunfan because he was different from any of the previous Emperors. He was powerful, to be precise, too powerful.","He was so strong that it was difficult for them to use force. Even if they joined forces to encircle Chu Yunfan, their chances of winning were not very high.","Therefore, they were waiting for Chu Yunfan to see the situation clearly and join them to rule the Ancient Realm.","However, in the past hundred years, Chu Yunfan had been spreading the idea of becoming Emperors. Many half-Emperors had even abandoned their cultivation and started to recultivate. Moreover, they had been improving at an astonishing speed. This series of changes had made the Emperors unable to sit still.","If Chu Yunfan was allowed to continue like this, the entire world would change. If there were a few more Emperors, how could there be a place for old guys like them?","Even their survival might be greatly threatened. After all, time was on the side of the young. A new Emperor like Chu Yunfan was like the morning sun at nine o’clock, while they were undoubtedly the sunset.","There was only one way to stop the situation from developing in that direction, and that was to kill Chu Yunfan!","Therefore, even though they knew that Chu Yunfan was terrifying and powerful, they had no other choice.","At this moment, they had regained their confidence as invincible Emperors.","Chu Yunfan looked at the crowd with a cold smile in his eyes. “It’s just nice. I’ll kill all of you at the same time. You’ve been hindering the progress of the world for too many years. You’re the tumor of the world!”","Hearing this, the faces of the Emperors turned ugly.","Emperor Elements said in a low voice, “Emperor Chu, don’t celebrate too early. You’re still young and your body still has a lot of time. You don’t understand our thoughts at all. Sooner or later, you’ll grow old. When that time comes, you’ll know what it means to be afraid of death!”","“That’s right. We are high and mighty gods. Why should we be asked to live and die like ordinary creatures? We must defy the heavens!” Emperor Skyquake Monster nodded.","Ever since they had become Emperors, they had not put themselves and ordinary people in their eyes. They were their own kind and the rest were just ants.","Has anyone ever seen others treat ants as their own kind?","That was simply impossible!","When everyone heard this, their expressions changed. If Chu Yunfan had fallen like these Emperors, then it would undoubtedly be the greatest dark age in the world.","Chu Yunfan’s strength was too terrifying, far beyond that of an ordinary Emperor.","Because of this, once Chu Yunfan started a rebellion, there would be no hope left in the world.","These Emperors were unwilling to die like this, unwilling to grow old like this. If killing could solve the problem, Chu Yunfan had no doubt that they would slaughter the entire universe just to prolong their lives.","There was great terror between life and death!","Even Emperors with tens of thousands of years of lifespan would find it difficult to escape such a great terror!","“You’re so long-winded. What’s the point of living like you? I want to go against the heavens. I want to walk on an unprecedented path that is different from all of you!” Chu Yunfan declared.","Chu Yunfan did not waver in the slightest. His determination was so firm that even if the world collapsed and the world reopened, it would not shake his conviction.","He wanted to walk an unprecedented path to immortality, and no one could stop him.","“Hahahahaha!”","The group of Emperors laughed. It was as if they had seen themselves from countless years ago. They had also been so high-spirited and felt invincible in the world.","No one could stop them from doing what they wanted. They would definitely get what they wanted.","Until they gradually discovered their aging. They were really old, so old that they could not even resist.","They could only extend their lifespans crazily. One more day was one more day. No one was willing to die.","Chu Yunfan looked at the group of Emperors who were laughing wildly. He felt a little pity in his heart. These people were all heroes of the ages, but they could not take it lying down in front of death.","In fact, if it was his turn in the future, he didn’t know if he would be able to let it go. Therefore, he wanted to walk a path that no one else had, a truly invincible path to immortality.","At that moment, the seven Emperors had already made their move. Terrifying law attacks swept toward Chu Yunfan like mercury pouring down from the ground.","The half-Emperors quickly fled from Dao Haven.","Although there were restrictions and barriers set up by Chu Yunfan in Dao Haven, they were still worried that they would be affected.","The people who were affected by the battle between Emperor Magus and Chu Yunfan were all severely injured. This was a lesson from the past, and it was still vivid in their minds. How could they not care?","All they saw was the countless laws around Chu Yunfan boiling. Yes, like boiling water, they boiled in an instant.","Countless laws were actually drawn out by someone, materialized, and joined the battle.","They were like terrifying weapons that covered the sky."]},{"number":2544,"title":"Chapter 2544: Almost Invincible!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2544: Almost Invincible!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The weapons formed by laws were extremely terrifying. Any one of them could easily kill a half-Emperor.","The difference in strength between the Emperors and the half-Emperors was too great, so great that it was impossible to make up for it.","The methods of an Emperor were all directed at the origin. Even the powerful half-Emperors felt extremely terrified when they saw this terrifying scene of casually using laws to fight.","Boom!","In an instant, heaven and earth shook violently.","Above Chu Yunfan’s head, the Mountain River Diagram rotated, stabilizing the laws in the surrounding void.","Even though he had to compete with the seven Emperors for control of the laws at the same time, Chu Yunfan was not afraid!","After those law attacks blasted into the space of the Mountain River Diagram, they dissipated without a trace.","In an instant, countless lights were released, turning into light that filled the sky. Endless chaos was slashed apart, and the world collapsed.","The entire Ancient Realm could feel this terrifying battle. Although many living beings might not be able to see it directly, they could still feel that even the surrounding space was fluctuating.","“Die!” Chu Yunfan shouted. His figure rose from the ground and directly entered the chaos.","It forced the battlefield from Dao Haven into the chaos.","He knew that if the battlefield was here, even with the restrictions and barriers he had left behind, they would not be able to stop the destruction of so many Emperors.","The group of Emperors also followed in at the same time. They had never thought of shattering the Ancient Realm. This was also a situation that they had deliberately avoided for countless years.","The Ancient Realm was their final resting place. Without the Ancient Realm, they were like stray dogs.","As for the experts of the Ancient Realm, they all had complicated feelings. Even the experts under the various Emperors did not necessarily want Chu Yunfan to lose.","Many of the itinerant cultivators were already in tears.","Chu Yunfan was not fighting alone. He represented the countless living beings behind him and carried the hope of countless living beings.","The existence of the Ten Great Emperors had hindered the progress of this world for far too many years.","Now, there was finally hope. Chu Yunfan was fighting for them.","Otherwise, as long as Chu Yunfan joined the various Emperors, he would not be targeted by them.","There was no need to be so worried.","At this moment, through the crack, they saw Chu Yunfan calmly facing the siege of the seven Emperors in the chaos. Around him, eight Gods and eight heavenly dragons suppressed the chaos.","He had actually reconstructed the four elements in the chaos and rebuilt his domain world.","Even when facing the siege of the various Emperors, he was still so calm and powerful.","The group of Emperors were all shocked. They had joined forces to attack Chu Yunfan, but they were still unable to suppress his aura. At this moment, Chu Yunfan seemed too terrifying.","He was almost invincible!","At this time, it was not an exaggeration to call him the number one expert in the world!","Chu Yunfan held a spear in his hand. It was none other than the Evil God Spear!","The Evil God Spear in Chu Yunfan’s hand burst into billions of rays of light. The terrifying power shook the entire chaos.","In Chu Yunfan’s hand, the Evil God Spear no longer had any evil aura. In the past hundred years, Chu Yunfan had erased the laws that Emperor Evil had set up in the Evil God Spear. Instead, he had integrated his own laws into it. At this time, it finally revealed its incomparable power.","Suddenly, one of the slender Emperors stopped and began to form a seal. He began to chant a shocking incantation.","In an instant, Chu Yunfan’s entire body changed. His hair turned white, his clothes became tattered, his armpits sweated, and his entire body stank.","This was impossible for any successful cultivator, not to mention an Emperor.","The Five Declines of Life!","Chu Yunfan noticed the changes in his body. All these signs were signs of entering the Five Declines.","Generally speaking, only those who were on the verge of death or waiting for death would have such a situation, especially for cultivators. Even if they were old, it was very difficult for such a situation to occur.","Only at a certain stage before death would there be signs of the Five Declines.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan had also entered the state of Five Declines of Life. Darkness also appeared on his forehead. It was the blackening of his glabella.","All these situations were ominous!","With his cultivation base, he still had a long lifespan, at least tens of thousands of years left. It was impossible for such signs of death to appear. There was only one possibility, and that was that someone had cursed him.","And the one who cursed him was none other than Emperor Curse of the Ten Great Emperors.","Emperor Curse hadn’t even appeared when they were besieging Emperor Evil. Now, he had appeared to target Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan didn’t know much about Emperor Curse. He only knew that he was an Emperor who had survived from a long time ago. However, he found some records about Emperor Curse in the memories of the Alchemy Emperor.","He was indeed an extremely ancient Emperor. He was also very famous in the era when the Emperors stood side by side because he had once used his curse powers to curse an Emperor to death.","Because of this, he became famous!","However, Chu Yunfan only sneered. With a surge of his powerful energy and blood, the signs of the Five Declines disappeared without a trace.","He returned to his youthful appearance, and his skin became smooth again.","Emperor Curse’s curses were indeed impressive. If an ordinary person wanted to curse him, they would probably be counterattacked by the Heavenly Dao and die tragically on the spot.","Even if he succeeded, the pitiful power of the curse would not be able to hurt Chu Yunfan at all.","However, Emperor Curse’s curse relied directly on the Heavenly Dao and invaded Chu Yunfan’s body with the power of the laws. It was actually able to make Chu Yunfan temporarily fall into the Five Declines.","A curse that had killed an Emperor was indeed impressive!","However, he had underestimated Chu Yunfan. At this moment, Chu Yunfan’s strength had already surpassed their imagination.","Spurt!","Emperor Curse coughed up a mouthful of blood. He had failed to curse Chu Yunfan and had suffered a shocking backlash, causing him to be severely injured.","His curses had never been so weak. Against Chu Yunfan, whose strength far surpassed his, these curses were useless.","Before he could regain his senses, Chu Yunfan’s body emitted a boundless brilliant light. It was the Brahma Tree that had been fixed in the depths of his mind. Any curses or mental attacks were meaningless in front of the Brahma Tree.","He couldn’t be hurt!","Chu Yunfan also took this opportunity to step into the chaos and instantly arrived in front of Emperor Curse. He clenched his five fingers into a fist and punched out."]},{"number":2545,"title":"Chapter 2545: The Causality Law, Invincible","paragraphs":["Chapter 2545: The Causality Law, Invincible","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“What?” Emperor Curse didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to get rid of everyone’s attacks and come directly in front of him.","In an instant, countless laws rose around Emperor Curse and turned into a large array that blasted toward Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look. He simply thrust out his spear and pierced through the chaos in an instant.","At this moment, it seemed slow but was actually fast. The spear pierced through everything!","Stab!","Emperor Curse was directly stabbed by the spear. There was no way for him to dodge. The domain world around him collapsed.","Emperor Curse could only feel that his Emperor essence had been absorbed by the Evil God Spear. In that instant, he had become extremely old, to the point that he could not even maintain his appearance.","Fresh blood spurted out as Emperor Curse hastily retreated. Emperor Curse was an Emperor after all. However, this spear did not kill him, but he still suffered terrifying injuries.","Behind him, several other Emperors followed him, trying to disturb Chu Yunfan.","All kinds of terrifying attacks swept toward Chu Yunfan like a flood.","Above Chu Yunfan’s head, the Mountain River Diagram turned into a world that suppressed these attacks. Chu Yunfan rushed forward without any hesitation and stabbed again.","Emperor Curse could not dodge this spear at all and was directly hit.","“How is this possible? The causality law, you actually...” Emperor Curse’s eyes widened. In his eyes, Chu Yunfan was no longer a human, but a legendary God that was above all Emperors.","This was because his spear actually possessed the power of causality law.","He cursed himself and hid behind countless layers of space. He looked like he was right before Chu Yunfan, but in fact, he was behind countless layers of space.","Even if Chu Yunfan could destroy it with one punch, it would buy him time to move.","This was also why Emperors were so difficult to kill. Even when Emperor Evil was surrounded by the four Emperors, the four Emperors found it difficult to kill him.","But now, Chu Yunfan’s spear had avoided the layers of space and pierced his heart.","This was the application of the causality law!","Cause and effect!","First, there was the result of the spear piercing him, and then there was the process of the spear piercing him.","What a terrifying attack!","Causal techniques were terrifying techniques that had risen to the level of causality law!","In ancient times, there were countless Emperors who studied this causality law. However, in their eyes, this even surpassed time law and space law, which were powerful laws that everyone knew.","They didn’t even have a clue!","Time had its own rules, and so did space.","As long as one could study the laws, one would be able to master these laws and use them for oneself.","Among them, causality law was the most unpredictable, including the prophecy and divination of some Emperors.","If there was a cause, there would definitely be an effect. To deduce the effect from the cause was the art of prophecy, and to deduce the cause from the effect was the art of divination.","One was for the future, and the other was for the past!","They all followed the basic principle of cause and effect!","However, Chu Yunfan’s spear attack had clearly surpassed this level. It didn’t matter what the cause was. As long as one set an effect, there would be thousands of ways to create a cause.","This was the most terrifying part!","This was because the fact that he had been stabbed by the spear was a pre-determined outcome. The outcome was a fact that had already happened. No matter how one changed the fact that had already happened, they could not change it.","Since there was an effect, there would be every possible way to produce a cause. Even heaven and earth would help to complete this cause.","This was how terrifying Chu Yunfan’s spear was!","At this moment, Emperor Curse finally understood why Chu Yunfan was so fearless.","In these hundreds of years, he had actually developed such a terrifying thing.","After killing Emperor Curse, Chu Yunfan was expressionless. Everything was within his expectations.","It was just that this was the first time he used the causality law after studying it.","This was something that the Emperors had been unable to do no matter how many years they had studied it before, because they were not Gods. Only Gods could do it.","God said, let there be light, and there was light.","This meant that there was an effect first, and then, regardless of whether it was reasonable or not, there would always be a cause.","But now, after mastering the godhead, Chu Yunfan had a grasp on this power.","When he completely grasped the godhead, he would be truly terrifying. His words would carry the law. Heaven and earth would operate under his will. If he wanted water to flow higher, water would flow higher. If he wanted creatures to fly without wings, they would fly.","He didn’t need a special reason. He just wanted the result, and heaven and earth would naturally make up for it.","Of course, this causality law attack method consumed a lot of energy. Even for an Emperor like Chu Yunfan, who had profound cultivation, it was difficult to use it continuously. After all, an Emperor was not a God.","However, this was enough for Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s thoughts only drifted for a moment before he immediately turned to the remaining Emperors.","The Emperors felt a chill down their spines. They had all witnessed how Emperor Curse was killed by Chu Yunfan in an unbelievable manner.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at them. He directly stepped into the chaos and joined the battlefield.","“Today, we shall suppress all darkness!” Chu Yunfan’s shout shook the entire Ancient Realm, in the ears of countless people, and they groveled.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan was too strong, and the six great Emperors had gone crazy. Four of the ten great Emperors, who had once ruled the Ancient Realm, had been slaughtered by Chu Yunfan unknowingly, and almost half of them were gone.","Chu Yunfan opened up a phenomenon. It was a domain world formed by his martial will that suppressed all directions.","The Mountain River Diagram flew high into the sky and froze Chaos, as well as the terrifying attacks.","Chu Yunfan came directly to a person, Emperor Skyquake Monster.","At this moment, Emperor Skyquake Monster had already transformed into his true form. He was a terrifying monster that was tens of thousands of miles long. In the Chaos, such a terrifying figure was extremely terrifying.","Chu Yunfan was once extremely afraid of Emperor Skyquake Monster, but now, he was nothing.","Chu Yunfan clenched his fist and threw out the Eight Astonishing Punches.","The eight Gods appeared after Chu Yunfan condensed his fist intent and pressed down on Emperor Skyquake Monster.","On Emperor Skyquake Monster’s body, the Myriad Monster Banner appeared to resist the eight Gods.","The Evil God Spear in Chu Yunfan’s hand also swept out and struck the Myriad Monster Banner. It actually pierced a big hole in the Myriad Monster Banner. The Myriad Monster Banner could not block it at all.","Emperor Skyquake Monster let out a miserable cry. He was hit by Chu Yunfan’s fist intent. The eight Gods swept out in all directions and directly suppressed him.","Emperor Skyquake Monster was an Emperor, but he had no choice but to scream. One could imagine what kind of terrifying attack he was enduring.","Bam!","In the next moment, Emperor Skyquake Monster’s body cracked and exploded."]},{"number":2546,"title":"Chapter 2546: The Number One Emperor Since Ancient Times","paragraphs":["Chapter 2546: The Number One Emperor Since Ancient Times","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Emperor Skyquake Monster’s body was definitely not weak, but he was smashed into pieces by Chu Yunfan’s punch. This scene was too brutal.","Emperor Skyquake Monster’s body exploded. It was as if thousands of divine mountains had crashed into his body when he was hit by Chu Yunfan’s punch. He could not withstand it at all and exploded on the spot.","Emperor Skyquake Monster’s primordial spirit was hiding inside. He wanted to escape, but he could not.","Because Chu Yunfan thrusted the Evil God Spear at him.","There was no need to reverse the cause and effect. With a simple stab, it hit Emperor Skyquake Monster’s primordial spirit that was as huge as a star.","“Aaaaggghh!” Emperor Skyquake Monster screamed and was stabbed to death on the spot.","Another Emperor had fallen!","Heaven and earth were in sorrow!","Many half-Emperors were shocked by this scene. Three of the eight Emperors had died in the battle, and only five remained.","The dangerous situation that Emperor Chu was facing seemed to have been alleviated.","No matter what, fighting five was much better than fighting eight.","“The mighty Emperor Chu! The number one Emperor since ancient times!” someone exclaimed.","“Even on the path of an Emperor, Emperor Chu has probably walked very far!”","“Invincible! This is the hope of our entire world!”","Countless people celebrated. The stronger Chu Yunfan was, the greater the hope for their future.","However, the Emperors were not in such a good mood. Chu Yunfan was terrifyingly powerful. A simple attack could severely injure or even kill an Emperor.","Chu Yunfan’s strength was something that had never been seen before.","This was simply like a myth. If today’s battle could be passed down to future generations, it would probably be regarded as a myth.","They couldn’t believe that Chu Yunfan could come and go freely among so many Emperors.","Chu Yunfan held the Evil God Spear in his hand and looked at these Emperors. He didn’t think much of them. In the past hundred years, he had been preparing for this battle.","The final battle was to eliminate all the Emperors who were hindering the development of the world and preventing him from becoming a God.","It was only natural that one would be prepared to fight against an unprepared opponent.","“K-Kill him. Only by killing him can we live. Otherwise, we will all die today!”","The remaining five Emperors roared. They all understood that at this point, there was no possibility of reconciliation between them and Chu Yunfan. Either Chu Yunfan died, or they died. There was no other possibility.","“Kill him and seize his Emperor essense. Each of us will be able to extend our lives by at least a few thousand years!” someone among the remaining Emperors shouted.","There was no need for anyone to shout. Everyone knew that it was time to fight to the death. After this battle, if they lost, they would die. If they won, it would be completely different. They could seize the Emperor essence of a young Emperor like Chu Yunfan and extend their lives by at least thousands of years.","Chu Yunfan was much stronger than Emperor Evil.","At this moment, Emperor Elements’ body burst out with dazzling light. The Elements Divine Mountain flew out as five different colored divine mountains and pressed down on Chu Yunfan.","Emperor Elements tried to suppress Chu Yunfan, or at least suppress the Mountain River Diagram, so that Chu Yunfan could not use his full strength.","In this turmoil, there was Chaos everywhere, and only Emperors could enter and exit freely.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at them. The blood and energy in his body surged like a vast ocean and swept out, shaking the Elements Divine Mountain away. At the same time, he used the Mountain River Diagram to stop the attacks of the others.","Chu Yunfan headed straight for Emperor Elements.","Chu Yunfan stepped forward and entered the Chaos. At this moment, his entire body was emitting golden light. He looked solemn as if he was a living god.","However, his hands did not stop. He threw a backhand punch.","Boom!","This punch shook the heavens and the earth, and it landed directly in front of Emperor Elements.","This punch contained Chu Yunfan’s powerful fist intent. It surpassed the universe and shattered the Elements Divine Mountain.","The Elements Divine Mountain, which had once suppressed Emperor Evil, was shattered by Chu Yunfan’s punch.","Spurt!","Emperor Elements suffered a backlash and spat out a mouthful of blood. Shock flashed through his eyes as if he was asking what kind of monster this was to be so terrifying.","Chu Yunfan was actually able to shatter his Emperor artifact with his bare hands.","Ever since Emperor Elements had mastered the Elements Divine Mountain, he had never been in such a miserable state, even when he was fighting against the Emperor artifact of other Emperors.","Chu Yunfan’s might could be seen from this.","Emperor Elements finally understood that Chu Yunfan was indeed a scourge. The best way was to attack Chu Yunfan when he had just attained Dao. At that time, he might have a chance of winning.","But now, by the time they had made up their minds, Chu Yunfan was already so powerful that they could not compete with him.","Chu Yunfan did not show any mercy. He held the Evil God Spear in one hand and stabbed out.","Emperor Elements had clearly seen how terrifying this spear was. Two Emperors had died to this spear.","They had seen the Evil God Spear when they had surrounded Emperor Evil, but they didn’t think it was a threat. After all, the four of them had four Emperor artifacts.","No matter how powerful the Evil God Spear was, it couldn’t face four Emperor weapons at the same time.","Now, Chu Yunfan was facing a situation even worse than Emperor Evil’s.","However, the terrifying power of the Evil God Spear in Chu Yunfan’s hand was even more shocking. It was simply a world-shaking change.","The Evil God Spear hadn’t changed much. It was just that its owner had changed, yet there was such a huge difference. People were the foundation of everything.","Emperor Elements hastily retreated. In front of him, the laws of metal, wood, water, fire, and earth turned into layers of barriers and restrictions, trying to block Chu Yunfan’s Evil God Spear.","However, all of this was useless. The Evil God Spear directly pierced through all of his restrictions like it was piercing through paper. Then, it pierced through Emperor Elements.","All of this took a long time to describe, but in fact, it happened in an instant. Everyone saw Chu Yunfan casually pierce through Emperor Elements with his spear.","Emperor Elements had already suffered a backlash from the explosion of the Elements Divine Mountain. At this time, how could he resist? He was stabbed on the spot. His body could not withstand such a terrifying power and exploded on the spot.","Countless colorful elements law instantly exploded from his flesh like fireworks.","It looked incomparably gorgeous."]},{"number":2547,"title":"Chapter 2547: Emperor Solar and Emperor Lunar’s Pincer Attack","paragraphs":["Chapter 2547: Emperor Solar and Emperor Lunar’s Pincer Attack","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Emperor Elements was pierced by the spear, and his body cracked. His primordial spirit was nailed into the chaos. After a miserable cry, he was turned into nothingness.","The scream shook the entire world.","Many people even had an indescribable feeling. It turned out that Emperors, who were high and mighty like living gods, were also afraid of death.","They would still scream when they were stabbed.","They were living beings, not gods!","Many of the half-Emperors under Emperor Elements were crying. Their biggest backer was gone. At the same time, they felt lucky.","Without Emperor Elements, their future path would not be cut off.","Many Emperors looked at Chu Yunfan with complicated expressions. At this time, Chu Yunfan had already killed more than half of the eight Emperors.","That terrifying technique shocked them.","Even if some of them became Emperors one day, they would probably not be Chu Yunfan’s match.","Although Chu Yunfan’s opponents were all aging Emperors, it was not a problem for them to maintain their peak condition for a short period of time.","In other words, Chu Yunfan was facing Emperors who were at their peak, and he would defeat them when they were at their strongest.","They did not use delaying tactics like many people thought. They did not drag them out bit by bit.","This was also the only chance of Chu Yunfan’s victory that many people had originally imagined.","Chu Yunfan’s youth was his greatest asset. If he fought at his peak, Chu Yunfan could fight ten times longer than them.","After fighting for a few days and nights, he would slowly grind them to death.","Of course, the premise was that Chu Yunfan wasn’t killed on the spot, and that he could withstand the most terrifying attacks.","However, Chu Yunfan had given them a hard slap in the face. Chu Yunfan did not use the method they thought of at all. Instead, he used violence against violence, and a needle against a wheat.","He would use the most powerful method to blow up the Emperors one by one and establish his supreme reputation.","After this battle, Chu Yunfan would very likely become the strongest person in history.","Among the Emperors, he was the only one who had a clear record of defeating ten Emperors.","While everyone’s thoughts were wandering, the battle in the chaos was not over. They knew that this might be their last battle and they had no other choice.","Even though Chu Yunfan had killed more than half of them, none of them fled.","At that moment, a huge hole was directly torn open in the space where the Mountain River Diagram was frozen.","A man and a woman entered the Mountain River Diagram.","The man and woman were middle-aged, and the man’s body emitted a terrifying power of extreme Yang. On the other side of the power, the woman was about 18 or 19 years old. She looked extremely beautiful, and her body was emitting a kind of extreme Yin and soft power.","“Emperor Solar, Emperor Lunar!”","The two people who broke through the defense of Chu Yunfan’s Mountain River Diagram were none other than the two legendary Emperors, Emperor Solar and Emperor Lunar.","Chu Yunfan had seen these two Emperors in the Alchemy Emperor’s memories. In ancient times, these two Emperors were very famous.","It was said that the two of them were husband and wife and had become famous very early on. Moreover, they had always advanced and retreated together. One of them cultivated the laws of Yang, while the other cultivated the laws of Yin. In the end, they both vindicated their Dao.","Before them, no one had been able to successfully cultivate the legendary Great Dao of Yin and Yang. No matter how hard they cultivated, they could not break through to become an Emperor.","Only after they did everyone understand the so-called principle that Yin alone does not grow, and Yang alone does not grow.","Only when Yin and Yang were fused could the two types of Yin and Yang promote each other and become Emperors together.","It was impossible to attain Dao by cultivating only one law.","Since then, the couple had ruled the world for more than ten thousand years. Because they were husband and wife and their combat strength was equally shocking, even the Emperors avoided them when they ruled.","After all, the Emperors were mostly alone, but there were two of them, Emperor Solar and Emperor Lunar. How could they compete with them?","Chu Yunfan wasn’t afraid of this couple. He used the Mountain River Diagram to stop the other two Emperors.","Of course, he also knew that he couldn’t stop the other two Emperors for long. After all, they were Emperors.","However, it was enough to stop them for a short period of time.","After killing this couple, the remaining two would be much simpler. It could be said that the overall situation was set.","“Chu Yunfan, you’ve gone back on your word. Now is the time to end you!” Emperor Lunar said. Her voice was crisp and pleasant to the ear, but her tone contained an astonishing killing intent.","Seeing Chu Yunfan kill so many Emperors, even the invincible and fearless Emperor Lunar and Emperor Solar felt some fear.","“It’s actually Emperor Lunar and Emperor Solar. The two of them have not joined hands for many years. Now that they have joined hands because of Emperor Chu, I’m afraid Emperor Chu is in big trouble!”","Many of the half-Emperors present recognized the couple. Many people couldn’t help but worry. Although Chu Yunfan was very powerful, could he really defeat the couple who had never failed?","Many half-Emperors were afraid that Chu Yunfan wouldn’t be able to hold out.","Especially since there were two other Emperors eyeing him covetously. Even if Chu Yunfan could defeat them one by one, there was not much time left for him.","“Cut the crap. The two of you were also very famous in the ancient times, but now you have actually fallen to such a state. I am really very disappointed in you!” Chu Yunfan shook his head. “You can transcend Yin and Yang, but you can’t transcend life and death!”","Emperor Lunar and Emperor Solar looked at each other and immediately decided not to talk nonsense with Chu Yunfan.","The two of them, one Yin and one Yang, attacked Chu Yunfan from the left and right.","In an instant, a vast and ancient aura erupted.","The two of them had become famous a long time ago. Probably among the current Emperors, there was no one older than them. Their cultivation techniques even carried some characteristics of the immemorial era.","It was an extremely violent and disorderly aura.","The transition between Yin and Yang actually gave off a feeling that the world had changed.","The two of them attacked directly. They did not use any martial arts moves, but directly suppressed Chu Yunfan with their comprehension of martial arts.","If the two of them joined forces, an ordinary Emperor would be heavily injured on the spot if they were not careful. It was even very likely that they would die directly.","This attack had no pattern at all, and there were no traces to speak of. It had basically reached the Emperor Stage."]},{"number":2548,"title":"Chapter 2548: Peak Combat Power, Extremely Brutal","paragraphs":["Chapter 2548: Peak Combat Power, Extremely Brutal","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The move was simple, but its power was extremely shocking. Every move was an attack of the Great Dao, traceless and boundless.","It struck down on the spot, crushing everything!","Even ordinary Emperors would find it hard to withstand this move.","A terrifying power of lightning surged around Chu Yunfan’s body, resisting the laws of Yin and Yang with the power of lightning.","The collision of laws instantly shook the world!","There are 3,000 Great Daos, and each of them can bring one to the heights of an Emperor.","However, among the 3,000 Great Dao, there were also strong and weak ones. Since ancient times, it had been extremely difficult to comprehend the Dao of Yin and Yang. However, once one succeeded in cultivating it, they would be outstanding among many Emperors.","The combined strength of Emperor Solar and Emperor Lunar was naturally invincible.","However, the thunder law was also famous for being powerful among the many laws.","Cultivators who had succeeded in cultivating the thunder law were all world-renowned experts.","Three completely different laws collided together, forming an earth-shattering force that directly disturbed the chaos.","The two sides were actually evenly matched.","What shocked Emperor Solar and Emperor Lunar was that Chu Yunfan could actually resist their combined attack.","At this moment, they finally understood why the others were so vulnerable in front of Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan was too strong, so strong that it was unimaginable!","The two of them looked at each other. They didn’t know how Chu Yunfan cultivated. How could he be so terrifying? He was simply a super monster.","Chu Yunfan had only been a Emperor for a hundred years, but he had already grown to such a level that even the two of them could only be on par with him.","“You’re really a scourge. I didn’t expect you to grow to this extent!” Emperor Solar and Emperor Lunar said in unison.","To the two of them, they didn’t know Chu Yunfan at all. They only felt that this guy had appeared out of nowhere and suddenly became an Emperor.","There were no signs at all.","Especially during that period of time, Emperor Solar and Emperor Lunar were both in a deep sleep. They only woke up when the four Emperors joined forces to attack Emperor Evil.","Not long after that, they fell into a deep sleep again.","But they didn’t expect that Chu Yunfan would suddenly become an Emperor not long after he sealed himself and fell asleep.","It was a miracle.","They had almost no understanding of Chu Yunfan. They had been in the process of understanding him for the past hundred years.","However, after the real battle, thewy realized that the information they had gathered before Chu Yunfan became an Emperor and during the battle with Emperor Magus was now a huge joke.","Because it was useless!","“I didn’t expect you to be able to fight to a draw with us. You have the capital to be arrogant. However, this world is not for you to be arrogant!” Emperor Solar said coldly.","“A draw? Who gave you that wrong impression?” Chu Yunfan burst into laughter.","“Just now, you used all your strength and only managed to fight to a draw with the two of us. Do you think you still have a chance of winning?” Emperor Lunar said.","“My full strength? Have you seen me at my full strength?” Chu Yunfan burst into laughter. “I’ve made a lot of preparations for today’s battle. Since you all want to see my full strength, I’ll show you my full strength!”","Boom!","An even more terrifying aura was released from Chu Yunfan’s body, shaking the entire chaos. Even the chaos was shaking because of the terrifying energy and blood released by Chu Yunfan.","Compared to Chu Yunfan just now, Chu Yunfan was clearly more than twice as powerful.","Previously, he had only used the thunder law comprehended by the Thunderclap Physique, but his physique was not just the Thunderclap Physique.","He also had the constitution of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix, the Imperial Physique, and so on. Only when all of them were fused together would Chu Yunfan’s true strength be revealed.","At the same time, the Brahma Tree evolved and transformed into battle armor that enveloped his entire body.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan’s aura reached its peak!","Emperor Solar and Emperor Lunar looked extremely solemn as if they had seen the most unbelievable existence.","Chu Yunfan looked too strong and terrifying at this moment!","The terrifying aura pressed down on their bodies, almost suffocating them and making them feel despair.","In an instant, the chaos boiled, and Chu Yunfan made his move!","He struck out with his palm. In an instant, the palm transformed into a huge star. The star smashed down and shattered everything.","Flying Celestial Palm Strike!","This top-notch martial art created by the Flying Celestials’ founder could be said to have turned something rotten into something magical in Chu Yunfan’s hands. It had reached a height that even the founder could not imagine.","In almost an instant, the terrifying domain formed by the joint efforts of Emperor Lunar and the Solar Emperor was defeated.","Bam!","A loud bang came from the chaos. Emperor Lunar and the Solar Emperor were sent flying, coughing up blood.","Just a moment ago, they were able to fight Chu Yunfan on equal footing, but now, they were immediately defeated by Chu Yunfan.","They finally understood the meaning behind Chu Yunfan’s words.","Chu Yunfan was at his peak in this state, and he was truly using his full strength.","The attack had severely injured Emperor Solar and Emperor Lunar. Such violent combat strength had suppressed the other two Emperors in the chaos. At the same time, it had also frightened the other half-Emperors in the Ancient Realm.","Chu Yunfan’s combat strength was too brutal. Even Emperor Solar and Emperor Lunar, who could work together as husband and wife, could not fight back when facing Chu Yunfan. This was very clear.","Chu Yunfan took a step forward, and in an instant, he had already rushed in front of Emperor Solar and Emperor Lunar. Their domains were instantly torn apart, and they could not stop Chu Yunfan from rushing in.","The domain of the two were a fusion of Yin and Yang, turning into a huge Yin-Yang Eight Trigrams.","However, at this moment, Chu Yunfan tore it apart.","In an instant, Chu Yunfan had already rushed in front of the two of them.","Flying Celestial Palm Strike!","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","In an instant, Chu Yunfan sent out thousands of terrifying Flying Celestial Palm Strikes. Countless stars almost filled the entire chaos.","Chu Yunfan could use this move, which required him to exhaust all his energy, thousands of times in an instant.","Rumble!","The terrifying explosion shook the chaotic energy and sent the two figures back into the Ancient Realm.","Everyone saw that it was just Emperor Lunar and Emperor Solar.","However, their bodies were covered in injuries.","In the series of collisions just now, they were almost killed."]},{"number":2549,"title":"Chapter 2549: Strength Soars","paragraphs":["Chapter 2549: Strength Soars","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In an instant, the two sides had already exchanged thousands of blows!","Emperor Solar and Emperor Lunar were in an extremely sorry state. Emperor Solar had lost one of his legs, and Emperor Lunar had lost her entire arm.","At this moment, they were heavily injured and had suffered a great loss at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","Chu Yunfan was too strong. He was so strong that even Emperor Solar and Emperor Lunar couldn’t do anything to him. They were even severely injured by him.","The two Emperors were forced out, but they didn’t hesitate to burn their blood essence.","They were already in their later years, but at the same time, their auras had also risen to the extreme.","Their broken arms and legs also grew back. They panted heavily, and from the chaos, a figure walked out.","The other two Emperors were trapped in the chaos by the Mountain River Diagram, unable to break free for a moment.","The terrifying scene of Chu Yunfan suppressing all the Emperors by himself was deeply imprinted in the hearts of many half-Emperors. They never thought that they would be able to see such a shocking scene in their lifetime.","Among the Emperors, any one of them was a terrifying existence that had traversed a long history and survived from ancient times to the present.","But now, he had been beaten to such a miserable state by Chu Yunfan.","“Do you still think you’ve seen my full strength?” Chu Yunfan glanced at Emperor Solar and Emperor Lunar.","Any one of them possessed unimaginable strength. Even if an ordinary Emperor had attained Dao, they would not be a match for these two.","Moreover, when the two of them joined forces, they were almost invincible. Even in ancient times, they were invincible!","“You actually inherited the Emperor Supreme’s legacy. No wonder, no wonder!” Emperor Solar said as he looked at Chu Yunfan with a complicated expression.","In the fight just now, he finally saw through Chu Yunfan’s background.","Even in ancient times, the Emperor Supreme was a freak among the many Emperors.","One against many was a basic operation.","Among the Emperors, he was an unprecedented terrifying existence.","Chu Yunfan had inherited the teachings of the Emperor Supreme. No wonder he was so terrifying.","Chu Yunfan wasn’t surprised. The Emperor Supreme was so famous in the ancient times that even the Alchemy Emperor had his existence in his memories. It wasn’t strange for Emperor Solar to see through him.","Chu Yunfan did not hide it. In fact, he did not need to hide it. With his current cultivation, there was indeed no need to hide it.","He was invincible throughout the world!","“But with the Emperor Supreme’s cultivation, you’ve walked very far in the path of Emperors. You actually avoided his path and used his inheritance as a foundation to walk your own path. You are indeed a genius!” Emperor Lunar said.","As an Emperor herself, Emperor Lunar knew best what it meant to be able to suppress thousands of paths. All the paths led to Rome, and all the paths could prove that one was an Emperor. However, if someone took this path, then the future generations would not be able to take it.","How many experts did they have under them?","For so many years, there were at least 800 half-Emperors under each Emperor. They were born one after another and died one after another. Some of them might even have thousands of disciples.","However, none of them could escape their influence and become Emperors. The existing Emperors relied on this method to control the birth of future Emperors.","They had nothing to hide from their own disciples. On the contrary, it was those itinerant cultivators who were the ones who threatened them.","Of course, it was very difficult for an itinerant cultivator to reach the half-Emperor Stage on their own. It was even rarer for an itinerant cultivator to reach the peak of the half-Emperor Stage and become an Emperor.","Without self-sealing methods, ordinary people might not see a top expert among itinerant cultivators for tens of thousands of years.","However, Chu Yunfan’s appearance broke this balance. He had a foothold, but he had created his own path as if he had never been affected.","She didn’t know that Chu Yunfan not only had the inheritance of the Emperor Supreme’s legacy, but also the memories of the Alchemy Emperor.","Chu Yunfan was quite clear about the traps involved.","Naturally, he could easily avoid them. Most importantly, he had always been accompanied by the godhead, so he could avoid the traps and walk out of another path.","From a long time ago, Chu Yunfan already understood that he couldn’t become the next Alchemy Emperor or the next Emperor Supreme.","He was him, the invincible Emperor Chu!","“Back then, the Emperor Supreme was like you, wanting to walk an unprecedented path to immortality. However, he died and even triggered the Ancient Tribulation, destroying the antiquity era. Do you want to go against the heavens now?” Emperor Lunar said slowly.","“He is him, and I am me. Though he couldn’t walk the path, I might be able to,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently.","He didn’t think that those ancient mighty figures were more powerful than the current cultivators.","Even those Emperors who had become famous in ancient times might not be stronger than the people of later generations before they became Emperors.","Those who hadn’t become Emperors in the future might be even more powerful than those Emperors when they were at the peak of the half-Emperor Stage.","For example, before Chu Yunfan attained Dao, he was already strong enough to crush a group of Emperors.","He did not have any feelings of worship toward those people from the ancient times. Therefore, even though the Emperor Supreme had failed, it did not affect his pursuit of a higher path.","“You’re saying so much just to buy time for your recovery!” Chu Yunfan said lightly, “But now, do you think all of this is still meaningful?”","“It’s meaningless!” Chu Yunfan said lightly. “Do you think you can win by stalling for time?”","Chu Yunfan saw through their plan, but he didn’t care. Although he was a little worried about the other two Emperors trapped in the chaos by the Mountain River Diagram, it didn’t mean that he was afraid of them working together.","He was just afraid that they would run away when Chu Yunfan was too busy.","Chu Yunfan was determined to get rid of all the cancers in one go!","These Emperors before him were once so illustrious, dragons and phoenixes among men, heroes of a generation that only appeared once in ten thousand years. But in the end, they still fell and became the kind of people he hated the most.","Chu Yunfan’s expression was solemn, and his strength was even more terrifying than before.","“How is this possible? How did your strength increase so much in such a short period of time?” Emperor Solar and Emperor Lunar looked at Chu Yunfan’s strength in shock. He was at least twice as strong as when they had just fought.","At Chu Yunfan’s level of cultivation, even a slight increase was already incredible, let alone doubling it.","“You refined their Dao?” Emperor Solar immediately realized something terrifying."]},{"number":2550,"title":"Chapter 2550: One Dao Merges Ten Thousand Daos","paragraphs":["Chapter 2550: One Dao Merges Ten Thousand Daos","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Emperor Solar immediately realized what Chu Yunfan was doing. While they were trying to delay Chu Yunfan, Chu Yunfan was also delaying them.","In that short period of time, Chu Yunfan had directly devoured the Great Dao of the Emperors he had defeated and killed.","Completely devouring them and adding them to his Great Dao!","And now, Chu Yunfan’s true Dao was finally revealed.","At the thought of this, the expressions of Emperor Solar and Emperor Lunar changed. At this moment, they understood why Chu Yunfan was different from the other Emperors.","The Emperors rejected other Daos, and one Dao suppressed all Daos. Therefore, after a mighty figure achieved Dao, others would not be able to achieve Dao.","Even in ancient times!","Only when this person ruled for a certain period of time and began to enter middle age would he consider his own lifespan and begin to seal himself.","Only then would an Emperor’s Dao gradually disappear from the world, and only then would others have the opportunity to vindicate their Dao.","It was precisely because of this reason that they would work together in tacit understanding to prevent future generations from attaining Dao.","Because the Emperor path was too overbearing. Every Emperor was an invincible existence that could defeat anyone in the world. Only by defeating all the elites and experts of the same generation could they be qualified to attack the final Emperor path.","These people had all attained Dao from mountains of corpses and seas of blood. Their strength was naturally extremely terrifying.","At the same time, because these people had defeated all their competitors in the world, they had developed an extremely domineering confidence. This domineering confidence made them reject all Dao.","Other than themselves, everyone else was an outsider!","They were the only one in the world!","There were many Emperors who had such thoughts!","And Chu Yunfan’s Dao was one that fused with ten thousand Daos!","With his Dao, he had fused all the Daos in the world. This was another unprecedented and terrifying Great Dao. All the Daos were the resources for Chu Yunfan to advance!","At this moment, they all understood that it was no wonder Chu Yunfan was not stingy to help others become Emperors. When they became Emperors, their Dao would support Chu Yunfan’s Dao.","In fact, the stronger, more, and richer their Dao was, the more thorough Chu Yunfan’s transformation would be.","In the end, he would become a God that truly surpassed the Emperors and would be sought after by countless people!","Boom!","It was as if a clap of thunder had exploded in their minds. At this moment, they finally understood that they were probably wrong.","In order to become a God, they all rejected others. However, their Dao was also the Dao of Emperors, and they were on equal footing with other Emperors. Perhaps there was a difference in their strength, but in terms of Great Dao, there was no difference.","How could one of the Great Daos surpass the other Daos and make one a God?","What a joke!","But this time was different. Chu Yunfan wanted to absorb all the Dao and use everyone’s Dao to perfect his own Dao. The stronger the others were, the stronger he would be.","Chu Yunfan’s combat strength had increased by leaps and bounds in just a hundred years. Of course, it was because he had absorbed the Dao of the two Emperors—Emperor Evil and Emperor Magus. In addition, after he taught the Dao, countless people had cultivated and formed their own Dao.","It was as if countless nutrients were nourishing him.","“What arrogance!” Emperor Solar said, “There has never been an Emperor as ambitious as you. However, no matter what you plan to do, you plan to use us as nourishment to achieve your Dao. That won’t do. Even if we are not your match, you can forget about manipulating us!”","Emperor Solar realized Chu Yunfan’s unprecedented plan. This plan was unprecedented, and this ambition was also unprecedented.","It even made him feel a little hot-blooded in his heart. It was a long-lost hot-blooded feeling.","This reminded him of how high-spirited he was back then.","But no matter what, Chu Yunfan could forget about using him as nourishment. As an Emperor, he still had this basic confidence.","“You overestimate yourself!” Chu Yunfan glanced at Emperor Solar and took a step forward.","With just a simple tap of his finger, Emperor Solar saw a flower of the Great Dao burst out from Chu Yunfan’s fingertip. It was a flower formed by the laws of the Great Dao, and many Great Daos could be seen merging into one.","In front of this flower of the Great Dao, Emperor Solar’s body instantly spurted out blood. His chest was pierced through.","Blood spurted out.","The blood and energy that he had been barely able to raise was severely injured in front of this finger.","Emperor Solar was declining at an astonishing speed.","Chu Yunfan was terrifying. In the time it took for him to speak, his strength had undergone an earth-shattering change.","It was terrifying. Emperor Solar was like a huge balloon. After being poked by Chu Yunfan, he began to leak air and instantly turned into a dried corpse. Chu Yunfan grabbed him.","The group of half-Emperors certainly didn’t think that Emperor Solar was too weak. After being able to dominate the world for so many years, how could Emperor Solar be weak?","Who was truly terrifying was Chu Yunfan. That single finger had crippled Emperor Solar and triggered the Five Declines of Life in advance. In an instant, Emperor Solar, who was at his peak, had died.","Reversal of cause and effect again!","Originally, Chu Yunfan needed the help of the Evil God Spear to be able to use the method of reversing cause and effect. Now, he could casually use it. It could be seen how much Chu Yunfan’s strength had increased.","First, Emperor Solar was determined to undergone the Five Declines. With this result, Emperor Solar would not be able to escape the Five Declines no matter what.","It was a method of causality that could even force an Emperor into it!","“Hurry up and leave!”","Before Emperor Solar died, he only had time to say this to Emperor Lunar.","At this moment, Emperor Lunar also felt danger and immediately retreated. Her situation was similar to Emperor Solar’s. Her strength was not much different from Emperor Solar’s, and it was impossible for her to be stronger.","Even Emperor Solar had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands, let alone her.","Emperor Lunar couldn’t be bothered to grieve for her husband and hurriedly fled.","However, she couldn’t outrun Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan pointed out from behind, but he was also so casual as if he had just casually pointed out the result.","It hit Emperor Lunar as expected.","It was another reversal of cause and effect!","Emperor Lunar was hit, and she was no different from Emperor Solar. In an instant, all her energy and blood spurted out, and she turned into a dried corpse, dying of the Five Declines.","After Chu Yunfan had done all this, his forehead was wrapped with some bad karma. He had used the causality law, so it was impossible for him to not pay a price.","He had anticipated this effect, but he had to bear this cause. In fact, he was the one bearing the cause. However, the external manifestation was a very strange appearance and appearance. This price would directly appear on his body.","However, with Chu Yunfan’s current strength, this was of course nothing. With a shake of his body, the bad karma disappeared without a trace."]},{"number":2551,"title":"Chapter 2551: All the Emperors Are Extinguished, a New Era Arrives","paragraphs":["Chapter 2551: All the Emperors Are Extinguished, a New Era Arrives","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After his strength doubled again, Chu Yunfan could withstand even more severe backlash. However, the use of this kind of causality technique usually would not directly reflect, but would consume his karma.","To make a person start to have bad karma!","However, Chu Yunfan’s karma was strong enough to withstand the backlash from killing the two Emperors.","At this moment, the chaos was boiling. The Mountain River Diagram flew out and returned to Chu Yunfan’s head.","Two figures rushed out from the chaos.","They were the last two Emperors of the eight Emperors.","In order to break through Chu Yunfan’s Mountain River Diagram, they had used countless methods.","It was not easy for them to break through the seal of the Mountain River Diagram in the shortest time possible. However, they were still too late, even though they were only blocked by the Mountain River Diagram for a small portion of the time.","However, it did not stop Chu Yunfan from taking care of the two great experts, Emperor Lunar and Emperor Solar, in such a short period of time.","The two Emperors rushed out of the chaos and appeared above Dao Haven City. They watched in confusion as Chu Yunfan put the body of Emperor Lunar into the Mountain River Diagram.","They couldn’t believe that Chu Yunfan had killed Emperor Solar and Emperor Lunar so easily.","At this moment, their expressions changed, and they felt a chill run down their spines.","The arrival of the eight Emperors was so powerful that they felt that they had absolute strength and confidence even when facing a powerful rising star like Chu Yunfan.","But now, only the two of them were left from the eight Emperors.","It could be said that of the ten Emperors who had swept across the world back then, other than Emperor Evil, seven of them had died in front of Chu Yunfan.","He was truly an Emperor terminator!","“It’s your turn now, Emperor Demon, Emperor Poison!”","Chu Yunfan looked at the two of them. One of them looked middle-aged and emitted a shocking demonic aura. He was none other than the legendary Emperor Demon who ruled the Demon Realm.","Back then, Chu Yunfan had led the Central Plains to engage in a shocking confrontation with the Demon Realm. However, at that time, Emperor Demon was no longer in the Demon Realm. Instead, he had established the demons in the Ancient Realm.","He had become one of the top ten Emperors in the Ancient Realm.","In Emperor Demon’s eyes, the battle between the Demon Realm and the Central Plains was not worth mentioning at all. It was not even worth his attention.","The Central Plains was only one of the worlds that the Demon Realm had invaded and targeted.","Even if the Demon Realm was completely wiped out, it would be harmless to Emperor Demon. It would not hurt his vitality at all.","To him, the Demon Realm was just a reserve base for him to send talents and continuously strengthen the demon race.","Even if it was gone, it could be rebuilt!","Even when Chu Yunfan killed King Purple-Robe Demon and the others, he did not wake Emperor Demon up from his self-sealing slumber.","But now, Emperor Demon had no choice but to face Chu Yunfan, who had risen from the Central Plains. This was a fated confrontation.","A battle that was destined to happen!","This powerful demon lord, who was competing with humans in the myriad worlds, was staring at Chu Yunfan.","Beside him was a gloomy old man whose body was wrapped in poison.","The poison around him was a poison evolved from a law. Even space was crushed by the poison. It was extremely terrifying.","He had already reached an unprecedented level in the use of poison. No one had ever done it before, and no one would ever do it again.","Both sides exchanged a glance, and a great battle erupted in an instant!","Both sides knew that there was no room for relief. It could only be life and death!","At this point, even the remaining two Emperors didn’t think that Chu Yunfan would let them go when he had the upper hand. Therefore, they could only fight a bloody battle.","Boom!","Terrifying laws shook the void. Chu Yunfan tore open the void again, sending the battlefield back into chaos. The Ancient Realm could not withstand such a torment.","Everyone could see Chu Yunfan’s body glowing in the chaos on the other side of the crack. The light was not ordinary light, but the light evolved from the laws.","Flowers formed by the Great Dao were everywhere, stabilizing Chaos. They also turned into torrents that bombarded Emperor Demon and Emperor Poison.","Emperor Demon let out a long roar and transformed into a terrifying demon lord that was millions of miles tall in the chaos.","This terrifying demon lord kicked up a torrential tide of chaos and then swept it toward Chu Yunfan.","On the other side, the laws of poison around Emperor Poison evolved and turned into monstrous waves that swept toward Chu Yunfan.","Even other Emperors did not dare to underestimate this poison as they would be corroded by it.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t care at all. He ignored the poison and rushed into the sea of poison with a rainbow light shining all over his body. His body continued to swell with the wind. In an instant, he grew to the same size as Emperor Demon.","Emperor Demon roared, and the chaos trembled. Then, he punched at Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan didn’t move. He just pointed out with one finger.","Bam!","Emperor Demon’s huge fist exploded in the air. It was no match for Chu Yunfan’s finger.","Immediately after, the crack spread along the arm and into his body.","Boom!","Emperor Demon was terrified to find that his body was cracking inch by inch. He could not stop it at all. He activated all his Great Dao to try to stop it, but it was useless.","Chu Yunfan’s finger had astonishing power. It was the manifestation of the Great Dao. Emperor Demon could not withstand a simple finger attack.","After absorbing the Great Dao of many Emperors, Chu Yunfan’s strength was obviously stronger, and it was not just a little bit stronger.","“Ah!” Emperor Demon screamed as his body exploded on the spot, revealing his primordial spirit. There was actually a big hole on his originally powerful primordial spirit.","Chu Yunfan’s finger had pierced through his primordial spirit. It had not only pierced through his physical body, but also his primordial spirit.","His physical body exploded, the sky collapsed, the earth cracked, and the mountains shook!","After Emperor Demon died, his body was taken away by Chu Yunfan, and his Great Dao was absorbed by him. Chu Yunfan became stronger and stronger, and it didn’t take him a moment to absorb an Emperor’s Great Dao.","Chu Yunfan turned to look at Emperor Poison. At this moment, Emperor Poison was nothing in his eyes. The poison path that Emperor Poison was most proficient in was nothing in front of Chu Yunfan.","Emperor Poison could not do anything to Chu Yunfan at all. Even if Chu Yunfan ran amok in his poison sea, there would be no problem at all.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at him. He slapped Emperor Poison, who was ranked last among the Ten Great Emperors, into a bloody mist, and the latter died on the spot."]},{"number":2552,"title":"Chapter 2552: Reorganizing the Ascension System of the Myriad Worlds","paragraphs":["Chapter 2552: Reorganizing the Ascension System of the Myriad Worlds","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was silent. Chu Yunfan slowly walked out of the spatial rift.","The spatial rift slowly disappeared behind Chu Yunfan, and the battlefield in the chaos finally came to an end.","There was a deathly silence.","It was over. The era of the Ten Great Emperors ruling the Ancient Realm had finally come to an end.","Since ancient times, this rule had been like a black cloud that had enveloped the entire Ancient Realm, suppressing all the geniuses and elites until they could not breathe.","During the terrifying turmoil at the end of the antiquity era, the ten Emperors stabilized the last world fragment, which was the current Ancient Realm, during the Battle of the Emperors.","It gave many people a chance to survive!","At that time, the Ten Great Emperors had all contributed to the world. However, as time went on, they became more and more degenerated. These Emperors had already become obstacles on everyone’s path of advancement.","And now, everyone’s nightmare was finally over.","There would no longer be a person completely above them and blocking their way forward.","While everyone felt relieved, they also realized that a long era that had lasted since the ancient times had finally come to an end.","A brand new era was born.","However, everyone was also worried that after Chu Yunfan eliminated the ten Emperors, he would become a brand new iron curtain that enveloped everyone’s heads.","At Chu Yunfan’s current age, it was impossible for him to die.","Fortunately, it did not turn into the worst environment that everyone had expected.","After eliminating these Emperors, Chu Yunfan’s forces began to clean up the loyal followers of the Emperors.","Many experts resented these Emperors for blocking their path forward and blocking their chance to become Emperors.","However, there were still a large number of loyal followers of the Emperors. After so many years, it was impossible for the Emperors to not have any confidants.","In fact, most of the forces were the Emperor’s confidants. Although many people recognized the situation and did not dare to continue to resist Chu Yunfan.","After all, even the Emperors who they thought were gods had died in Chu Yunfan’s hands, let alone them. Their resistance was meaningless to Chu Yunfan.","However, there were still many people who were determined to die, and these were the targets of the experts who had already joined Chu Yunfan.","At the same time, after the Emperors died, their own worlds also collapsed. The countless resources inside were all taken away by Chu Yunfan, and the unformed worlds were also taken away by Chu Yunfan.","This battle lasted for more than a hundred years before the order of the Ancient Realm was re-established.","A new order of the Ancient Realm with Dao Haven City as the absolute core was established.","Under this order, Dao Haven, which was guarded by Dao Lord Emperor Chu, was the absolute core. There were also various factions that were dependent on Dao Haven as branches. This kind of power spread throughout the entire universe.","It was not just the Ancient Realm!","This was because the Ancient Realm was the true core of the current universe. Cultivators who had successfully cultivated in the universe would eventually return to the Ancient Realm.","It was just that the Emperors did not want other Emperors to appear, so they did not do a good job in guiding the various worlds.","There was no guidance at all, nor was there a complete system.","However, after Chu Yunfan ascended the throne, he began to plan the entire universe. Each world and planet was divided into categories according to the technology side and the cultivation side.","It was possible for experts to appear in the field of science and technology. In the past 100 years, in the process of cleaning up the entire universe, Chu Yunfan had seen experts in the field of science and technology that he had never seen before.","However, unlike ordinary cultivators, the experts in the field of science and technology focused on the development of science and technology. After the development of life science reached the extreme, it would be reflected on the individual.","The overall quality was very high, not inferior to the world of cultivation. Of course, this could only be achieved if technology was developed to a very high level.","There were even some technological planets that could come into contact with the cultivation world that had a large number of dual-cultivation situations, just like Earth and the Kunlun Realm.","These powerful civilizations ruled the vast and boundless world, and the way they used energy was even more brilliant than the cultivation side.","There were even half-Emperors among them, but that was already the limit. They were still incomparable to the core of the myriad worlds like the Ancient Realm.","In the end, it was still suppressed and incorporated into the system of the myriad worlds planned by Chu Yunfan.","The current cultivation system of the entire universe seemed too chaotic to Chu Yunfan. After many cultivators in the world cultivated to the extreme, there was no way for them to advance further.","Just like the Central Plains, some of them simply didn’t know of the existence of the higher level Ancient Realm.","Under Chu Yunfan’s arrangement, the different worlds were divided into nine levels according to their strength. Each level of the world could be guided to a higher world after cultivating to the extreme.","Moreover, Chu Yunfan also established a welcoming envoy, which was directly led by the disciples of the Ancient Realm’s Dao Haven. Their strength far exceeded the strength of the other worlds, and they did not interfere with the development of other worlds. They only continued to guide stronger experts to stronger worlds.","The last level nine world was, of course, the Ancient Realm!","This way, through layers of screening, they would continuously obtain talent from the myriad worlds and not just rely on the cultivation of the Ancient Realm itself.","The number of talents born might be ten times or even a hundred times more than the original.","Although the starting point of many experts who grew up in the myriad worlds was not high, those who could climb out of each world were often the best among the best. They even surpassed the experts nurtured in the Ancient Realm.","In the past, there were also such experts. For example, Chu Yunfan and King Hatred Monster were born from the myriad worlds. In the end, they relied on their own geniuses to kill their way through the Ancient Realm and reach the top.","Although King Hatred Monster hadn’t been as powerful as Chu Yunfan, when he first appeared in the Ancient Realm, he had shocked an entire era.","There were still many such experts, but compared to the geniuses born in the countless worlds, they were rare.","Many people died of old age in their own world because they could not get the opportunity to go to a higher level world.","The Emperors did not care about this. It was good to have them, but it did not matter if they did not. After all, the geniuses born in the Ancient Realm were enough for them to command.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. The great cause he wanted to establish was incomparably huge. He needed everyone in the myriad worlds to work hard together."]},{"number":2553,"title":"Chapter 2553: Dao Lord Emperor Chu, the Number One Emperor Since Ancient Times","paragraphs":["Chapter 2553: Dao Lord Emperor Chu, the Number One Emperor Since Ancient Times","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Because of this, Chu Yunfan felt that the more people there were, the better.","The more geniuses there were, the better. The more geniuses there were, the stronger his strength would naturally be. His path to becoming a God in the future would also be simpler.","In the past few years, Chu Yunfan had been thinking about how to solve this problem.","It was not a matter of a day or two for him to become a God. To make up for it and even surpass the ancient times, even if he pulled the seedlings to help them grow, it would at least last for thousands of years or tens of thousands of years.","Even though there were already quite a number of talents born and raised in the Ancient Realm, the Ten Great Emperors were already satisfied.","But for Chu Yunfan, it was still too little, too little, too little!","No one knew how big of a scheme he had in mind. Probably only Tang Siyu, who was a major chess piece, knew a little.","However, after Tang Siyu had cut off her cultivation and re-cultivated, she had reached the half-Emperor Stage in just 200 years, and she was close to the sixth half-Emperor Stage.","It wouldn’t take long for her to reach the peak of the half-Emperor Stage.","Chu Yunfan didn’t think much of this. After all, Tang Siyu already had the half-Emperor Dao Fruit, plus Chu Yunfan’s guidance and almost all the resources in the Ancient Realm.","These were naturally very simple things. Although Chu Yunfan was not stingy with teaching the world, he did not really mean to treat everyone equally.","Even after one became an Emperor, there was still a distance between them.","Naturally, those who were close to him would be able to obtain benefits.","In fact, over the years, there had been many experts who had cut off their cultivation and re-cultivated. Everyone who wanted to become a Emperor had to take this step.","Before reaching the King Stage, it did not matter if their cultivation was cut off or not because the imprint of the Emperor path was not very deep. However, once they reached the King Stage, there was no other outcome other than cutting off their cultivation and re-cultivating.","Ever since Chu Yunfan had swept the world, there had been many heroes from all over the universe. For a moment, the people in the Ancient Realm felt a great threat.","In the blink of an eye, another thousand years had passed!","A thousand years had passed, but it was an unprecedented situation for the Ancient Realm. An unprecedented golden age was placed in front of everyone.","Because Chu Yunfan had eliminated the ten great Emperors, anyone could do it, and there was no need to worry about being suppressed.","In fact, Chu Yunfan could be said to be optimistic about their strength.","He would constantly promote the heroes among them!","This was a completely different style from the previous Emperors, which made the heroes of the world heave a sigh of relief!","A thousand years had passed, and everyone was looking forward to the birth of the second Emperor.","The second Emperor was finally born, and a mighty pressure swept across the world!","The entire Ancient Realm sensed it!","For a moment, the world was in an uproar. After all, this was the second Emperor besides Chu Yunfan. During this process, Chu Yunfan did not stop him. This proved that this path was open, and Chu Yunfan did not stop him.","And this newly ascended Emperor called himself Emperor Flame. He used the laws of the fire path to attain Dao, and finally, he astonishingly attained Dao.","It was only later on that everyone found out everything about Emperor Flame. He was a peerless genius among itinerant cultivators. In the past, he had been hiding from the ten great Emperors for countless years and did not dare to show himself. He had sealed himself from the distant past until now.","He had finally encountered an era where he could fully display his talents.","Now, he had attained Dao!","After Emperor Flame attained Dao, the first thing he did was to come to Dao Haven and pay his respects to Dao Lord Emperor Chu.","“Congratulations, Fellow Daoist!” Chu Yunfan sat on the cloud bed, and opposite him, Emperor Flame sat on a white cloud bed. He was a handsome middle-aged man, and his body was faintly surrounded by the light of the flame law.","“You’re too polite, Emperor Chu,” Emperor Flame said. Originally, he was somewhat pleased with himself when Chu Yunfan addressed him as a fellow Daoist.","For thousands of years, the situation in the Ancient Realm had been controlled by Chu Yunfan, and everyone in the world regarded him as a living god.","Even though Emperor Flame was much older than Chu Yunfan, he still had to look up to Chu Yunfan. Most importantly, he had the chance to escape the tragic fate of an itinerant cultivator. Since ancient times, the second person to become a Emperor was ultimately thanks to Chu Yunfan.","Even though he had attained Dao, he still respected Chu Yunfan very much. However, when he looked at Chu Yunfan, he was shocked.","He couldn’t see through Chu Yunfan at all. It was like a mortal facing the starry sky, vast and boundless.","Generally speaking, this was impossible. Chu Yunfan was an Emperor, and he was also an Emperor. Chu Yunfan had only achieved Dao more than a thousand years before him, so how could he be stronger than him?","Even if he couldn’t see through Chu Yunfan completely, he couldn’t be as clueless as he was now.","There was only one possibility—Chu Yunfan’s strength was far above his.","At the thought of this, he immediately extinguished that little thought in his heart.","“Fellow Daoist, I’m very pleased that you’re able to attain Dao. I want the world to be filled with cultivators. Fellow Daoist’s attainment of Dao undoubtedly proves that my path is feasible!” Chu Yunfan said with a smile.","He didn’t think too much about it. He was the first one to know about Emperor Flame’s path to becoming an Emperor because he had directly fed it back to the godhead. With the godhead, he had actually already comprehended Emperor Flame’s path to becoming an Emperor.","After thousands of years of cultivation, Chu Yunfan’s power had become more profound. Compared to more than a thousand years ago, he was much stronger.","Of course, Emperor Flame could not see through him. To him, it was not difficult for him to slap an Emperor like Emperor Flame who had just attained Dao.","Of course, Emperor Flame didn’t know what Chu Yunfan was thinking. He only started to discuss the Dao with Chu Yunfan after chatting for a while. Only then did Emperor Flame truly understand the power of this Dao Lord Emperor Chu, who had been famous for more than a thousand years.","No matter what he said, Chu Yunfan could immediately follow up. His understanding of the Great Dao was much deeper than his.","Even a few sentences were enough to make him see the light. After he became a Emperor, there was no future for him and he could only explore it himself. However, after discussing the Dao with Chu Yunfan for several days, he felt that he had suddenly seen the light.","Five days later, Emperor Flame left. He said to his attendants, “Dao Lord Emperor Chu is the number one Emperor in the world. Even the ancient Emperors can’t compare to him. Since there is Emperor Chu in the world, I should avoid him.”","The entire world was in an uproar. After all, both of them were Emperors. From the perspective of status, they should be equal.","However, Emperor Flame admitted that he was inferior to Chu Yunfan. In his eyes, even those ancient Emperors who ruled the world were inferior to Chu Yunfan, let alone a new Emperor like him. In fact, he even had to avoid Chu Yunfan.","His humble attitude made people speechless.","However, everyone thought that Emperor Flame had opened up an environment that was sufficient for him to achieve Dao in order to repay Chu Yunfan, all the way until the birth of the third Emperor."]},{"number":2554,"title":"Chapter 2554: Finally Becoming a God","paragraphs":["Chapter 2554: Finally Becoming a God","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The third Emperor, a monster, called himself Emperor El-Nino Monster!","With the talent of a genius among the monsters, he had attracted countless monsters to join him as soon as he formed his Dao.","This was because he was no ordinary person. Emperor El-Nino Monster was the son of Emperor Skyquake Monster, who Chu Yunfan had killed previously. He had been sealed by Emperor Skyquake Monster all this while.","He would not be born for a long time!","It was because he knew that this was the era of the ten Emperors!","However, the ten Emperors were not gods. Sooner or later, they would die of old age. In fact, even in this era, the ten Emperors were already old. In order to continue their lives, they had no choice but to kill each other.","The battle between the four Emperors and Emperor Evil shook the heavens and the earth!","It was also enough to prove that the Emperors were really old and hopeless!","Many of the geniuses had sealed themselves and waited for this opportunity, competing with the Emperor to see who could endure the longest. Of course, many of them had died in their self-seclusion.","Because no matter how much they could endure, they could not endure the Emperors. Their lifespan could not be compared to the Emperors.","As soon as Emperor El-Nino Monster attained Dao, he attracted the attention of the entire world. In particular, many of Emperor Skyquake Monster’s subordinates had fled into the starry sky of the universe and had not been completely wiped out.","There were also many who pretended to submit to Dao Haven. Chu Yunfan did not hunt them down. Even these people were valuable to him, so he naturally did not kill them.","For a time, it was a huge commotion!","In addition to Emperor Flame and Dao Lord Chu Emperor, who had attained Dao, the three countries formed a balance of power.","Of course, the strongest among them was Chu Yunfan, who had attained Dao the earliest. In addition, Chu Yunfan had preached to the world and won the hearts of the people. He could be said to be the one with the strongest aura.","However, in fact, in the eyes of the world, Chu Yunfan had not done as much as Emperor Flame. After Emperor Flame achieved Dao, he established a sect and passed down his orthodoxy. At the same time, he seized territory everywhere.","Of course, he knew his limits. He had only seized one-third of the Ancient Realm’s territory. In comparison, Chu Yunfan had not seized any territory at all. The only city that truly belonged to Chu Yunfan was Dao Haven.","As for the others, they were mostly itinerant cultivators. Although they submitted to Dao Haven, they did not have a clear subordinate relationship.","After Emperor El-Nino Monster attained the Dao and restrained his father’s power, the first thing he did was to attack Emperor Flame’s territory.","Both of them were newly ascended Emperors. This exchange was naturally earth-shattering.","These two people were the real battle of Emperors. Compared to the day when Chu Yunfan defeated the Emperors like the autumn wind sweeping away the fallen leaves, the battle between these two people was in line with everyone’s impression of the battle of Emperors.","The battle lasted for three days and three nights, and the final result was that Emperor El-Nino Monster defeated Emperor Flame with an overwhelming advantage.","With the Myriad Monster Banner left behind by Emperor Skyquake Monster, Emperor El-Nino Monster defeated Emperor Flame, who did not have an Emperor artifact to protect him.","Moreover, he had seized more than half of Emperor Flame’s territory. His arrogance was the focus of the world.","After recuperating for several years, when no one expected it, Emperor El-Nino Monster single-handedly killed his way into Dao Haven.","He did not even bring his troops of the monster race and demon race as there was no need to do so. In front of an Emperor of such a level, no army was necessary.","It was yet another great battle between Emperors, a battle between Emperor El-Nino and Dao Lord Emperor Chu.","Everyone was stunned because the battle ended too quickly!","Emperor El-Nino Monster, who had just barged into Dao Haven, was slapped by a huge hand condensed from energy in the air.","It didn’t have any special divine power, but it was a divine power that was common on the streets.","However, it was such a simple palm strike that directly hit Emperor El-Nino Monster. He screamed as his body shattered on the spot.","He turned into blood clots that filled the sky, and blood sprayed everywhere.","After a while, the body of Emperor El-Nino Monster reformed.","At this moment, Emperor El-Nino Monster was no longer as high-spirited as when he had just defeated Emperor Flame. He had felt that he had the world under his control.","At that time, Emperor El-Nino Monster did not take Dao Lord Emperor Chu seriously. In his heart, Chu Yunfan’s previous battle prowess was just bullying his father because he was too old and could not fight for a long time. His father was already so old that the burning energy and blood could only be maintained for a period of time.","Emperor El-Nino Monster was sealed back then and did not see this battle. After breaking out of the seal, although he heard the old subordinates of Emperor Skyquake Monster mention it, he still did not take it seriously.","It was only now that he realized how terrifying Chu Yunfan was.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even show himself, but he was severely injured with one palm and died a tragic death.","Chu Yunfan even had the ability to kill him.","“Are you trying to say that if you had killed me just now, I would have died?” Emperor El-Nino Monster roared. His true body, which was tens of thousands of miles long, was faintly discernible. He was furious.","“It’s not easy to achieve Dao, so I’m allowing you to leave!” Chu Yunfan’s words came from inside Dao Haven.","Emperor El-Nino Monster still wanted to fight, but he no longer had the heart to do so. He could only turn around and flee.","This battle spread throughout the myriad worlds in the shortest time possible. Chu Yunfan’s name once again shook the world.","The title of the number one Emperor since ancient times was something that very few people dared to deny.","After all, Emperor El-Nino Monster was not weak. He was a terrifying existence that could defeat Emperor Flame.","But in front of Chu Yunfan, he couldn’t even block one move. One could imagine how much shock this battle had given everyone.","From then on, no one dared to challenge Chu Yunfan’s authority, and since then, Emperor El-Nino Monster had gone far away.","Many years later, the Emperors of the Ancient Realm welcomed an explosion.","Ten!","A hundred!","Five hundred!","Countless Emperors attained Dao,","In the ten thousand years that followed, countless Emperors attained Dao!","Everyone discovered that the further one went, the easier it became to become a Emperor. The Heavenly Dao was completed. Everyone felt this point. Becoming an Emperor was much, much easier than ten thousand years ago.","At this moment, some people already understood Chu Yunfan’s plan. The more people who attained Dao, the more complete the Heavenly Dao would be.","And the more complete the Heavenly Dao, the easier it was to attain Dao.","As the number of Emperors increased, the Ancient Realm also expanded.","Ten thousand years later, after Chu Yunfan’s relentless repairs, the Ancient Realm had regained its glory from the ancient times.","On this day, a vast pressure rushed into the sky and enveloped the entire Ancient Realm and the myriad worlds.","Everyone could sense a mysterious existence!","Someone had achieved Dao. This Dao was not the ordinary Emperor Dao, but a more majestic and vigorous existence.","Someone had become a God!","Although no one had ever become a God before, everyone had this feeling.","Someone had become a God!"]},{"number":2555,"title":"Chapter 2555: The Grand Ending","paragraphs":["Chapter 2555: The Grand Ending","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the Ancient Realm, outside Dao Haven, on a towering 10,000-meter-tall mountain, Chu Yunfan stood with his hands behind his back. He was wearing an imperial robe. Although he looked young, his eyes were filled with vicissitudes.","“I’m a God now.”","Chu Yunfan had finally become a God!","He could clearly feel that his life level was transforming crazily. He was constantly drawing powerful energy from the void to replenish his body.","He was only ten thousand years old now. Among the Emperors, such an age could be said to be in the prime of life!","The Emperor’s long life spanned tens of thousands of years!","It was a mysterious realm!","However, breaking through was not as difficult as he had imagined. There was no threshold either. It was completely logical for him to break through to this level.","To be more precise, he had started this plan 10,000 years ago. He had continuously nurtured Emperors and perfected their Great Dao to make up for the shortcomings of his own Great Dao.","In his mind, the godhead extended out 3,000 different Great Daos. They were like a dense spider web that spread across the sky.","Every Great Dao represented a ruler who had reached the extreme.","Currently, in the Ancient Realm, the number of Emperors was about the same as the number of half-Emperors. They were too dense.","Among them, Dao Lord Emperor Chu was publicly acknowledged as the number one in the world. No one could shake his position.","Thousands of years ago, hundreds of Emperors had participated in the rebellion. They were dissatisfied with Chu Yunfan’s position above their heads, even though Chu Yunfan rarely appeared and only focused on repairing the Ancient Realm and the Great Dao.","But to them, Chu Yunfan was an eyesore.","Hundreds of Emperors launched a surprise attack. Only a few Emperors from Dao Haven were guarding the city. The others were far away and could not make it in time.","However, even under such circumstances, Chu Yunfan personally defeated these hundreds of Emperors easily. He dealt with them like an adult dealing with children.","Hundreds of Emperors could not even withstand a single blow from Chu Yunfan. From then on, Chu Yunfan’s invincible status was established in the world.","Dao Haven that he had passed down had produced many Emperors and became the most powerful faction in the world.","In the Ancient Realm, it was as if they had returned to the ancient times. It was not uncommon for many Emperors to form alliances, and there were even some disputes between them.","However, they did not dare to fight because Chu Yunfan would not allow them to die before he completed his Great Dao.","It was easier said than done to nurture an Emperor, so how could he let them die?","Moreover, they did not dare to stop the Emperor from attaining Dao, especially the experts under them, who were nurtured with all their might.","This was an era where even Emperors needed an alliance to survive. It was different from the era where Emperors could go solo.","The reason was the existence of Dao Haven. Although many people who did not belong to Dao Haven had become Emperors, Dao Haven had Chu Yunfan’s guidance. It could be said that it was blessed by the heavens, and naturally, Emperors appeared one after another.","This also made the other Emperors feel immense pressure. They had no choice but to join forces and form an alliance to protect themselves.","Especially Chu Yunfan’s strength, which made countless Emperors feel as if there was a fishbone stuck in their throats. In the battle thousands of years ago, Chu Yunfan defeated hundreds of Emperors in one go, which made countless Emperors terrified.","Although Chu Yunfan didn’t kill these Emperors in the end, he didn’t let them off easily. He captured them and filled the Dragon Veins in various places.","With the strength of an Emperor, he could use it as the Dragon Veins of the Ancient Realm. He could use the power of an Emperor to stabilize the Ancient Realm that Chu Yunfan had repaired and expanded.","For a time, the world was silent like cicadas in winter!","Everyone understood that the Emperors could make 99% of the decisions in the world, but they still had a head honcho.","There were even some Emperors who saw Chu Yunfan’s attack. They even suspected that their position as Emperors was a free gift.","They were both Emperors, but why was there such a huge difference in strength?","Later on, many people no longer called Chu Yunfan Emperor Chu, but simply called him Dao Lord.","That was what everyone tacitly agreed to, a level that was above Emperors!","There were even many people who guessed whether Chu Yunfan had already become a God. Now, everyone knew that Chu Yunfan had not become a God before, and only now did he finally become a God.","After becoming a God, there were no more secrets in Chu Yunfan’s eyes. Everything was clear to him.","He even saw a long river that came from the unknown and went to the distant unknown.","It was none other than the River of Time!","Chu Yunfan saw the long River of Time that belonged to this universe!","Time was irreversible. What happened was what happened, and what didn’t happen was what didn’t happen!","But now, in front of Chu Yunfan, everything was different. Time could be reversed. As long as he stepped on this River of Time, he could reverse time and go to the past and the future.","He was an omniscient and omnipotent existence.","Chu Yunfan looked into the distance. He saw the previous era. After the collapse of the ancient times, countless worlds collapsed and the era of the ten Emperors.","He looked forward again and saw a figure in the shocking battle at the end of the ancient times. It was none other than the Alchemy Emperor.","The Alchemy Emperor was beaten back step by step. At this time, the godhead fell from the sky. Under the circumstances that no one expected, a large hand reached down, grabbed the godhead, and placed it into the Mountain River Diagram.","The person who intervened was none other than Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, he finally understood the reason why the Alchemy Emperor had managed to obtain the godhead in the last years of the Antiquity Age, and even accurately took the Mountain River Diagram away with the godhead and escaped into the void. Even the Emperors could not predict the existence of the Mountain River Diagram.","It was not because he was lucky, but because of the interference from the later generations.","This period of history formed a closed loop!","“So this is how history is formed. Interesting, interesting!” Chu Yunfan laughed out loud. He could interfere with history at will, and he didn’t have to worry that his interference would cause him to disappear in the future.","He was already omniscient and omnipotent. He was omnipresent in this timeline, so he did not have to worry about the grandfather paradox.","Chu Yunfan’s gaze became more and more far-reaching. He even stepped on the light and headed upstream of the River of Time.","When he arrived at the early immemorial era, it was still an era where many ferocious beasts ran amok. Chu Yunfan stopped and destroyed these powerful ferocious beasts. Under the expectations of the ancient ancestors who were waiting to be fed, he opened a forum to preach and spread the Dao, skills, and divine arts.","A cultivation civilization rose because of him, a civilization that was completely different from the previous beast civilization.","The name “Dao Lord” had quietly spread throughout the antiquity era. All of the Great Daos had been passed down by him, and they were all related to him.","After completing this timeline, Chu Yunfan did not stop and went straight to the upper reaches of the timeline.","That was the immemorial era occupied by even more ancient and obscure monsters.","He had seen all kinds of fierce beasts, some of which were even comparable to Emperor-level monsters.","Chu Yunfan continued forward and came to the end of the timeline.","What shocked Chu Yunfan was that at the end of the timeline, there was a thatched cottage. In front of the thatched cottage was a stone tablet, a wordless Dao tablet.","“You’re finally here, Dao Lord. I’ve been waiting for you for a long time.” A figure slowly walked out of the thatched cottage.","This person was dressed in a green robe and had a delicate face. Every move he made seemed to be compatible with the world.","“May I know your name, Brother?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“My name? It’s been too long, hundreds of eras, and they all call me Martial Lord!” The man smiled and said. “I haven’t congratulated you yet. You’ve transcended and become one of us Transcendents.”","Chu Yunfan looked at the man in front of him in shock.","However, he also saw that in front of the thatched cottage was a huge crystal wall system.","In front of the crystal wall system, countless strange creatures were attacking the crystal wall system. The crystal wall system seemed to be on the verge of collapse.","At the same time, he also saw an old man in a green robe wave his hand, and billions of strange creatures disappeared without a trace.","There was also a black-robed youth who wielded a longsword. With a sweep of his sword, a destructive green lotus destroyed the heavens and earth. In an instant, countless strange creatures were wiped out.","“This...” Chu Yunfan looked at the endless strange creatures. There were countless powerful existences that could be compared to Emperors among them.","“It’s been so many epochs since a Transcendent was born. I finally understand how you felt when you saw me!” the green-robed elder said to Martial Lord.","“May I ask what a Transcendent is?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“Transcendents are existences that have transcended the world, the universe, all laws, and all rules. To put it simply, they are existences that have transcended beyond the Three Realms and are no longer within the Five Elements!” Martial Lord said. “You should have sensed it after becoming a God, right? Being able to walk freely on the timeline and even follow the timeline to come here is transcendence. Those who are not bound by time, space, and everything else are Transcendents!”","“May I ask how many Transcendents there are now?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“Including you, there are only four,” Martial Lord said with a smile. “The oldest is Old Creator!” Martial Lord pointed at the green-robed elder. He then pointed at the black-robed youth and said, “That’s Lord Qin. I’m Martial Lord. Including you, Dao Lord, there are four of us!","“Countless worlds, universes, and epochs have gone through reincarnation cycles, but only four Transcendents have ever been born. They attained their own Dao, and then you have too. It’s been countless years, and your world has been restarted countless times before you finally Transcended!”","Chu Yunfan finally understood how difficult it was to become a Transcendent.","“Fellow Daoist, we’ll talk about this later. The war is coming!” As Martial Lord spoke, he looked at the other end of the crystal wall system. Countless terrifying creatures had arrived outside the crystal wall system.","Chu Yunfan felt his blood boil. “Count me in!”","[The End.]"]}]);
